(27877, 3, 0, 27205, 'You don''t mind me checking out your merchandise for signs of tampering, do you?'),
(27888, 3, 0, 24890, 'For Dalaran! Attack!'),
(27907, 3, 0, 27257, 'Well, guess I should load everything back into the cart.'),
(27913, 0, 0, 27643, 'Scourge forces have been spotted near the Market Row Gate!'),
(27913, 0, 0, 27646, 'Scourge forces have been spotted near the Town Hall!'),
(27913, 3, 0, 27642, 'Scourge forces have been spotted near the King''s Square fountain!'),
(27914, 3, 0, 27295, 'I have arrived. Shall we set to work, then?'),
(27915, 3, 0, 29168, 'We meet again, time traveller!'),
(27975, 0, 0, 29563, 'You shouldn''t have come... now you will die!'),
(27975, 1, 0, 29570, 'So much lost time... that you''ll never get back!'),
(27975, 2, 0, 29574, 'I hope you all rot! I never... wanted... this.'),
(27977, 0, 0, 94308, 'Crush... you...'),
(27977, 1, 0, 29559, 'Break.... you....'),
(27977, 2, 0, 29558, 'Ha.... ha... hah....'),
(27977, 3, 0, 29560, 'Uuuuhhhhhhhhhh......'),
(27978, 0, 0, 29582, 'Soft, vulnerable shells. Brief fragile lives. You cannot escape the curse of flesh!'),
(27978, 1, 0, 29586, 'Loken will not rest... until the forge is retaken! You change... nothing!'),
(28006, 0, 0, 27407, 'Hear me, minions! Hear your lord, Antiok! Double your efforts or pay the consequences of failure!'),
(28016, 3, 0, 27954, 'Ya surpassed my greatest hopes.'),
(28016, 3, 0, 27933, 'Ahh,  Back in Drak''Tharon at last!'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28118, 'For your efforts, you be gettin'' da greatest of rewards....'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28120, 'Be still, friend, and behold da truth of things!'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28127, 'With da help of these mortals, dis region been cleansed of all who oppose us.'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28424, 'Follow dis path, mon, and soon you be tastin'' immortality!'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28125, 'Master, my mission be complete.'),
(28016, 3, 0, 27934, 'Drakuru casts his gaze down on Drak''Tharon Keep.'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28423, 'You see for yourself now. Da Lich King be generous to dem who obey.'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28422, 'I be needin'' worthy underlings in Zul''Drak, mon. Ones ready to wield real power.'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28421, 'Ya needed ta prove yer worthiness....'),
(28016, 3, 0, 27935, 'Ya done well, mon....'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28419, 'As you wish, master.'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28420, 'Forgive my deception, mon. It all been for your own good.'),
(28016, 3, 0, 28119, 'Revelation!');
INSERT INTO `tmp_fix_creature_text` VALUES
(28028, 4, 0, 27794, 'Light save me!'),
(28029, 3, 0, 140174, 'Aid me!'),
(28033, 3, 0, 29880, 'And there she is, the Spirit of Gnomeregan!'),
(28033, 3, 0, 29878, 'Finally, we have the parts to repair the Spirit of Gnomeregan.'),
(28033, 3, 0, 29879, 'Let''s see, just a tweak here and an adjustment there...'),
(28033, 3, 0, 29881, 'You can use her, but I don''t want to hear any complaints about saw blades in your seat. I had to fix ''er with what we could find.'),
(28043, 3, 0, 27733, 'Crusader! Take this wood and light a fire for the troops.'),
(28048, 0, 0, 114420, 'Yarrrrr! Thar be Ol'' Eary, terror of the open seas! Now''s our chance boys, git ''em!'),
(28070, 0, 0, 30524, 'Time to get some answers! Let''s get this show on the road!'),
(28070, 1, 0, 30523, 'Take a moment and relish this with me. Soon... all will be revealed. Okay then, let''s do this!'),
(28070, 2, 0, 30552, 'Now keep an eye out! I''ll have this licked in two shakes of a--'),
(28070, 3, 0, 30553, 'Oh, that doesn''t sound good. We might have a complication or two...'),
(28070, 4, 0, 30554, 'Ah, you want to play hardball, eh? That''s just my game!'),
(28070, 5, 0, 30555, 'Couple more minutes and I''ll--'),
(28070, 6, 0, 30556, 'Heightened? What''s the good news?'),
(28070, 7, 0, 30557, 'So that was the problem? Now I''m makin'' progress...'),
(28070, 8, 0, 30558, 'Hang on! Nobody''s gonna'' be sanitized as long as I have a say in it!'),
(28070, 9, 0, 30559, 'Ha! The old magic fingers finally won through! Now let''s get down to--'),
(28070, 10, 0, 30560, 'Purge? No no no no no.. where did I-- Aha, this should do the trick...'),
(28070, 11, 0, 30565, 'Query? What do you think I''m here for, tea and biscuits? Spill the beans already!'),
(28070, 12, 0, 33003, 'You''re right, I can come back to this later. I think it''s time to see what''s behind the door near the entrance. I''m going to sneak over there, nice and quiet. Meet me at the door and I''ll get us in.'),
(28070, 13, 0, 31555, 'Don''t worry! Ol'' Brann''s got yer back! Keep that metal monstrosity busy, and I''ll see if I can''t sweet talk this machine into helping ye!'),
(28070, 14, 0, 27589, 'This is a wee bit trickier than before... Oh, bloody--incomin''!'),
(28070, 15, 0, 27590, 'What in the name o'' Madoran did THAT do? Oh! Wait: I just about got it...'),
(28070, 16, 0, 27591, 'Ha, that did it! Help''s a-comin''! Take this, ya glowin'' iron brute!'),
(28070, 17, 0, 28591, 'Loken?! That''s downright bothersome... We might''ve neutralized the iron dwarves, but I''d lay odds there''s another machine somewhere else churnin'' out a whole mess o'' these iron vrykul!'),
(28070, 18, 0, 30584, 'I''ll use the forge to make batches o'' earthen to stand guard... But our greatest challenge still remains: find and stop Loken!'),
(28118, 3, 0, 27501, 'You dare summon me?!'),
(28118, 3, 0, 27502, 'Prepare to drown!'),
(28136, 3, 0, 27521, 'Thank you, friend. Were it not for your aid I would be no more.'),
(28142, 3, 0, 27523, '<sigh>... Well, I suppose it could be worse.'),
(28148, 3, 0, 27528, 'I am in your debt, friend. Thank you for my life.'),
(28167, 3, 0, 40793, 'Did you see that?'),
(28169, 3, 0, 27552, 'Oh, no...'),
(28213, 0, 0, 27607, 'The %s screams with rage and rushes to the aid of her babies.'),
(28214, 3, 0, 27992, 'You just watch slave thing, Goregek take care of these hardknuckles!'),
(28255, 3, 0, 27672, 'Drakkari, this will not stop us from stealing the power of your wild gods. We will take it from them directly, or from you if you''ve already killed them; it matters not.'),
(28255, 3, 0, 27674, 'If you kill them, I will simply reanimate their corpses. And when you die, I will do the same to you.'),
(28255, 3, 0, 27669, 'Destroy the Drakkari! Destroy the Argent Crusade! Make Scourge of them all!'),
(28255, 3, 0, 27673, 'Many Argent Dawn are numbered amongst the simpletons that have fallen before me. The Argent Crusade will prove no different.'),
(28255, 3, 0, 27670, 'My beautiful Kolramas! You will all pay dearly for this outrage!'),
(28255, 3, 0, 27671, 'Come fools, meet your doom! I''m waiting.'),
(28255, 3, 0, 27676, 'Undeath is inevitable!'),
(28257, 3, 0, 27629, 'Finally you know your true destiny.'),
(28266, 3, 0, 27638, 'All of Northrend is colder than a witch''s heart; yet here we are...  There must be some explanation!  Quite possibly one related to the crystal pillars!'),
(28266, 3, 0, 27641, 'How long until we can have another pilot airborne?  I need aerial surveys if my research is going to get anywhere.'),
(28284, 3, 0, 27735, 'ACK! Oh no, I webbed myself! It''s sticky. MY HAIR!'),
(28284, 3, 0, 27734, 'Oh, these are sticky! I wonder how they shoot the webbing?'),
(28340, 3, 0, 27811, 'Ah, you''ve finally arrived Prince Arthas. You''re here just in the nick of time.'),
(28347, 0, 0, 27805, 'Then put twice as much in next time!'),
(28347, 2, 0, 27807, 'Remember, kid: You''re always more wrong than you think you are. Double It!'),
(28355, 3, 0, 27808, 'I''m working on it, I just don''t want to sell it until I''m happy with it. It shouldn''t be long.'),
(28357, 3, 0, 27866, 'You have been measured and found wanting...\n'),
(28375, 3, 0, 27829, 'So long, suckers. I''m out of here!'),
