(28912, 6, 0, 29210, 'The High Inquisitor comes! Be ready, death knight! Do not let him draw you out of the protective bounds of my anti-magic field! Kill him and take his head!'),
(28912, 7, 0, 29239, 'The death of the High Inquisitor of New Avalon will not go unnoticed. You need to get out of here at once! Go, before more of them show up. I''ll be fine on my own.'),
