(44293, 4, 0, 44988, 'Some sort of rituals were performed at this altar. It looks like a kind of pagan initiation ritual that Velen once told me about. Bloody. Disgusting.'),
(44293, 5, 0, 44989, 'Who do you think - wait - $n, look out behind you!'),
(44293, 6, 0, 45004, 'Look out - I see another!'),
(44293, 7, 0, 45005, 'Fight them back - I can''t hold this shield up much longer!'),
(44293, 8, 0, 45006, '$n, you did it. It looks like they''re fleeing.'),
(44293, 9, 0, 45017, 'Hey $n, we don''t have to tell my father about that little ambush. If he finds out about an attempt on my life, he''d never allow me out of that keep...'),
(44293, 10, 0, 45027, 'This is the place. Samuelson''s files should be on the third floor, all the way up the spiral staircase.'),
(44293, 11, 0, 45028, 'Here we go. Nobody here will question it if the Prince wants to glance through some files.'),
(44293, 12, 0, 76105, 'Hrm...'),
(44293, 13, 0, 45030, 'This is all wrong. There''s nothing in here about the Twilight''s Hammer. What is Samuelson playing at?'),
(44293, 14, 0, 45059, 'I''ll go back to the throne room and keep an eye on Samuelson while you speak with Mathias. Stay safe!'),
(44323, 4, 0, 46677, 'Your life is forfeit.'),
(44365, 0, 0, 44695, 'Where is that ogre-headed buffoon?'),
(44365, 1, 0, 44696, 'Ah, speak of the devil...'),
(44365, 2, 0, 44701, 'Warchief, so glad you could make it.'),
(44365, 3, 0, 44702, 'With the death of the Lich King, many of the more intelligent Scourge became... unemployed. Those ''fiends,'' as you so delicately put it, are called val''kyr. They are under my command now...'),
(44365, 4, 0, 44703, '...and they are part of the reason that I asked to see you.'),
(44365, 6, 0, 44706, 'As a race, we Forsaken are unable to procreate.'),
(44365, 7, 0, 44707, 'With the aid of the val''kyr, we are now able to take the corpses of the fallen and create new Forsaken.'),
(44365, 8, 0, 44709, 'Agatha, show the Warchief!'),
(44365, 9, 0, 44715, 'Warchief, without these new Forsaken my people would die out... Our hold upon Gilneas and northern Lordaeron would crumble.'),
(44365, 10, 0, 44718, 'Isn''t it obvious, Warchief? I serve the Horde.'),
(44402, 3, 0, 79085, 'Farewell, Charlga. May the earth mother watch over you.'),
(44412, 0, 0, 44570, 'As a final act of revenge, Baron Geddon has made you a living bomb!  Move away from your allies!'),
(44418, 0, 0, 44593, 'The Bile-O-Tron springs to life and begins to emit a foul smelling substance.'),
(44418, 1, 0, 48794, 'The Bile-O-Tron signals in the affirmative and shuts down permanently.'),
(44436, 3, 0, 45501, 'Good day.'),
(44441, 0, 0, 45160, 'Farewell, $n.  Send my regards to the good men and women at the Menders'' Stead.'),
(44451, 0, 0, 444510, 'Koltira! Your queen summons you!'),
(44451, 1, 0, 444511, 'Enough of this insolence. Do you think that I''m blind to everything that goes on outside of the Undercity?'),
(44451, 2, 0, 444512, 'No thanks to you. Andorhal should have been ours days ago, when we defeated the Scourge.'),
(44451, 3, 0, 444513, 'I know your secret, Koltira. I''m aware of your friendship with the Alliance death knight, Thassarian.'),
(44451, 4, 0, 444514, 'Arthas clearly failed when he created his death knights. You are still weak.'),
(44451, 5, 0, 444515, 'Fortunately, I have agents that can help you... erase this weakness. Beneath the Undercity you go.'),
(44451, 6, 0, 444516, 'Shh, quiet, death knight. When I''m finished with you, your fear will be gone.'),
(44451, 7, 0, 444517, 'You can thank me later.'),
(44452, 0, 0, 143151, 'For the Horde!'),
(44453, 0, 0, 146212, 'For the Alliance!'),
(44453, 3, 0, 45516, 'Gandling is strong, but do not worry.  I will join you shortly after you begin to fight him.'),
(44454, 3, 0, 45488, 'I will need some time to study these samples, $n.  I will speak to you again when I have completed my analysis.'),
(44629, 0, 0, 44699, 'This better be important, Sylvanas. You know how I detest this place and its foul stench. Why have you called for me?'),
(44629, 1, 0, 44700, 'And more importantly, what are those Scourge fiends doing here?'),
(44629, 2, 0, 44704, 'Get on with it, Sylvanas.'),
(44629, 3, 0, 44714, 'What you have done here, Sylvanas... it goes against the laws of nature. Disgusting is the only word I have to describe it.'),
(44629, 4, 0, 44716, 'Have you given any thought to what this means, Sylvanas?'),
(44629, 5, 0, 44717, 'What difference is there between you and the Lich King now?'),
(44629, 6, 0, 44719, 'Watch your clever mouth, bitch.'),
(44629, 7, 0, 44720, 'Cromush, you stay behind and make sure the Banshee Queen is well "guarded." I will be expecting a full report when next we meet.'),
(44629, 8, 0, 44721, 'Remember, Sylvanas, eventually we all have to stand before our maker and face judgment. Your day may come sooner than others''....'),
(44734, 3, 0, 44797, 'ALL ABOARD! Last stop: The Forsaken Front!'),
(44773, 3, 0, 130191, 'Yes!'),
(44807, 3, 0, 109770, '%s gasps.'),
(44814, 1, 0, 50441, 'Do you not feel the master''s gaze?! It watches us all!'),
(44814, 1, 0, 50447, 'I will prove myself to the master!'),
(44814, 1, 0, 50446, 'Embrace the coming of the end!'),
(44814, 1, 0, 50449, 'Biting... clawing... clutching... tearing...'),
(44815, 1, 0, 50448, 'Whispers... whispers... I can hear the whispers....'),
(44816, 2, 0, 45113, 'The Black Bishop''s shields dissipate as the wretched traitor breathes his last.'),
(44816, 2, 0, 45105, 'Pawn ... takes ... bishop ...'),
(44816, 3, 0, 45117, 'The game is afoot! But you are a mere pawn, whereas I am ... THE BLACK BISHOP!'),
(44816, 4, 0, 45103, 'Check!'),
(44816, 4, 0, 45101, 'The Bishop moves diagonally!'),
(44816, 4, 0, 45102, 'Bishop threatens pawn...'),
(44843, 3, 0, 44920, 'Your presence is not welcome here, Amnennar.'),
(44853, 3, 0, 74888, 'I... I can''t! I won''t!'),
(44866, 3, 0, 102992, 'Is everything alright?'),
(44872, 3, 0, 120360, 'Hail Farseer $n, chosen keeper of the Doomhammer!'),
(44872, 3, 0, 120361, 'The Doomhammer suits you, $n. Keep it well.'),
(44895, 1, 0, 82716, 'AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!'),
(45027, 3, 0, 45176, 'This is the Temple of Earth.  It''s the most important structure in Deepholm.'),
(45027, 3, 0, 45182, 'It was shattered when Deathwing broke through the dome above and created the rift between the two worlds.  All of Deepholm is going to collapse into Azeroth if we do not put the World Pillar back together.'),
(45027, 3, 0, 45175, 'You made it!  Good!'),
(45027, 3, 0, 45187, 'We''ve taken control of the temple and we''re containing as much of the damage as we can.  Go inside and speak to Maruut; he''s in charge.'),
(45027, 3, 0, 45191, 'We are all counting on you.'),
(45027, 3, 0, 45180, 'There was once a Titan-made stone inside.  It was known as the World Pillar.  The name was literal.  It bore the weight of all the elemental and magnetic forces in Deepholm.'),
(45027, 3, 0, 45186, 'The first fragment was going to be delivered to us by a Horde gunship known as the Storm''s Fury.  It never made it here.'),
(45028, 3, 0, 45171, 'Let us hope Thrall and the others can contain it while you''re inside.'),
(45028, 3, 0, 45169, 'I hope you have a strong stomach.  Travelling through the breach is not for the weak.'),
(45028, 3, 0, 45170, 'We''re at the center of the Maelstrom, the rift between Deepholm and Azeroth.  Watch as it threatens to tear your world apart!'),
(45028, 3, 0, 45172, 'This is it!  Brace yourself!'),
(45099, 0, 0, 45238, 'Deepholm? I hate this place. Wait... you''re not Initiate Goldmine!'),
(45099, 1, 0, 45239, 'I know what you''re after. I can sense it!'),
(45099, 2, 0, 45240, 'This is not in my contract! Die, $r!'),
(45099, 3, 0, 45236, 'NOOOOOO! You tell Goldmine he''s a dead goblin! Our contract is over!'),
(45112, 0, 0, 451120, 'Your highness. I deliver to you... Andorhal.'),
(45112, 2, 0, 451122, 'Y... your majesty...'),
(45112, 3, 0, 451123, 'No!'),
(45155, 0, 0, 50336, 'MOLDFANG STRONG!'),
(45168, 0, 0, 45562, 'More artillery... more! I never liked peninsulas.'),
(45212, 1, 0, 45366, 'You want to fight?  Alright, Gory fight.'),
(45212, 4, 0, 45367, 'Gory give up!  You farmers fight more good!'),
(45246, 0, 0, 45449, 'Kneel, Alliance!  Kneel before the might of the Forsaken!'),
(45329, 3, 0, 45606, 'You''ve done it, heroes! Stratholme is ours! Come, we wait just outside the Slaughterhouse!'),
(45377, 0, 0, 45529, 'Bwaaaah! You no take da treasure!!!'),
(45377, 1, 0, 45544, 'Bwagauugh!!! Augh feed you to da crocs!!!'),
(45412, 0, 0, 6289, 'The Ash''ari Crystals have been destroyed! The Slaughterhouse is vulnerable!'),
(45412, 1, 0, 6398, 'So you see fit to toy with the Lich King''s creations? Ramstein, be sure to give the intruders a proper greeting.'),
(45412, 2, 0, 6401, 'Time to take matters into my own hands. Come. Enter my domain and challenge the might of the Scourge!'),
(45412, 3, 0, 6511, '%s raises an undead servant back to life!'),
(45412, 4, 0, 6512, '%s attempts to cast Death Pact on his servants!'),
(45417, 3, 0, 46090, 'By the way, you''re welcome to borrow any supplies you find inside the caravan... as long as you bring them back when you''re done!'),
(45431, 0, 0, 46103, 'What''s the holdup, Fiona?'),
(45431, 3, 0, 46101, 'Why haven''t we left yet?  I''m ready to head off on my own if we don''t get going.'),
(45445, 4, 0, 50400, 'Wow. Is it just me, or did that one die really fast?'),
(45447, 3, 0, 45611, 'Thank you for the gifts. Let us see if you are worthy, $c!'),
(45574, 0, 0, 45708, 'Now, brothers!  Attack the $r!'),
(45612, 0, 0, 44713, 'ABBERATION!'),
(45612, 1, 0, 44738, 'As you command, Warchief!'),
(45704, 0, 0, 46485, '%s realizes it''s been spotted and quickly plays dead!'),
(45847, 3, 0, 46503, 'You''re doing well... you''re going to be fine.'),
(45941, 0, 0, 45602, 'Here we are!'),
(45941, 3, 0, 45596, 'There''s a tower coming up on our left.  What do you say we stop and rest a bit?'),
(45966, 3, 0, 46382, 'We have to break through those mindless leper gnomes if we want to get out of here alive!'),
(46083, 0, 0, 9793, '%s flinches as its skin shimmers.'),
(46173, 0, 0, 45579, 'Who says you won the bet?  We haven''t compared tallies yet.'),
(46173, 3, 0, 45595, 'Maybe now I don''t want to.  Maybe I like it better sitting back here with my new friend.  It smells like horses up there.'),
(46176, 3, 0, 46695, 'Come back, Beak! Don''t get hurt!'),
(46176, 3, 0, 46696, 'Beak! No more hiding. Come out right now!'),
(46178, 0, 0, 45582, 'I''m going to bet that you only killed four.'),
(46178, 3, 0, 45592, 'I''m dead serious.  I''ve completely forgotten.'),
(46191, 0, 0, 46270, 'Why do I have to sit up top with all the stuff?!'),
(46194, 0, 0, 46294, 'Light''s Hope isn''t far, young paladin.  Might I suggest walking?'),
(46200, 0, 0, 46317, 'I wouldn''t say that it''s your fault, Tarenar.  But don''t let that stop you from saving Gidwin.'),
(46254, 1, 0, 46474, 'Forest just setback!'),
(46254, 4, 0, 46631, 'Hogger enrages!'),
(46254, 4, 0, 46476, 'Yiiipe!'),
(46264, 3, 0, 46487, 'ALL MUST BURN!'),
(46264, 4, 0, 46489, 'FIRE... EXTINGUISHED!'),
(46320, 3, 0, 47135, 'Dragonmaw attack! Protect the High Shaman.'),
(46322, 1, 0, 50453, 'Excellent, another stone to grind!'),
(46371, 1, 0, 46416, 'Hear the call... serve him... join ussssssssssss...'),
(46375, 1, 0, 46460, 'Kill this fool, or Randolph will kill us!'),
(46376, 3, 0, 46465, 'You there - $n! Help us defend this square.'),
(46378, 3, 0, 46547, 'Over the wall, HUP!'),
(46379, 3, 0, 46460, 'Kill this fool, or Randolph will kill us!'),
(46381, 1, 0, 101724, 'Free!'),
(46383, 1, 0, 46495, 'Allow me to introduce myself. I am Randolph Moloch, and I will be killing you all today.'),
(46383, 4, 0, 46630, 'Randolph Moloch vanishes!'),
(46383, 4, 0, 46497, 'My epic schemes, my great plans! Gone!'),
(46409, 3, 0, 46573, 'It''s simply too good to be true. You couldn''t have killed him so easily!'),
(46409, 3, 0, 46571, 'This ends here, Hogger!'),
(46409, 3, 0, 46572, 'He''s...he''s dead? '),
(46482, 3, 0, 46559, 'Egad! My sophisticated heart!'),
(46579, 3, 0, 46703, 'More Elementium! Now!'),
(46579, 4, 0, 46706, 'Don''t let those spiders eat the Elementium!'),
(46605, 3, 0, 46788, 'Yarg!'),
(46648, 3, 0, 46724, 'I expect the highest quality craftmanship from my workforce.  Double your efforts!'),
(46753, 0, 0, 50565, 'Your challenge is accepted, mortals! Know that you face Al''Akir, Elemental Lord of Air! You have no hope of defeating me!'),
(46753, 1, 0, 50584, 'Your futile persistance angers me!'),
(46753, 2, 0, 50587, 'Storms! I summon you to my side!'),
(46753, 6, 0, 50585, 'Enough! I will no longer be contained!'),
(46753, 7, 0, 50580, 'After every storm, comes the calm...'),
(46785, 3, 0, 46888, 'The weapon will soon be completed. The Wildhammer and the Dragonmaw are about to be no more.'),
(46885, 3, 0, 47120, 'Hold your ground. We Wildhammer go down fighting to the end!'),
(46889, 3, 0, 50274, 'The pitiful human escaped!'),
(46935, 3, 0, 46990, 'Whatever, let the fight begin!'),
(46942, 3, 0, 47007, 'This beast leads the Riverpaw gnoll gang and may be the key to ending gnoll aggression in Elwynn.'),
(46942, 3, 0, 47004, 'Hold your blade, adventurer!'),
(46942, 3, 0, 47008, 'We''re taking him into custody in the name of King Varian Wrynn.'),
(46942, 3, 0, 47009, 'Take us to the Stockades, Andromath.'),
(46943, 3, 0, 73158, 'Woo hoo!'),
(46963, 0, 0, 48830, 'Even here I find myself beset by fools!'),
(46963, 1, 0, 48833, 'My new life was just beginning...'),
(46987, 0, 0, 47022, '$n, you have unleashed the wolf ancient and defeated his shadow. Your actions already reverberate across the dream - thank you. But more remains to be done...'),
(46998, 3, 0, 47025, 'So Tortolla has risen to fight at our side. You are wise, $n; it is difficult to earn that ancient''s trust. He will be a stalwart companion.'),
(47002, 3, 0, 47026, 'The guardian of the skies has taken flight again! This is encouraging news, $n. But much remains undone, and we must turn our attention elsewhere...'),
(47006, 1, 0, 47366, 'Your time has finally come, Godfrey!'),
(47006, 2, 0, 47378, 'Attack, my brothers! Make him feel the fury of the pack!'),
(47006, 3, 0, 47384, 'You''d best hurry if you want any of the spoils.'),
(47006, 5, 0, 47404, 'We will stand idle no longer! The time to act is now!'),
(47027, 0, 0, 47158, 'Commander Springvale is down that hall, heroes.'),
(47195, 0, 0, 44485, '$C, over here.'),
(47269, 3, 0, 47698, 'Why you do that?  Why you kill?'),
(47270, 1, 0, 50363, 'Wha... who... GET OUT OF MY DIGSITE!'),
(47271, 1, 0, 50365, 'So you''re the ones causing all that ruckus!'),
(47271, 3, 0, 47398, 'What in hell''s name is going on out here?'),
(47281, 0, 0, 47405, 'Look out spider!  Here come Lunk!'),
(47281, 0, 0, 47406, 'Lunk ride spider now!'),
(47281, 0, 0, 107235, 'Hahahaha!'),
(47281, 0, 0, 47407, 'Spider tummy time!'),
(47281, 1, 0, 47416, 'Here, you can scrape venom off Lunk''s tummy.'),
(47281, 1, 0, 47414, 'Spider left some venom on Lunk''s tummy.  You want?'),
(47281, 3, 0, 47411, 'I got some venom for you.'),
(47281, 3, 0, 47408, 'You hold still, spider!'),
(47281, 3, 0, 47412, 'Lunk got you some venom with his tummy.'),
(47281, 3, 0, 47409, 'Lunk will ride you now!'),
(47281, 3, 0, 47699, 'You stop killing now!  Lunk doesn''t like!');
INSERT INTO `tmp_fix_creature_text` VALUES
(47299, 0, 0, 47425, 'Lunk going to find some real adventures!'),
(47299, 0, 0, 47424, 'Lunk tired of all this killing!  Lunk quits!'),
(47301, 0, 0, 47691, 'Nothing to offer, except your backs and your shovels.  So you will dig.'),
(47301, 3, 0, 47692, 'Dig wide, dig deep.  Seek out the places of fire beneath the world.  My brothers and sisters yearn to be free.'),
(47301, 3, 0, 47693, 'Succeed, and you may ascend after all.  Fail, and burn.'),
(47301, 3, 0, 47690, 'You dwarves are worthless!  You come to Ragnaros seeking ascendance, but you have nothing to offer!'),
(47309, 1, 0, 47704, 'You will suffer!  You will face the wrath of the Twilight''s Hammer!'),
(47324, 0, 0, 50894, 'Victory in Tol Barad is ours! While the Horde offensive is crippled, we need your immediate efforts to gather resources and secure the island!'),
(47333, 3, 0, 47529, 'Sitting easier than killing.'),
(47333, 3, 0, 47528, 'You take dwarf''s things.  No need to kill.'),
(47333, 3, 0, 47525, 'Here, I stealed this from little dwarf.'),
(47333, 3, 0, 47527, 'Here, you can have dwarf''s things.'),
(47333, 3, 0, 111531, 'Fine.'),
(47335, 0, 0, 50895, 'Victory in Tol Barad is ours! While the Alliance offensive is crippled, we need your immediate efforts to gather resources and secure the island!'),
(47339, 0, 0, 47550, 'Right in the face! Ow ow ow...'),
(47442, 0, 0, 47682, 'Johnny Awesome has arrived, philistine. Present me with your menial tasks so that I may complete them with only mild enthusiasm and most likely a complete disregard for any directions that you provide that are more complicated than what my map is able to display.'),
(47442, 1, 0, 47689, 'I will do this ONE thing that you ask of me, quest giver. Pray I find more menial tasks to accomplish or you will be hearing from me again and I assure you that my commentary on forums of public opinion will be most unkind.'),
(47443, 0, 0, 47668, 'CAN YOU SMELL WHAT THE LOK''TAR IS COOKIN''?!'),
(47443, 1, 0, 47669, 'HAH! Looks like you''re running out of idiots to put atop this horse, Darthalia. This is the puniest one yet.'),
(47443, 2, 0, 47670, 'What have you got for me today, weakling?! Point me to where the Alliance hide and I shall DOMINATE THEM!'),
(47443, 3, 0, 47679, 'Yes, cowardly quest giver, sit atop your pale horse while Orkus brings glory to the Horde! I shall return with a thousand skulls!'),
(47444, 0, 0, 47660, 'HI! HI! HELP!'),
(47444, 1, 0, 47665, 'NORTH! GOT IT! THANKS! BYE! THANKS!'),
(47462, 8, 0, 50366, 'The flames of Ragnaros will burn you all.'),
(47462, 9, 0, 47654, '%s is weakened!  Banish him now!'),
(47462, 10, 0, 47656, 'NOOOOOO!  THIS CANNOT BE!  I... AM... IMMORTAL...!'),
(47467, 3, 0, 47787, 'Clear the terrace for landing!  Shoot at Cauldron Defenders!'),
(47724, 1, 0, 50458, 'Storms of the sky, obey the call of the Twilight''s Hammer!'),
(47733, 1, 0, 48017, 'Are you certain of that, demon hunter? Are you certain your will is your own?'),
(47733, 2, 0, 48019, 'Come then. You''ll find that we''re evenly matched.'),
(47733, 3, 0, 48267, 'The dreadlord who commands this undead army is called Tichondrius.  He controls a powerful warlock artifact called the Skull of Gul''dan.  It is responsible for corrupting these forests.'),
(47735, 1, 0, 48016, 'I am free after ten thousand years, yet still my own brother thinks I am a villain! I''ll show him my true power! I''ll show him that the demons have no hold over me!'),
(47735, 2, 0, 48018, 'You reek of death, human. You''ll regret approaching me.'),
(47735, 3, 0, 48020, 'We could go on fighting like this forever. What is it you truly want?'),
(47735, 4, 0, 48023, 'And you wish for me to steal it. Why?'),
(47735, 5, 0, 48080, 'That is where the skull of Gul''dan is being kept! These paltry demons will not prevent me from claiming it!'),
(47735, 6, 0, 48081, 'Now at least the demons will no longer corrupt the forests. But, if I claim this power as my own, I will become stronger than any of Archimonde''s lieutenants.'),
(47735, 7, 0, 48082, 'Yes... the power should be mine!'),
(47735, 8, 0, 48083, 'Now I am complete!'),
(47779, 3, 0, 48781, 'As you wish.  Just make sure they don''t come to no harm.'),
(47790, 0, 0, 48292, 'See now the product of your meddling!'),
(47790, 1, 0, 48293, 'BURN IN MY HATRED!'),
(47811, 3, 0, 48780, 'Flamestar!  I can return these dragons to their kind.  Let me take care of them.'),
(47819, 1, 0, 48124, 'Let''s see how confident you are against one of your own kind, dreadlord.'),
(47819, 2, 0, 48359, 'It is I, Malfurion. This is what I''ve become.'),
(47819, 3, 0, 48360, 'The leader of the undead has been destroyed, and the forests will heal in time.'),
(47819, 4, 0, 48361, 'So be it... brother.'),
(47900, 1, 0, 48245, 'Somebody shut this little girl up!'),
(47900, 2, 0, 48246, 'Do you want a dolly, little girl? Would that make it better?'),
(47900, 3, 0, 48247, 'KILL ME OR KILL THE GIRL!'),
(47900, 4, 0, 48248, 'Is this Stillwater''s plan? To torture me before he kills me?'),
(47900, 5, 0, 48249, 'WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR STILLWATER! KILL ME! DO IT NOW!'),
(47900, 6, 0, 48250, 'How much longer are you going to cry?'),
(47917, 1, 0, 48362, 'What? Who are... you?'),
(48020, 0, 0, 48309, 'Warden Stillwater, you are deranged and a threat to our way of life. By authority of the Dark Lady herself, I hereby impose upon you the harshest penalty allowed under Forsaken law - true death.'),
(48020, 1, 0, 48310, 'That goes for all of you traitorous scum who supported this fool!'),
(48020, 2, 0, 48311, 'KNEEL!'),
(48021, 0, 0, 48285, 'You''re not leaving me to rot in this place! Take me with you!'),
(48021, 1, 0, 48283, 'TWINKLES! TWINKLES! NOOOOO!!'),
(48021, 2, 0, 48284, 'I won''t let them get away with this, Twinkles. They will pay! They will all pay!'),
(48080, 0, 0, 48306, 'Lydon!? Alive?'),
(48080, 1, 0, 48307, 'Now I know where your allegiances lie, $n!'),
(48080, 2, 0, 48308, 'And you, Jenny? I thought we had a connection. You''ve broken my heart for the last time.'),
(48080, 4, 0, 48313, 'What I''ve created here is an evolution! THIS is how the Forsaken will thrive, not through some magical winged fairy sprinkling happy dust on corpses!'),
(48080, 5, 0, 48314, 'Kill them all! They will serve as subjects for our next study!'),
(48080, 6, 0, 48324, 'You think that you''ve won? THINK AGAIN! Stand before my new form and tremble!'),
(48124, 3, 0, 48845, 'The dog stares blankly at the wall...'),
(48134, 1, 0, 48356, 'Foul demon! What have you done with my brother?'),
(48134, 2, 0, 48357, 'At the cost of your soul? You are no brother of mine! Begone from this place, and never set foot in our lands again!'),
(48135, 1, 0, 48358, 'No! Illidan, how could you?'),
(48139, 4, 0, 48402, '%s begins to aim a charged shot at $n!'),
(48159, 0, 0, 48375, 'Alright boys, we got a challenger!  Time to show the general what our little captive can do!'),
(48332, 3, 0, 48722, 'Deputy Clunky wants all his buckaroos to stay safe, and have a good ol'' fun time, assumin'' you meet your contract-stipulated servitude quota! Gosh!'),
