(55274, 0, 0, 54173, 'I hope the Jade Witch didn''t get all of my friends.  She is super spooky.'),
(55274, 3, 0, 54175, 'You are super brave.  Can you teach me to be as brave?'),
(55283, 0, 0, 53989, 'Rell, please... save your energy. Sully can tell $n what happened next.'),
(55283, 0, 0, 54129, 'The loss of the raccoon is the least of our worries. Our biggest concern is that petrified orc... and what its presence means. I can tell you the rest of the story.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54028, 'I decided to name him Gizmo.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54031, 'Hey there, little buddy! I''m gonna name you Gizmo.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54032, 'AMBER, WHY!? I DIDN''T EVEN SHINE MY DAMN LIGHT!'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54027, 'However, I did find a friendly raccoon, who began to follow me.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54040, 'Socks followed along, faithfully.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54038, 'I found nothin'' at the northern shrine - no Anduin, no hozen... nothin''.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54035, 'Come on, Socks. Let''s get out of here before you get sniped.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54033, 'Shortly afterward, another raccoon befriended me.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 114071, 'I got them!'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54026, 'I found no sign of Anduin at the southwestern shrine.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54034, 'I named him Socks, and quickly moved on.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54001, 'Naw, but I can put one together in a pinch. Let''s see... you need a wood-cuttin'' axe, or a people-killin'' axe?'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54029, 'NO! GIZMO!'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54044, 'No... Rell...'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54019, 'We were still goin'' north when we stopped near this big ol'' clearing.'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54067, 'I returned to find Rell bein'' attacked by hozen! Again!'),
(55286, 3, 0, 54039, 'After scoutin'' the three shrines, I headed back over to camp.'),
(55286, 4, 0, 54013, 'Note to self: Don''t get on Amber''s bad side.'),
(55286, 4, 0, 54015, 'Tryin'' ta sneak up on ol'' Sully, huh?'),
(55286, 4, 0, 54010, 'Nice shot, Amber!'),
