(55334, 0, 0, 56365, '%s gets absorbed into the Maw of Go''rath'),
(55335, 3, 0, 68789, '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_weapon_shortblade_37.blp:32|t  Strong Attack$b$b|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_weapon_shortblade_92.blp:32|t  Stronger Attack$b$b|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_shadowstrikes.blp:32|t  Strongest Attack'),
(55335, 3, 0, 53840, 'I''ll hold them off as long as I can!'),
(55335, 3, 0, 53831, 'What do you suppose happened to this tree, Sully?'),
(55335, 3, 0, 53838, 'Listen up, men! Prepare for a hozen ambush!'),
(55335, 3, 0, 53994, 'We stopped when we found a strange fallen tree.'),
(55335, 3, 0, 53990, 'We had traveled north through the forest for several hours.'),
(55335, 3, 0, 53839, 'Little Lu, keep Amber alive! Sully, try and keep this plane from exploding on us!'),
(55337, 3, 0, 53835, 'That''s Amber an'' Nimm''s plane! They might be alive after all!'),
(55337, 3, 0, 53832, 'Somethin'' hit it, sir. Wasn''t cut down, didn''t fall on its own.'),
(55337, 3, 0, 53884, 'Ye''ve gotta be kiddin'' me! Yer nearly dead! Look at ye!'),
(55337, 3, 0, 53834, 'Naw, that''s a plane. Wait... A PLANE!?'),
(55337, 3, 0, 53837, 'She''s still breathin'', sir! Get over here! Talk to ''er!'),
(55338, 3, 0, 53833, 'What''s that, over there? Some kind of bird?'),
(55338, 3, 0, 53886, 'What''s the White Pawn? I thought we were attacking the hozen.'),
(55338, 3, 0, 53836, 'Who are Amber and Nimm? Should we follow him?'),
(55343, 3, 0, 53883, 'That''s not necessary. I''ll be coming with you.'),
(55343, 3, 0, 53885, 'No, Sully. My injuries will heal. Right now, we need to find the White Pawn.'),
(55354, 3, 0, 53999, 'Mmm... he considers me an agent.'),
(55355, 3, 0, 54005, 'Amber, find a good perch and give Sully some covering fire. We''ll rendezvous back here.'),
(55355, 3, 0, 54004, 'Sully. Investigate those shrines to the west. Look for signs of the White Pawn.'),
(55355, 3, 0, 58590, 'Sully! Little Lu! Anyone!'),
(55355, 3, 0, 54002, 'Wood-cutting. Little Lu, use this axe to gather firewood.'),
(55355, 3, 0, 53998, 'Alright, agents. Listen up.'),
(55355, 3, 0, 54000, 'It grows late. We should set up camp for the night. Sully, do you have an axe?'),
(55355, 3, 0, 140174, 'Aid me!'),
(55368, 1, 0, 55542, 'You should join our family, preserved forever in jade.'),
(55368, 4, 0, 55541, 'Here kitty kitty.'),
(55370, 0, 0, 123883, 'The portal worked and we are still in one piece. Good! I was worried we might overload the network by adding another beacon.'),
(55371, 3, 0, 54071, 'Rell survived the attack, but he wasn''t doing very well.'),
(55371, 3, 0, 54094, 'I finally understood what was going on... but I was a second too late.'),
(55371, 3, 0, 54083, 'The sign out front was not very... welcoming.'),
(55371, 3, 0, 54093, 'Sully... those aren''t statues on her lawn! She wants to turn you into jade!'),
(55371, 3, 0, 54085, 'One statue in particular stood out. I had never seen a creature like this.'),
(55371, 3, 0, 54084, 'The lawn was littered with small jade statues. They seemed almost... lifelike.'),
(55371, 3, 0, 53899, 'Fellow agents! This is a pandaren hut. The pandaren are allies.'),
(55371, 3, 0, 54115, 'After inspecting the statues, we saw a female pandaren emerge from the house.'),
(55372, 3, 0, 53897, 'Rell''s condition is worsening. We must stop to rest again.'),
(55372, 3, 0, 53902, 'Yes... and the raccoon. I will watch over our commander.'),
(55372, 3, 0, 53900, 'Good thinking, Little Lu. Go find out who lives here. Take Sully with you.'),
(55374, 3, 0, 53901, 'And Socks!'),
(55374, 3, 0, 54096, 'SOCKS! NOOOOOOOOOOO!'),
(55374, 3, 0, 54090, 'I''m a dwarf, ma''am. Can we borrow some food?'),
(55374, 3, 0, 54127, 'Run, Little Lu! Run away!! Before she gets you too!'),
(55374, 3, 0, 53898, 'If only Mishka were here. She''d fix him up in no time.'),
(55374, 3, 0, 54086, 'Pshh! No sign is gonna stop me an'' my best pal Socks!'),
(55374, 3, 0, 54088, 'Now wait a darn minute. Is that an orc? Is... is the HORDE here too!?'),
(55374, 3, 0, 54092, 'What in blazes are you talkin'' about...'),
(55374, 3, 0, 54087, 'This person sure has lots o'' statues...'),
(55381, 3, 0, 89650, 'Ahahahaha!'),
(55381, 3, 0, 54091, 'The Beard-Sprite will make an excellent addition to my family!'),
(55381, 3, 0, 54089, 'Now look at this... a jinyu and... what is that? Some sort of Beard-Sprite?'),
(55387, 3, 0, 58025, 'We are going to pass through a fierce battle. You must engage the hozen while I run through. If all goes well, I will meet you at my village.'),
(55387, 3, 0, 53796, 'My people do not like strangers, but I owe you this much. May the elders not punish me for this deed.'),
(55393, 3, 0, 55967, 'It is too powerful!'),
(55394, 3, 0, 55966, 'Come sister, it is time to end this. We will cleanse the Dragon Soul of the Old Gods'' dark influence!'),
(55400, 3, 0, 55970, 'IT IS MINE!!'),
(55402, 3, 0, 53944, 'The Darkmoon Deathmatch is over!  $n is the victor!'),
(55402, 3, 0, 53813, 'Attention, fairegoers! The Darkmoon Deathmatch is about to begin! In mere moments the prize chest will appear at the center of the fighting pit!'),
