(55539, 3, 0, 54991, '%s snorts loudly, and continues sleeping.'),
(55549, 3, 0, 54036, 'Look there!  It looks as though the Twilight Cultists have brought the Old Gods and their corruption to Wyrmrest.  Hold on tight!'),
