(55873, 3, 0, 54876, 'This virmen land!'),
(55873, 3, 0, 67313, 'Your face is dumb Muno!'),
(55943, 3, 0, 59554, 'Never met them before in my life. Pandaren don''t really come in any bad flavors though.'),
(56013, 0, 0, 60632, 'You''ve all accomplished a great thing in saving Shen-zin Su. You do us all proud.'),
(56013, 1, 0, 60633, 'It seems your journeys are not done. These new allies of ours come from a broken world that could use our help.'),
