(56041, 0, 0, 74595, '|cFFFF0000BEWARE:|r Den Mother Moonfang has appeared in the woods!'),
(56041, 3, 0, 74596, 'Moonfang, Den Mother of Darkmoon Island, has been slain!'),
(56062, 0, 0, 55754, 'The Widow Greenpaw is NOT a witch. She just makes very lifelike jade statues.'),
(56110, 3, 0, 60483, 'So, friends... how are we going to find the hidden master?'),
(56110, 3, 0, 56384, 'I''m pretty sure that''s why he''s called the hidden master, Lin.'),
(56110, 3, 0, 82258, 'Mm.'),
(56110, 3, 0, 56394, 'Very well. As the oldest and fattest among us, I will wait here for each of you to return.'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57441, 'Hey, $p, come over here! Ken-Ken thinks he knows how to fix sad pandas!'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57171, 'Is it... is it gone?'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57157, 'Here, drink this.'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57172, 'Yeah... The Fearless... sounds good.'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57149, 'Alright, now we need someone to test this on...'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57150, 'You! Get over here, mopesy. Ken-Ken got just the thing for you!'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57158, 'Hahaha! It worked! Ken-Ken KNEW it would work! You feelin'' better now?'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57163, 'Perfect! C''mere, buddy. Sorry about last time! Put this on.'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57162, 'Nobody can be sad when they wearin'' a mask like this! Now, who can we test it on?'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57169, 'What the ook is that?!'),
(56115, 3, 0, 57170, 'Oh, the hozenity! Get it out of here! Ken-Ken too smart to die!'),
(56138, 0, 0, 55485, 'I can''t believe he left me with the weird mud guy.'),
(56138, 0, 0, 54995, 'No wonder it took you so long, then. You can''t explore anything sitting on your butt.'),
(56138, 0, 0, 55070, 'Can we go yet? Are you done with your beer?'),
(56138, 3, 0, 55475, 'Wait... did you say Stormstout Brewery?'),
(56138, 3, 0, 54998, 'Because those two guys make you feel skinny.'),
(56159, 0, 0, 55520, 'Come child. We have one final journey to take together before your training is complete.'),
(56159, 1, 0, 55521, 'Beyond the Elders'' Path lies the Wood of Staves, a sacred place that only the worthy may enter.'),
(56159, 2, 0, 55522, 'Of the many ways to prove your worth, I require the simplest of you now. I must know that you will fight for our people. I must know that you can keep them safe.'),
(56159, 3, 0, 55523, 'Defeat the Guardian of the Elders, and we may pass.'),
(56159, 4, 0, 56484, 'You''ve become strong indeed, child. This is good. You will need that strength soon.'),
(56165, 3, 0, 54780, 'A conducting crystal overloads!'),
(56167, 0, 0, 54846, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_bloodnova.blp:20|tThe %s is injured and sprouts |cFFFE9A2EBlistering Tentacles|r!'),
(56168, 0, 0, 54846, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_bloodnova.blp:20|tThe %s is injured and sprouts |cFFFE9A2EBlistering Tentacles|r!'),
(56184, 1, 0, 54873, 'Gimme all your vegetables!'),
(56184, 3, 0, 103761, 'Aieeeeee!'),
(56184, 4, 0, 60661, 'This virmen land now, you go!'),
(56184, 4, 0, 101910, 'Go away!'),
(56185, 3, 0, 66821, 'We grow better!  You bad!'),
(56194, 3, 0, 89989, '%s escapes!'),
(56208, 3, 0, 55079, 'Stay away from my sheep!'),
(56236, 3, 0, 64344, 'I thought that was it... I thought I was going to die.  Thank you, stranger.'),
(56236, 3, 0, 131568, 'Thank you for saving me.'),
(56236, 3, 0, 64342, 'I''m alive thanks only to you... I won''t forget this.'),
(56248, 1, 0, 55984, 'The Eyes of Peroth''arn are looking for you.'),
(56267, 3, 0, 64690, 'Oh my! A new urgency has hardened your resolve. I suppose my work here is done.'),
(56268, 3, 0, 64687, 'Keep the spark centered!'),
(56269, 3, 0, 64130, 'How about ... THIS?'),
(56269, 3, 0, 64127, 'Now, you must STAY CENTERED. You can focus or relax, but above all else, remain in the center.'),
(56269, 3, 0, 64148, 'There - do you feel it? A perfect stillness of the soul! Feel the dream brew take effect.'),
(56269, 3, 0, 64131, 'Look at you! The picture of serenity. I knew I liked you.'),
(56269, 3, 0, 64146, 'Negative emotions, like anger or doubt, they take on a strange power here on Pandaria. But this you will discover in time.'),
(56269, 3, 0, 64129, 'I''m so sorry, that did not alarm you did it, hmm? We Pandaren value calm under any circumstance.'),
(56269, 3, 0, 64128, 'Ah, good, I see you are not easily distracted. We Pandaren are extremely focused on the moment, sometimes to our detriment.'),
(56310, 0, 0, 55203, 'You cannot...escape!'),
(56312, 0, 0, 55372, 'You kids have fun at Mudmug''s! And thanks again, $n!'),
(56344, 0, 0, 57065, 'Finally!'),
(56344, 1, 0, 57071, 'Really, Uncle? We''re stopping already? We only moved, like, ten feet.'),
(56345, 3, 0, 61030, 'But look who has arrived! Mrs. Mann, there''s someone I would like you to meet.'),
(56345, 3, 0, 61071, 'Have patience, Mrs. Mann. These strangers from beyond the mist continually surprise me.'),
(56346, 3, 0, 61028, 'I would love to help you, Lorewalker, but understand - I am in a real bind here.'),
(56346, 3, 0, 61066, 'I understand, Lorewalker. But the Serpent''s Heart project is behind schedule and we''ve not a stone to spare!'),
(56347, 3, 0, 143887, 'Over here!'),
(56348, 3, 0, 63569, 'I''m going to keep looking for jade. May want to ask around and see if anyone could use a hand.'),
(56349, 3, 0, 131861, 'Wooooooooooo!'),
(56349, 3, 0, 111861, 'Teehee!'),
(56349, 3, 0, 61341, 'MINE!'),
(56416, 0, 0, 64848, 'Thank Shen-zin Su that you''re here.  I could use your help!'),
(56416, 1, 0, 64849, 'Get clear when it when it raises its weapon, it''s even stronger than it looks.'),
(56416, 2, 0, 64850, 'It''s calling allies!  I''ll keep him busy while you handle them.'),
(56416, 3, 0, 64852, 'We''re wearing him down.  Keep it up!'),
(56416, 4, 0, 64853, 'I don''t know what I would have done without you.  It''s good that you came.'),
(56418, 0, 0, 66062, 'Stay close and keep these healers safe.  Our lives depend on it.'),
(56418, 0, 1, 66063, 'If we lose the healers, Shen-zin Su dies, and all of us with him!  Keep them safe.'),
(56418, 0, 2, 66061, 'Find the healers and get them free of the fight.  We need them here at the wound!'),
(56440, 3, 0, 67316, 'You gonna get shovel upside head!'),
(56440, 3, 0, 67317, 'You virmen smell like rotten turnip and yak dooker!'),
(56440, 3, 0, 55061, 'Miss Fanny, you stronger than that! Try and put a little more ook in it next time!'),
(56440, 3, 0, 55063, 'Ahhhh ha ha ha ha! It barely even go halfway down the hill!'),
(56440, 3, 0, 55066, 'Nice, Miss Fanny! You hit it strong!'),
(56440, 3, 0, 55062, 'Easy, Miss Fanny. You hit watermelons too hard... they go boom!'),
(56440, 3, 0, 55064, 'Whoah. Nice shootin'', Miss Fanny!'),
(56440, 3, 0, 55065, 'Good bonk, Miss Fanny! You got nice control!'),
(56442, 3, 0, 58191, 'The Song of the Vale hangs on the wall. Take it. I hear the celestials calling. Thank you...'),
(56442, 3, 0, 55130, 'Then the darkness came. It seeped from the ground. Slowly, it infected us...suffocated us!'),
(56442, 3, 0, 55131, 'Even after our mortal flesh had rotted away, it leeched hope from our souls. It was unending!'),
(56442, 3, 0, 55128, 'A thousand lifetimes ago, I brought the waters here. A gift to the Pearlfin for ancient deeds.'),
(56442, 3, 0, 55127, 'Finally! To be free from the grip of that darkness. The light! The blessed, beautiful light!'),
(56442, 3, 0, 55129, 'We guarded the waters. Too dangerous, too powerful, to fall into the wrong hands.'),
(56443, 3, 0, 55212, 'Ahh, there we go. Told you I had it!'),
(56443, 3, 0, 55213, 'I''m sure you can handle things in here. I''ll be outside settling things down.'),
(56443, 3, 0, 55211, 'HNNGGG!!!'),
(56444, 1, 0, 55089, 'In the end, only silence remains.'),
(56444, 1, 0, 55085, 'A worthy sacrifice for our master.'),
(56444, 1, 0, 55086, 'Darkness awaits...'),
(56444, 1, 0, 55088, 'The waters are forbidden to all!'),
(56444, 1, 0, 55083, 'Despair...'),
(56444, 3, 0, 55090, 'The living are not welcome here!'),
