(57310, 3, 0, 123493, 'Noooooo!'),
(57310, 3, 0, 56212, 'Oof! What are you doing?!'),
(57310, 3, 0, 56217, 'Ugh... I''m getting dizzy.'),
(57400, 3, 0, 63409, 'My mind is clear. Thank you, $r.'),
(57400, 3, 0, 63414, 'Drive them back!'),
(57402, 3, 0, 64495, 'They say that the way to the Tiller''s Union is through the leader''s stomach. Eh?'),
(57406, 3, 0, 56309, 'BAD WORM! THAT''S A BAD BAD BAD WORM!'),
(57432, 0, 0, 56224, 'Panda lady! Do a dance on top of the carrot!'),
(57459, 3, 0, 56271, 'Left... Left! LEEEFFFFTTTT!'),
(57460, 3, 0, 56275, 'Stomp now.'),
(57460, 3, 0, 56274, 'Buuurrrnn!'),
(57638, 0, 0, 56333, 'The reeds of the Singing Pools are the hardest in all of the land, but they are as air before my mighty brow.'),
(57638, 1, 0, 56334, 'Many have tested my claim, and I yet stand proven.'),
(57669, 0, 0, 56343, 'Our crafters build the finest wooden planks.  They would weather the most brutal of storms.  But they are as water before the storm of my crushing skull.'),
(57669, 1, 0, 56344, 'Nothing made by pandaren hands can withstand me.'),
(57670, 0, 0, 56355, 'These are the densest stones across all of Shen-zin Su, yet they are as nothing before my mighty head.'),
(57670, 1, 0, 56356, 'Any who yet doubt my strength are simply foolish.'),
(57682, 3, 0, 56741, 'Thank you, sisters, I am renewed.'),
(57682, 3, 0, 56743, 'The faceless generals, Zon''ozz and Yor''sahj, command the enemy legions from within the monstrosities you see on the horizon.'),
(57682, 3, 0, 56742, 'The Old Gods have shown themselves - a tide of darkness sweeps from their gaping maws towards the temple. We MUST buy the aspects more time.'),
(57682, 3, 0, 56747, 'The Aspects have already gathered and await your arrival. Go now!'),
(57682, 3, 0, 56746, 'The flow of darkness abates. It seems you truly are the heroes of legend.'),
(57682, 3, 0, 56745, 'A single general remains. You must make haste!'),
(57684, 3, 0, 56740, 'You must hurry... Wyrmrest falls as we speak... all... is lost...'),
(57692, 0, 0, 56363, 'This is magnificent!  I''ve never seen craftsmanship so fine.'),
(57692, 1, 0, 56361, 'There is only one thing to do.  I must smash it!  Once and for all, all shall know the power of my mighty brow.'),
(57692, 2, 0, 56362, 'Oh... my head... it hurts so badly!  I''ve... the pillar must contain enormous power... perhaps stronger even than my brow...'),
(57712, 0, 0, 56406, 'Hello friend!  You''re welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Dai-Lo Farmstead.'),
(57712, 1, 0, 58657, 'Hello friend!  You''re welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Temple of Five Dawns.'),
(57714, 3, 0, 56388, 'Ask the streams? You''re no elder, Ashyo. You''re not even a jinyu grown yet. It would be a waste of your time.'),
(57714, 3, 0, 56390, 'That''s a much better idea, Ken-Ken. I volunteer to travel south, into the jungle.'),
(57715, 3, 0, 56389, 'Ken-Ken thinks we split up. Follow the four winds.'),
(57715, 3, 0, 56392, 'Ken-Ken go chase east wind. Shortest walk.'),
(57716, 3, 0, 56386, 'So, where should we search first?'),
(57716, 3, 0, 56385, 'Oh. Sorry.'),
(57716, 3, 0, 56383, 'So... do any of you know where the hidden master lives?'),
(57721, 3, 0, 60628, 'Master Shang Xi, I would like to accompany the Alliance back to their home.'),
(57830, 3, 0, 71841, '%s snores peacefully.'),
(57830, 3, 0, 57432, 'Guess I''ll just sleep for another day...'),
(57898, 3, 0, 57080, 'I''m going to my room. Feel free to tell my aunt about how you "heroically" saved me from myself or whatever.'),
(57898, 3, 0, 57072, 'Alright, alright already! Enough with the shoving!'),
(57913, 3, 0, 56600, 'Hey! Over here! No, down here! I can take you back to the present time, if you want.'),
(57916, 3, 0, 56628, 'He is heading to the maelstrom!  We must stop him NOW, we may never get another chance if he escapes into Deepholm.'),
(57943, 3, 0, 56669, 'I sense danger...it is a trap...carefully laid for us at this crucial moment.'),
(57944, 3, 0, 56668, 'Then truly, we are lost.'),
(57946, 3, 0, 56666, 'It is no use, the power of the Dragon Soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely; the raging forces contained within it may be the doom of us all.'),
(57946, 3, 0, 56667, 'Yes, I see.  We can finally turn Deathwing''s own power back against him.'),
(57946, 3, 0, 56670, 'We have no choice.  We must have faith in our allies.'),
(57947, 3, 0, 56733, 'The Focusing Iris within the Eye of Eternity may allow us to converge the magical matrix contained within the Dragon Soul.'),
(57947, 3, 0, 56664, 'Not necessarily. I believe...yes...it just might work.'),
(57947, 3, 0, 56665, 'Then I will open the way into the Eye of Eternity. You must not fail, heroes. The future of Azeroth hinges on your actions.'),
(58068, 3, 0, 57191, 'Your kind is no match for the return of our Thunder King!'),
(58068, 3, 0, 57189, 'Kneel supplicant!'),
(58068, 3, 0, 57193, 'Avert your eyes, peasant!'),
(58113, 3, 0, 62753, 'This was not supposed to be a combat mission.'),
