(58113, 3, 0, 62751, 'Not while Leza is in labor. We must wait.'),
(58114, 3, 0, 57494, 'Face these "mantid" $p and we''ll continue our assault on the Mogu. With luck, we should join you shortly.'),
(58114, 3, 0, 62757, 'I appreciate that your wife led us here, old friend, but she chose a poor time to have a child.'),
