(58158, 3, 0, 57200, 'The rest of Nesingwary''s Safari is up in the western side of the Valley of Four Winds. If you find yourself heading west, you should join us. Good hunting!'),
(58164, 3, 0, 57330, 'AAAHHH! HNNNH!'),
(58165, 3, 0, 57161, 'Faster, you fools. We need all of these artifacts soon or it''s the cane for your hides.'),
