(58951, 3, 0, 66442, 'The Alliance wins!'),
(58951, 3, 0, 66441, 'The Horde wins!'),
(58959, 0, 0, 69547, '... yo, $n! Remember me? Good, good... hey, listen... we don''t have to help this guy...'),
