(59019, 3, 0, 58429, '$G He : She; looks pretty powerful. Maybe powerful enough to drive the yaungol back!'),
(59021, 0, 0, 64509, 'You cannot stand against the fire of the yaungol!'),
(59037, 4, 0, 59814, 'Kung Din pounced on you! Fight for your life! |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_secondwind.blp:20|t'),
(59040, 3, 0, 57973, 'What are you doing here?! Don''t you know the Yaungol are invading Kun-Lai Summit?'),
(59055, 3, 0, 58012, 'Maybe $ghe:she; is a hero from beyond the mists, here to save us?'),
(59058, 0, 0, 58104, 'You brought back the instruments just in time, $n. The Elder is ready to perform the waterspeaking ceremony.'),
(59058, 0, 0, 58055, 'No harm? Pah! Many thousand years ago, the Pearlfin Tribe stood on the throne of all Pandaria. Now, this village is all that is left of our people, all because we trusted a tribe of outsiders... the hozen.'),
(59067, 3, 0, 61289, 'Slowly then.'),
