(59067, 3, 0, 58016, 'You may stay only until Taylor is well. But then, you must leave.'),
(59067, 3, 0, 58014, 'I have done nothing. This is the work of the Slingtail chief, Gukgut.'),
(59068, 3, 0, 58017, 'We have no other choice. Put down your weapon, warrior, and we will put down ours.'),
