(66633, 4, 0, 67913, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_tigersroar.blp:20|t %s hides and prepares to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:131271|h[Leap from Shadows]|h|r!'),
(66655, 1, 0, 54876, 'This virmen land!'),
(66666, 3, 0, 68561, 'Another stranger comes to our village... a $c by the look of it. Enter, but do not draw your weapons against us as the Horde did.'),
(66693, 3, 0, 67810, 'Work harder you lazy mongrels, or I''ll roast you alive!'),
(66693, 3, 0, 67812, 'Guard these supplies with your lives, you filthy mutts!'),
(66693, 3, 0, 67814, 'Watch these mercenaries closely, brothers!'),
(66693, 3, 0, 67813, 'Keep your flea ridden paws out of the food, you mangy beasts!'),
(66693, 3, 0, 67811, 'Break any of these supplies, and I''ll break your skull!'),
(66700, 3, 0, 67823, 'Keep these ruins secure at all costs!'),
(66700, 3, 0, 67821, 'Hidden power lies here, and we must reveal it!'),
(66700, 3, 0, 67825, 'Do not falter! We will soon unite with our ancient mogu allies!'),
(66700, 3, 0, 67824, 'Leave no stone unturned in our search!'),
(66731, 0, 0, 76670, 'Impressive.'),
(66731, 3, 0, 76674, 'You''ve stumbled right into my trap.'),
(66832, 3, 0, 67920, 'Hey Farmer Yoon!'),
(66832, 3, 0, 67918, 'You know, you sure saved my hide with those scallions.'),
(66832, 3, 0, 67925, 'Welcome to The Heartland!'),
(66832, 3, 0, 68218, 'Talk to any of the Ironpaws at the market if you want to improve your own cooking skill.'),
(66832, 3, 0, 67922, 'There are four other votes you''ll need to get, but that''ll come in time.'),
(66832, 3, 0, 67921, 'Listen, since you two did such a good turn by helping me out, I''m casting the first vote to help you join the Tillers.'),
(66832, 3, 0, 67923, 'Settle yourselves in and come by the market any day if you are looking for work.'),
(66905, 3, 0, 68130, 'Quickly, this way! The cannon fire has opened a passage to the courtyard!'),
(66949, 3, 0, 61160, 'Well, you have done what you could through diplomacy. Now, we can only prove ourselves to the Pearlfin through our deeds.'),
(66978, 3, 0, 68303, 'Men, you''ve trained for this. You''re among the elite.  You are Skyfire men!'),
(66978, 3, 0, 68304, 'This is the ship that took down Deathwing. You think some raggedy little Horde outpost stands a chance against the pride of the Alliance fleet? NO!'),
(67012, 3, 0, 67742, 'This is not the place to explain. In short, your own doubts have been made manifest, as a consequence of your actions.'),
(67012, 3, 0, 67744, 'Oh, I understand perfectly. I have eyes. But Pandaria is not like whatever land you came from; it lives and breathes. You should be careful what kind of energy you bring here. Now put those weapons away!'),
(67048, 0, 0, 68008, 'You heard the admiral. Concentrate fire on the Horde base. Begin your attack runs.'),
(67048, 0, 0, 68010, 'Use your torpedo rockets on those ships.');
INSERT INTO `tmp_fix_creature_text` VALUES
(67048, 0, 0, 68011, 'Confirmed kill. Nice shooting.'),
(67048, 0, 0, 68006, 'Admiral, we''re seeing a significant native presence here. Ornate structures-'),
(67048, 0, 0, 68015, 'Negative, Admiral. No sign of Captain Taylor OR his flagship.'),
(67050, 0, 0, 68005, 'What in blazes is this?'),
(67051, 0, 0, 68013, 'That one''s for Theramore!'),
(67051, 0, 0, 68020, 'That''s enough - all wings, report back. Prepare for ground assault.'),
(67051, 0, 0, 68014, 'Any sign of the flagship down there?'),
(67051, 0, 0, 68012, 'Well done. No mercy!'),
(67051, 0, 0, 68019, 'Pay ''em back! Hit them with everything you''ve got!'),
(67051, 0, 0, 68007, 'Cut the chatter, people. Eyes on the target!'),
(67053, 4, 0, 68820, '$n detonated a Wind Bomb!'),
(67069, 3, 0, 68518, 'DESTROY...'),
(67132, 3, 0, 63663, 'There is another visitor from beyond the mists here. "Chen Stormstout" he is called. He is Pandaren, but from a different homeland.'),
(67132, 3, 0, 63658, 'Learn from this, stranger!'),
(67132, 3, 0, 63664, 'Walk this land with Chen at your side. Make friends among the people here. You will find answers in time.'),
(67132, 3, 0, 63660, 'It is clear that you are not here to bring your war to these lands. There is a darkness hidden here in Pandaria - this you have seen for yourself!'),
(67132, 3, 0, 63657, 'This battle has extracted a heavy toll. My own rebirth will have to wait for several years.'),
(67132, 3, 0, 63662, 'You can learn a great deal about this land from the Valley of the Four Winds.'),
(67132, 3, 0, 70590, 'Well, we meet again.'),
(67132, 3, 0, 63661, 'But I am certain that the mists parted for a reason. YOU are that reason. Find your purpose here.'),
(67134, 3, 0, 88586, 'Dat was good.'),
(67222, 3, 0, 61225, 'And the delivery is not for ME, Hao! The honorable Lorewalker has been waitin- oh...'),
(67222, 3, 0, 61222, 'Don''t you "snow lily" me! I was- WE- were worried sick about you.'),
(67222, 3, 0, 61221, 'Honey-Bear! I mean... it is about time.'),
(67260, 0, 0, 70130, 'Is it gettin'' hot in here?'),
(67260, 1, 0, 68842, 'Now entering the arena: a Rank 1 $r $c, $n! $n is pretty new around here, so go easy!'),
(67260, 2, 0, 68888, 'Now entering the arena: an up-and-coming Rank 2 $c, $n!'),
(67260, 3, 0, 68889, 'Put your hands together for $n! $n is a Rank 3 $c.'),
(67260, 4, 0, 68890, 'Here''s our challenger. Today, we welcome a Rank 4 $r $c, $n!'),
(67260, 5, 0, 68891, 'Now entering the arena, we have a very talented $c. Say hello to $n, a Rank 5 brawler!'),
(67260, 6, 0, 68892, 'Look out... here comes the deadly Rank 6 $r, $n!'),
(67260, 7, 0, 68893, 'Now entering the arena: a returning champion. Our Rank 7 $c, $n!'),
(67260, 8, 0, 68894, 'Now entering the arena: You know $ghim:her;. You love $ghim:her;. Give it up for our Rank 8 Brawler, $N!!'),
(67260, 9, 0, 68846, 'It''s official! $n managed not to die. Great job not dying, $n!'),
(67260, 9, 1, 68844, 'Well well well! $n wins! Looks like I owe someone some money.'),
(67260, 9, 2, 68840, '$n is our victor!'),
(67260, 9, 3, 68845, 'Congratulations, $n! Try not to leave any bloody footprints outside of the arena.'),
(67260, 9, 4, 69895, 'Keep ''em comin'', $n.'),
(67260, 9, 5, 69890, 'Brilliant victory, $n! Now get back in line.'),
(67260, 9, 6, 69896, '$n wins! $n wins!'),
(67260, 10, 0, 68849, '$n, $n, $n. Next time, try not to die so much.'),
(67260, 10, 1, 70145, 'I think we''ve seen just about enough of this. Am I right?'),
(67260, 10, 2, 69891, 'Sorry, $n. Now would you kindly remove your corpse so that the others can have a go?'),
(67260, 10, 3, 69889, '$gHis:Her; name was $n.'),
(67260, 10, 4, 68848, 'That... did not end well.'),
(67260, 10, 5, 68841, 'Ouch... sorry, $n. Get back in line and try again.'),
(67260, 10, 6, 69892, 'Honestly, $n... were you even trying?'),
(67260, 11, 0, 126125, 'Looks like every day is Hallow''s End for this... thing. Give up some screams for Ooliss!'),
(67260, 12, 0, 70139, 'We don''t have all night. Hurry it up already!'),
(67260, 13, 0, 70142, 'Do you smell smoke?'),
(67260, 14, 0, 69855, 'We also welcome everybody''s favorite frosty feathered friend: Dippy!'),
(67260, 15, 0, 126126, 'And their challenger, Bill, the custodial engineer of death! Wait... what? Bill! What are you doing in there?'),
(67260, 16, 0, 69945, 'From deep within the bowels of Blackrock Mountain, it''s Sanoriak, master of flame!'),
(67260, 17, 0, 126131, 'Kindly insert a gold coin for a battle with Master Paku!'),
(67260, 18, 0, 126124, 'Oh, the huge manatee! It''s here to seal the deal... DOOMFLIPPER!'),
(67260, 19, 0, 74147, 'Brawl''gar veterans may remember Blat, the self-replicating ooze. Today, we meet his meaner, uglier, older sister: Splat!'),
(67260, 20, 0, 126128, 'In the other corner, a master of both shadows AND interior lighting... it''s Shadowmaster Aameen!'),
(67260, 21, 0, 126135, 'And in the other corner, a hunter of incomprehensible spectacular amazing splendor! It''s Johnny Awesome!'),
(67260, 22, 0, 126137, 'Get fired up for the djinn who will literally melt your heart, it''s Burnstachio!'),
(67260, 23, 0, 70059, 'And... Meatball.'),
(67260, 24, 0, 69869, 'Their partnership was never meant to be. It actually makes me sick a little bit. Here comes GG Engineering!'),
(67260, 25, 0, 126121, 'All the way from the gloomy roads of Duskwood, it''s Stitches!'),
(67260, 26, 0, 126139, 'And now for some soul-pounding beats from the musical underground, it''s Thwack U and his dancers!'),
(67260, 27, 0, 73725, 'He''s probably the most deadly brawler we''ve ever had here at the Brawl''gar Arena. Unfortunately, he''s a little out of his element. Everybody raise your glass for Razorgrin!'),
(67260, 28, 0, 69852, 'Five on one hardly seems fair, but come on... they''re half-dead gnomes. It''s the leper gnome quintet!'),
(67260, 29, 0, 126140, 'In the other corner, a pirate with a lethal definition of head cannon! Put your hooks together for Blackmange!'),
(67260, 30, 0, 126130, 'In the other corner... a really big dinosaur!'),
(67260, 31, 0, 69860, 'Up next, probably the weakest, ugliest, and least genius combatant I''ve ever seen. It''s the stupid, smelly gnome, Millie Watt! Everybody boo!'),
(67260, 32, 0, 126134, 'And our other challenger, a worm with a serious fire fetish. Come on, Carl! Don''t you know flames can kill?'),
(67260, 34, 0, 74141, 'Aww... look at the cute little snake, Nibbleh! Go ahead, let him nibble on your toes. Let''s see what happens.'),
(67260, 35, 0, 126104, 'In the other corner, a challenger so ancient no one remembers his actual name. Let''s call him Serpent of Old!'),
(67260, 36, 0, 126136, 'And now for the challenger that cost us so much... it''s Ray D. Tear!'),
(67260, 37, 0, 69954, 'Also entering the arena: Everybody''s favorite magical 12-foot-tall corpse, Fjoll! Am I pronouncing that right?'),
(67260, 40, 0, 69953, 'Some of you veterans might remember this guy. He may be Broken, but today, he means to break you! It''s Akama!'),
(67260, 43, 0, 69959, 'And in the other corner, we have... a big cloud of scary floating eyes? This doesn''t look good.'),
(67260, 48, 0, 69943, 'In the other corner... a disgusting green pile of goblin idiocy, riding on a lumbering chariot of shame. It''s Fran and Riddoh! Everybody boo!'),
(67260, 57, 0, 70141, 'Time''s nearly up!'),
(67260, 60, 0, 69940, 'Hey hey! Look what we''ve scooped up for you today... it''s Blat!'),
(67260, 69, 0, 69937, 'In the other corner, we have Vian, the flame-flinging follower of the Thunder King!'),
(67260, 72, 0, 74136, 'He doesn''t need blades or magic to defeat his enemies. Our next challenger, Hexos, fights his foes with the awesome powers of GEOMETRY!'),
(67260, 75, 0, 74138, 'He''s got two modes. Both modes are labeled "KILL". Let''s hear it for T440!'),
(67260, 87, 0, 74140, 'What''s better than an explosion? Lots and lots of explosions, of course! In this corner, we have Big Badda Boom!!'),
(67260, 92, 0, 69893, 'You wanna make an omelet, you''re gonna have to break a few eggs.'),
(67260, 94, 0, 73078, 'He represents everything that is just, and righteous, and several other virtues which are of no interest to most of you. It''s the draenei paladin, Ahoo''ru!'),
(67260, 100, 0, 69955, 'We have a special guest today: the always-endearing, ever-resilient, Millhouse Manastorm! Good luck, MillMan!'),
(67260, 103, 0, 69946, 'We found this one scuttling in circles in Silithus. From the looks of him, somebody mostly killed him already. It''s Ixx!'),
(67260, 111, 0, 74137, 'He may be a huge chicken, but he''ll still put up a fight. It''s Tyson Sanders!'),
(67260, 126, 0, 69939, 'Well, wrap me in leather and tug my leash: it''s Dungeon Master Vishas!'),
(67260, 129, 0, 69950, 'When I see her smile, it makes me smile. When she casts a spell, it puts a spell on me. When I see her horns, it makes me feel... intrigued. It''s Dominika!'),
(67260, 132, 0, 69948, 'And in this corner! He''s angry. He''s deadly. He''s a little bit adorable. Straight out of Neverest, it''s Crush!'),
(67260, 147, 0, 70058, 'I never thought I''d see the day! Our former champion, out of retirement! Put your big, beefy hands together for Leona Earthwind!'),
(67260, 153, 0, 69951, 'Up next, it''s Millie Watt! I used to date her in engineering school!'),
(67260, 154, 0, 69894, 'Ahhh ha ha ha! So much blood! Nice.'),
(67267, 0, 0, 70088, 'Blood and honor, $c.'),
(67267, 1, 0, 70087, 'Let me know if you want to brawl, $r.'),
(67267, 2, 0, 70086, 'You fighting today, $c?'),
(67268, 0, 0, 70115, 'Feel the flames'' embrace!'),
(67268, 0, 1, 70119, 'You can''t run forever!'),
(67268, 0, 2, 70116, 'There is no escape...'),
(67268, 0, 3, 70117, 'Your time has come.'),
