(70100, 3, 0, 72583, 'It is important to throw the spear just before slaying the beast. Not a moment too soon! Not a moment too late!'),
(70100, 3, 0, 72558, 'Now if I were a dwarf I would just start randomly pushing buttons. But you and I are here for a purpose.'),
