(70100, 3, 0, 72578, 'No no no - this isn''t right at all. Let''s get out of here.'),
(70100, 3, 0, 72584, 'I must make preparations back on the mainland. Return to me at the Veiled Stair when you have what I need.'),
(70100, 3, 0, 72658, 'Perhaps if I overcharge the forge, it will destabilize this sha nuisance? Let''s try it.'),
(70100, 3, 0, 72569, 'The mogu were using only a fraction of the resources available to them. Few among them possessed the cunning of the Thunder King.'),
(70100, 3, 0, 72557, 'How interesting! This forge is built atop of ancient Titan machinery. Lei Shen, you clever, clever tyrant, you!'),
(70100, 3, 0, 72663, 'The lance is finished. Quickly, hurl it at the sha!'),
(70100, 3, 0, 72553, 'Be ready to fight if we draw too much attention.'),
