(70297, 3, 0, 71815, 'Thank you, Lord Zhu. I will not let you down.'),
(70297, 3, 0, 71811, 'Champion, hear me out: We strike the shipyard at night, using this magnificent beast you have tamed.'),
(70297, 3, 0, 71812, 'Once inside, we sabotage the Zandalari ship. In the chaos, we will slip into the courtyard and open the gates from within.'),
(70309, 1, 0, 71208, 'So, you''ve come to die?!'),
(70309, 3, 0, 73024, 'This is for Theramore!'),
(70320, 3, 0, 72983, 'We barely pulled you out of there.  You''re lucky to be alive.'),
(70337, 1, 0, 71208, 'So, you''ve come to die?!'),
(70347, 3, 0, 72747, 'I''ll drag your corpse to the filth pit!'),
(70348, 0, 0, 72746, 'Tear the mogu to pieces!'),
(70371, 3, 0, 72790, 'Aethas, leave us for a moment.'),
(70371, 3, 0, 72792, 'Our Warchief''s campaign across Kalimdor and Pandaria is pulling the Horde apart at the seams.'),
(70371, 3, 0, 72795, 'In the event of an uprising, we must be prepared.'),
(70371, 3, 0, 72791, 'Hero, you have served the Horde nobly across many campaigns. I feel I can take you into confidence.'),
(70371, 3, 0, 72793, 'We are here to fight the Thunder King. Justice demands it, and Hellscream is too preoccupied at Domination Point to pay attention here.'),
(70371, 3, 0, 72794, 'But, in defeating him, we must seek out the source of his great power. We must claim it for ourselves, as leverage against our "Warchief."'),
(70437, 3, 0, 72508, 'But your trespass ends here. None may enter my forbidden stronghold. I shall rebuild this bridge with your bones for bricks.'),
(70476, 3, 0, 72359, 'I will be watching you closely, hero!'),
(70476, 3, 0, 72357, 'What were the mogu sent here to guard? Or destroy? We are missing the final puzzle pieces, and YOU will help me find them!'),
(70476, 3, 0, 72356, 'We know now that the mogu share their roots with the Titans. But many mysteries remain. Why were they here? Why Pandaria?'),
(70476, 3, 0, 72358, 'The crown I have given you will be as your third eye. It will tie us together. I will see what you see. Together we will lay the secrets of the Titans bare.'),
(70480, 3, 0, 72781, 'Pandaren legends tell of Lei Shen, "The Thunder King." He was the brutal founder of the Mogu empire over 12,000 years ago.'),
(70480, 3, 0, 72783, 'The Thunder King built a palatial fortress on the borders of his empire. We should see it soon...'),
(70480, 3, 0, 72782, 'He united the mogu, defeated the other pandaren races, and founded a glorious nation with the slave labor of those he conquered.'),
(70500, 3, 0, 73027, 'The |cFFFF2222[Lightning Lance]|r is charged.  Use it to finish off the Sha Amalgamation!'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72368, 'Here, this fragment speaks of "The Winged Legions of Y''Shaarj." Servants of an Old God? Could this mean the mantid?'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72372, 'Ah! The final piece of the puzzle. The Thunder King took on the powers of Ra-Den, the very essence of a Titan. He united the mogu into an empire and tried to continue the Titans'' work. Of course he saw himself as a God!'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72364, 'According to this, the mogu and their master were sent to Pandaria. They were pursuing a great darkness - ah, the fragment is incomplete. We must find others.'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72361, 'According to this runestone, the mogu were Titan constructs, soulless creatures built of stone. We suspected as much.'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72373, 'Quickly, return to me at the Veiled Stair. We should talk face-to-face.'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72370, 'You''ve found another piece of the puzzle! This was carved by the mogu. They were frustrated - a thousand years with no orders from their master, and their bodies had turned to flesh. The mogu began to argue among themselves.'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72362, 'You''ve found another stone! What have we learned? The "curse of flesh" made the mogu mortal. Ah - but later, they found a way to reverse the process. A clever race.'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72371, 'Hmmm. This runestone speaks of mogu savagery. They fell apart into warrior clans. But one King was more ambitious than the others - Lei Shen. The Thunder King. When the Titan Keeper fell silent, Lei Shen decided to speak for him.'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72363, 'The mogu served a Titan keeper. His name was "Ra." In the mogu tongue, "Ra-den" means "Master Ra." Fascinating! I must know more!'),
(70516, 3, 0, 72367, 'We''re beginning to put the pieces together, champion. The mogu were created and sent here to guard the Vale for their Titan masters. Guard it from what? Were the Old Gods still a threat?'),
(70542, 3, 0, 76794, 'The sound of grinding metal reverberates through the halls as the lock on the Nexus doors releases.'),
