(70989, 0, 0, 73750, 'Spoken like a true child of the Aspects. Always seeking to change the world.'),
(70989, 0, 0, 73751, 'But true wisdom comes from KNOWING what is right. And sometimes, DOING nothing at all.'),
(70989, 0, 0, 73753, 'Come forward! I will give you my blessing.'),
(70989, 0, 0, 73752, 'To learn THAT is to learn true wisdom.'),
(70989, 3, 0, 73748, 'Ah, the dragon child and the hero. Together you will achieve great things.'),
(70989, 3, 0, 73749, 'Tell me, dragon child: What is the nature of wisdom?'),
(70989, 3, 0, 73783, 'Do you see? Power without vision causes only random chaos and destruction.'),
(70989, 3, 0, 73882, 'Please, young prince. Take this lesson to heart.'),
(71002, 0, 0, 74218, 'No one shall withstand our might!'),
(71003, 0, 0, 73746, 'To do what is right, no matter the cost. That is wisdom.'),
(71003, 0, 0, 73747, 'When is it ever wise not to act for the greater good?'),
(71007, 3, 0, 74218, 'No one shall withstand our might!'),
(71007, 3, 0, 90976, 'Victory or death!'),
(71015, 3, 0, 74121, 'Do not touch the displays.'),
