(71095, 3, 0, 73436, 'Lei Shi''s reflection burbles quietly.'),
(71107, 3, 0, 73489, 'Now. My challenge, should you accept it, will test your ability to stand right in the face of danger and persevere.'),
(71107, 3, 0, 73485, 'How so?'),
(71107, 3, 0, 73487, 'A black dragon, through and through. Very well, I will give you my blessing, but also some advice:'),
(71107, 3, 0, 73478, 'Ah, the young black dragon graces my temple. The deeds of you and your champion are quickly becoming Pandaren legend.'),
(71107, 3, 0, 73488, 'Strength used in the service of others is twice as powerful as strength spent on our foes.'),
(71107, 3, 0, 73481, 'Tell me, young prince: What is the nature of strength?'),
(71107, 3, 0, 73659, 'Young prince, I hope you take this lesson to heart.'),
(71107, 3, 0, 73483, 'You speak only in terms of one''s enemies.'),
(71107, 3, 0, 73658, 'I hope now you understand the limits of strength without vision. It is one thing to change the world, but quite another to do what is right.'),
(71108, 3, 0, 73480, 'I take great pride in the company I keep.'),
(71108, 3, 0, 73482, 'The power to crush one''s foes. That is strength.'),
(71108, 3, 0, 73484, 'Certainly, strength can benefit one''s allies.'),
(71108, 3, 0, 73486, '...by using it to crush their enemies!'),
(71108, 3, 0, 73477, 'Great White Tiger! Hear our plea.'),
(71108, 3, 0, 73479, 'My champion and I seek the blessing of your strength.'),
(71123, 4, 0, 73600, 'I only sleep.'),
(71123, 4, 0, 73596, 'Your agony rejuvenates me.'),
(71123, 4, 0, 73594, 'My blood hungers.'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73880, 'Seek out your true enemy! Do not be fooled by his false images!'),
(71136, 3, 0, 131943, 'Let''s go!'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73664, 'Champion, turn your foe''s strength and confidence against him. I believe in you.'),
(71136, 3, 0, 129681, 'Enough!'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73523, 'Stay behind your foe. He cannot see you! Move quickly!'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73519, 'The dragon is stronger than you, hero! Do not let him finish his attacks!'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73508, 'Let the challenge begin! Hero, you must defeat the Black Prince in close-quarters combat.'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73509, 'You, Wrathion, will be blindfolded.'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73510, 'Black Prince, you are very strong. But what good is strength without the vision to guide it?'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73538, 'Dodge his attacks. Use his strength against him!'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73881, 'The elements are undying! Make use of your time before they rise again!'),
(71136, 3, 0, 73657, 'Very good - lay down your weapons!'),
(71142, 3, 0, 73527, 'The strength to overcome any hardship! This is fortitude.'),
(71142, 3, 0, 73525, 'Mighty Black Ox! Hear our plea.'),
(71142, 3, 0, 73526, 'My champion and I seek your blessing of fortitude.'),
(71142, 3, 0, 73524, 'Here we are, the home of Niuzao, the Black Ox. He is the patron spirit of Pandaren fortitude, the only celestial who chooses to live beyond the wall.'),
(71144, 3, 0, 73531, 'Tell me, Black Prince: What is the nature of fortitude?'),
(71144, 3, 0, 73530, 'So enters the dragon, and his mortal champion. You are welcome here.'),
(71144, 3, 0, 73532, 'You confuse strength with fortitude, young dragon. But power is worthless without spirit!'),
(71152, 0, 0, 105369, 'I''ll guzzle your blood!'),
(71152, 1, 0, 75075, 'Feast on the blood of our enemies!'),
(71152, 2, 0, 75077, 'Avenge me, brothers!'),
