(71160, 15, 0, 75098, 'My calculations, incorrect? Perhaps another 800 years...'),
(71161, 23, 0, 75133, 'Watch how I soar!'),
(71161, 24, 0, 75135, 'Well fought Wakener.  We will meet again...'),
(71166, 3, 0, 73556, 'Seas of blood, cities in ruin! Who are we - one divided world - to stand against a legion?'),
(71166, 3, 0, 73554, '...Great Crane. You have not seen what I have seen.'),
(71166, 3, 0, 73557, 'You speak of hope. Believe me, the thinnest sliver of belief that we might somehow survive the coming devastation is all that sustains me.'),
(71166, 3, 0, 73553, 'Hope is... a belief in a better tomorrow.'),
(71166, 3, 0, 73552, 'My champion and I seek your blessing of hope.'),
(71166, 3, 0, 73550, 'The Red Crane of Hope has inspired the citizens of Pandaria from the very dawn of history. I very much want to speak with him.'),
(71166, 3, 0, 73551, 'Great Red Crane! Hear our plea.'),
(71166, 3, 0, 73555, '... the fires that once burned the sky will return. It is inevitable. The Burning Legion WILL find Azeroth.'),
(71169, 3, 0, 73560, 'Tell me, son of the Earth-Warder: What is the nature of hope?'),
(71169, 3, 0, 73563, 'Rise, son of Deathwing. I will give you my blessing, for you need it more than any I have ever met.'),
(71169, 3, 0, 73559, 'My my, the child of the Worldbreaker, proof that none are beyond redemption. I am honored by your visit.'),
(71169, 3, 0, 73562, 'You underestimate me.'),
(71169, 3, 0, 73809, 'More importantly, your champion would not let you fall. Do you see? With the support of friends, nothing is impossible.'),
(71169, 3, 0, 73808, 'Do not despair, young prince. You are not your father.'),
(71169, 3, 0, 73561, 'You speak, but doubt your own words.'),
(71246, 3, 0, 73591, 'Power units activated.'),
(71246, 3, 0, 73589, 'Containment failure.  Active defense matrix enabled.'),
(71270, 3, 0, 73771, 'Be aware of your surroundings.'),
(71270, 3, 0, 129681, 'Enough!'),
(71270, 3, 0, 73772, 'Do not allow the elements to engage you!'),
(71270, 3, 0, 73881, 'The elements are undying! Make use of your time before they rise again!'),
(71270, 3, 0, 73781, 'Very good - that is enough!'),
(71279, 3, 0, 73516, '%s mutters to himself as he ties the blindfold.'),
(71279, 3, 0, 74011, 'Wrathion is blindfolded, so attack from behind for bonus damage!'),
(71279, 4, 0, 74026, 'Ahhh... Hah!'),
(71279, 4, 0, 74025, 'Stand still! I am trying to kill you here!'),
(71279, 4, 0, 74027, 'Where did you go? Come back!'),
(71280, 3, 0, 74194, '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_pocketwatch_01:20|t Bonus timer started!'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73786, 'Are you certain? You are filled with doubts and fears, young Prince.'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73793, 'Heal the prince, but do not forget to keep yourself alive!'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73788, 'Your champion will keep you alive. Begin!'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73787, 'You have not fully reconciled with your past. Now is the time.'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73805, 'Very well. The test is over.'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73785, 'Let the challenge begin! Hero, you must keep the Black Prince alive with your skills as a healer.'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73806, 'But, do not give into despair. You have the spirit to overcome this. Try again - I believe in you!'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73794, 'Do not miss any opportunity to heal the Black Prince.'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73799, 'Be not afraid of his traps, champion. Your healing is more powerful than his magic!'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73830, 'Well done! You have triumphed!'),
(71314, 3, 0, 73881, 'The elements are undying! Make use of your time before they rise again!'),
(71317, 0, 0, 73916, 'We have done it, hero! We have the blessings of the celestials, and we have completed their challenge.'),
(71317, 0, 0, 73917, 'I know our next step. Meet me back atop Mason''s Folly - you''ll be pleasantly surprised at what I have in store for you!'),
(71317, 3, 0, 73782, 'PAH! A lopsided challenge.'),
(71327, 0, 0, 137474, 'Fire!'),
(71327, 3, 0, 73954, 'Avast, these Horde scallywags have made their way onto our ship.  Take care of them!'),
(71328, 4, 0, 137474, 'Fire!'),
(71329, 4, 0, 121748, 'INCOMING!');
INSERT INTO `tmp_fix_creature_text` VALUES
(71330, 4, 0, 73492, '%s begins to drink a |cFFFF2222|Hspell:141327|h[Volatile Concoction]|h|r.'),
(71330, 4, 0, 121748, 'INCOMING!'),
(71330, 4, 0, 73953, 'Let''s see how this works!'),
(71352, 3, 0, 73784, 'I am pleased that our hero is still alive. Thank you for your blessing, great serpent.'),
(71352, 3, 0, 73782, 'PAH! A lopsided challenge.'),
(71357, 3, 0, 73817, 'What - wait - father!?'),
(71357, 3, 0, 73818, 'Please - don''t make me do this.'),
(71357, 4, 0, 73970, 'Wrathion falls breathlessly to the ground in defeat!'),
(71357, 4, 0, 73804, 'Enough! Make it stop!'),
(71358, 3, 0, 73960, 'It looks like some sort of gigantic chest... probably full of gold.  And it''s all ours!'),
(71358, 3, 0, 73959, 'That was some explosion!  Let''s check it out.'),
(71358, 3, 0, 73965, 'No time to waste... let''s blow this wall to pieces!'),
(71358, 3, 0, 73958, 'It''s all clear then?'),
(71363, 3, 0, 73801, 'Your efforts are insignificant!'),
(71363, 4, 0, 73930, 'Use your body to shield Wrathion from the incoming attacks!'),
(71363, 4, 0, 73802, 'There is no shelter from my fury!'),
(71404, 3, 0, 73810, 'Such... madness...'),
(71409, 4, 0, 77369, '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bomb_05:20|tYou have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:145996|h[Set to Blow]|h|r! Use |cFFFF0000|Hspell:146364|h[Throw Bomb]|h|r to throw them!'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74109, 'And from the Red Crane, a shining beacon of hope for a better world!'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74101, 'Welcome back, champion!'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74106, 'The strength of the White Tiger.'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74111, 'There! It is ready.'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74108, 'The fortitude of the Black Ox.'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74104, 'I''m sorry - where were we? Oh yes! I have something for you:'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74105, 'The very spirits of Pandaria are supporting us in our grand crusade! Behold:'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74110, 'Our world.'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74130, 'My work is not quite finished. This cloak will grant you the power of the celestials.'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74107, 'The wisdom of the Jade Serpent.'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74102, 'Excellent work with the celestials. Can you believe how chatty they were?'),
(71426, 3, 0, 74131, 'Very soon we will be able to augment your cloak with my own formidable draconic powers.'),
(71436, 4, 0, 73941, 'These Alliance pigs are swinging aboard.  Fend them off!'),
(71436, 4, 0, 74129, 'Victory is ours!  Get in the cannon and press the attack!'),
(71445, 0, 0, 73949, 'That''ll teach ''em!  Now hop in that cannon and converge on their lead ship!'),
(71445, 3, 0, 74205, 'More are swinging over.  It looks like this is the last of ''em!'),
(71445, 3, 0, 74135, 'That''s the last of them!  Get to the bottom of the ship and plant those explosives!'),
(71445, 3, 0, 73948, 'We''ve pushed them back to their ship.  Swing over and steal their explosives to blow it to smithereens!'),
(71445, 3, 0, 74182, 'Help us fend off these Alliance dogs!'),
(71454, 0, 0, 75161, 'Nazgrim has failed us. Kor''kron, destroy these intruders!'),
(71454, 2, 0, 75164, 'Weaklings!'),
(71454, 3, 0, 75033, '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_shadesofdarkness.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:142842|h[Breath of Y''Shaarj]|h|r!'),
(71454, 4, 0, 75167, 'The power of the warchief will overwhelm you!'),
(71454, 5, 0, 75165, 'You dare challenge the warchief?'),
(71454, 9, 0, 75168, 'The true Horde cannot be STOPPED!'),
(71454, 10, 0, 75186, '|TInterface\\Icons\\racial_orc_berserkerstrength.blp:20|t%s enters a |cFFF00000|Hspell:142879|h[Blood Rage]|h|r!'),
(71454, 11, 0, 75172, 'The warchief demands it!'),
(71454, 12, 0, 75189, '|TInterface\\Icons\\racial_orc_berserkerstrength.blp:20|t%s''s |cFFF00000|Hspell:142879|h[Blood Rage]|h|r subsides!'),
(71454, 15, 0, 75163, 'Garrosh gives me strength!'),
(71454, 17, 0, 75170, 'To die... for the warchief... is... an... honor...'),
(71466, 0, 0, 74585, '%s shifts into Siege Mode!'),
(71466, 1, 0, 75023, 'The %s prepares a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:144485|h[Shock Pulse]|h|r!'),
(71466, 4, 0, 74584, '%s shifts back into Assault Mode!'),
(71475, 0, 0, 76023, 'You... Rook knows you....'),
(71475, 1, 0, 76024, 'Rook... does not know... head... is cloudy....'),
(71475, 2, 0, 76026, 'Please... help....'),
(71475, 3, 0, 74647, 'Sun... He... aid me.'),
(71475, 4, 0, 74633, 'You will suffer from our failure.'),
(71475, 5, 0, 74644, 'Rook... needs help!'),
(71475, 5, 1, 74643, 'Rook... not safe...'),
(71475, 5, 2, 74645, 'Brawl... with Rook.'),
(71479, 1, 0, 74648, '%s signals for help.'),
(71479, 3, 0, 74652, '%s enters a meditative pose to heal his wounds.'),
(71480, 0, 0, 76025, 'We know only despair now. A fitting punishment for our failure....'),
(71480, 1, 0, 74635, 'Will you succeed where we have failed?'),
(71480, 3, 0, 74633, 'You will suffer from our failure.'),
(71480, 4, 0, 74634, 'Protectors, come to my aid!'),
(71480, 6, 0, 74637, 'We return to when we lost our way. You... are very kind.'),
(71501, 3, 0, 75761, 'Security system deactivated.  Welcome back Siegecrafter Blackfuse.'),
(71501, 3, 0, 75763, 'Have a great day and don''t let the door hit you on the way out.'),
(71504, 0, 0, 74627, 'Time to mix business with pleasure.'),
(71504, 1, 0, 75818, 'You son of a...'),
(71504, 2, 0, 74669, 'The SD-5 Automated Shredder defense unit. A labor of love.'),
(71504, 3, 0, 75817, 'Hey! You''re gonna pay for that!'),
(71504, 4, 0, 74661, 'Another satisfied customer.'),
(71504, 5, 0, 74670, 'Don''t... think you''ve won...'),
(71504, 6, 0, 75819, 'My legacy... will live on...'),
(71515, 0, 0, 75931, 'So, it has come to this. Together, we have learned and grown over the years, and now we find ourselves face to face on the battlefield. Do not think I will go easy on you, nor do I expect any quarter. What we do now, we do for the horde, both of us.'),
(71515, 1, 0, 75932, 'It is an honor to finally face you in combat. Lok''tar Ogar, for Honor, and for the Horde!'),
(71515, 2, 0, 74348, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_offensivestance.blp:20|t General Nazgrim assumes a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143589|h[Battle Stance]|h|r!'),
(71515, 5, 0, 74508, 'Defend the gate!'),
(71515, 6, 0, 74350, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_racial_avatar.blp:20|t General Nazgrim assumes a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143594|h[Berserker Stance]|h|r!'),
(71515, 7, 0, 74505, 'Kor''kron, at my side!'),
(71515, 8, 0, 74349, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_defensivestance.blp:20|t General Nazgrim assumes a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143593|h[Defensive Stance]|h|r!'),
(71515, 9, 0, 74509, 'Rally the forces!'),
(71515, 12, 0, 75928, 'Ah... you have learned much... and learned well... an honorable battle.'),
(71520, 0, 0, 74677, 'Unfinished weapons begin to roll out on the assembly line.'),
(71529, 0, 0, 74269, '%s detects a cluster of injured enemies and goes into a  |cFFFF0404|Hspell:143440|h[Blood Frenzy]|h|r!'),
(71529, 1, 0, 74449, '%s reels in pain and leers angrily at $n.'),
(71543, 0, 0, 74312, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_shawaterelemental_split.blp:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143020|h[Splits]|h|r!'),
(71543, 1, 0, 74315, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_shawaterelemental_reform.blp:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143469|h[Reforms]|h|r!'),
(71543, 15, 0, 74311, '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143309|h[Swirl]|h|r!'),
(71543, 17, 0, 4428, '%s goes into a berserker rage!'),
(71591, 0, 0, 74827, 'An Automated Shredder draws near!'),
(71592, 3, 0, 76748, 'The Klaxxi Paragons go berserk!'),
(71647, 1, 0, 79296, 'Did you get separated from your precious pack?'),
(71647, 1, 0, 79284, 'You cannot defeat us all!'),
(71647, 3, 0, 79292, 'I''ll make a trophy from your head.'),
(71647, 3, 0, 79288, 'Frostwolf scum!'),
(71647, 3, 0, 80941, 'For the Iron Wolf!'),
(71647, 3, 0, 79289, 'You are no match for the Thunderlords!'),
(71647, 3, 0, 79287, 'Thunderlords, to arms!'),
(71658, 0, 0, 74433, 'Intruders! I will lock you in a cell with the rest of the filth.'),
(71658, 1, 0, 74432, 'What''s going on in here? Get that thing back in its cage!'),
(71716, 0, 0, 74362, 'Ga''nar? Is that you? I thought we killed you already.'),
(71716, 1, 0, 74365, 'If you beg like a good dog, my father may-'),
(71716, 2, 0, 74367, 'Hrgh... K-... KILL THEM!!'),
(71734, 0, 0, 75737, 'Come, face me. Give in to your pride. Show me your "Greatness."'),
(71734, 1, 0, 75738, 'So foolish...'),
(71734, 2, 0, 75739, 'You are better than your companions!'),
(71734, 3, 0, 75742, 'Your arrogance feeds me!'),
(71734, 4, 0, 75740, 'Your arrogance compels you...'),
(71734, 5, 0, 75741, 'Succumb to your pride!'),
(71734, 6, 0, 75743, 'You should bow to no king or warchief.'),
(71734, 7, 0, 75745, 'That one is WEAK.'),
(71734, 8, 0, 75744, 'You''ve let your pride cloud your vision, Titan puppet! You can never contain ME!'),
(71734, 9, 0, 75746, 'That one is unworthy of your group.'),
(71734, 10, 0, 75747, 'Blame your companions!'),
(71740, 0, 0, 76961, '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Siege_Engineer_Superheated.blp:20|t Shanna is firing her laser at you!'),
(71742, 0, 0, 74431, 'Stop, my brothers! Do you not see the beast of burden before you?'),
(71742, 1, 0, 74390, 'Do you not see the light of Kros? He has been defiled!'),
(71744, 3, 0, 74389, 'Strength to the Skumblade!'),
(71744, 3, 0, 75344, 'Run for it!!!'),
(71744, 3, 0, 74387, 'By the blood of Kros!'),
(71744, 3, 0, 74386, 'Yes! Consume him! Meat and bone!'),
(71744, 3, 0, 74388, 'Taste his flesh! Drink his blood!'),
(71749, 0, 0, 74448, 'Thank you, friends. I will lend what aid I can.'),
(71763, 0, 0, 74441, 'Burn them all! Burn them to ash!'),
(71780, 3, 0, 81136, 'Well fought! We will meet you just up ahead!'),
(71784, 0, 0, 74426, 'Don''t let $Ghim:her; escape!'),
(71784, 0, 0, 74424, 'Stop $Ghim:her;!'),
(71784, 3, 0, 74425, 'Don''t let $Ghim:her; through!'),
(71788, 0, 0, 76896, 'A crawler mine detonated on $n!'),
(71788, 1, 0, 74801, '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Siege_Engineer_Detonate.blp:20|tA Crawler Mine has targeted you!'),
(71828, 0, 0, 75968, 'Once again, you must defend me. Rotun, give us a challenge this time.'),
(71828, 1, 0, 75963, 'Illusionary Foragers are attacking. Do not let their cute faces fool you. They can work together to cause terrible devastation.'),
(71828, 3, 0, 75967, 'Greetings, again. Our next trial will be more challenging. Prepare to defend me.'),
(71828, 4, 0, 75958, 'Illusionary Rippers approaching. They should pose little challenge; they are but mindless grunts.'),
(71828, 4, 0, 75962, 'Illusionary Ambushers! Get their attention, quick. And get them away from me, so they cannot hit me with their devastating bananas!'),
(71828, 4, 0, 75965, 'I am down. Maybe I should bring more healing herbs for next time.'),
(71828, 4, 0, 75956, 'Help! Get these things off of me!'),
(71828, 4, 0, 75960, 'A new enemy, Illusionary Flamecallers. They cast fireballs and spew lava. Use the lava to your advantage; it will burn the other illusions.'),
(71828, 4, 0, 75961, 'Beware! Illusionary Wind-Guards can use their wings to knock you back. When they do, they will likely switch to attacking me instead.'),
(71828, 4, 0, 75959, 'Prepare your defenses. That is an Illusionary Conqueror! When they become enraged, they gain great strength, and nothing can stop them.'),
(71858, 0, 0, 76934, 'Bend to our will!'),
(71859, 0, 0, 76934, 'Bend to our will!'),
(71865, 2, 0, 74711, 'Die with honor!'),
(71865, 3, 0, 74710, 'Farseers, mend our wounds!'),
(71865, 4, 0, 74707, 'Witness the power of the True Horde''s arsenal!'),
(71865, 5, 0, 74708, 'We will cleanse this world in steel and fire!'),
(71865, 6, 0, 74610, 'Anger. Hatred. Fear!! They are weapons of war - the tools of a Warchief!'),
(71865, 7, 0, 74616, 'Yes... yes I can see now...I can see the future of this world...a world ruled by the horde...MY horde.'),
(71865, 9, 0, 74715, 'The power to crush your world, and everything on it!'),
(71865, 10, 0, 74724, 'The True Horde WILL come to pass.  I have SEEN it.  IT HAS SHOWN ME. I HAVE SEEN MOUNTAINS OF SKULLS AND RIVERS OF BLOOD.  AND I WILL...HAVE...MY...WORLD!'),
(71865, 11, 0, 134193, 'Pathetic!'),
(71865, 12, 0, 75369, 'No... It cannot end...like this...What I... What I have seen...'),
(71865, 13, 0, 74723, 'You will be trapped for eternity!'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74473, 'Sorry for ribbin'' ya so much.'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74464, 'I''m not THAT snarky, am I?'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74477, 'Who needs a body when your jokes got legs?'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74478, 'Ya know... my heart really ain''t in it.'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74468, 'I know my jokes ain''t so good... I lost my funny bone!'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74481, 'I always wanted to play the organ.'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74472, 'Maybe I''m a bit of a bonehead...'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74484, 'Say anythin'', it won''t get under my skin!'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74471, 'Who just called me a numbskull?'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74465, 'I got a bone to pick wit'' you!'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74476, 'Want to hear somethin'' funny? Coccyx.'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74474, 'Sometimes you gotta be sternum with unruly ghosts.'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74482, 'I love you wit'' every bone in my body!'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74467, 'What kind of spirit haunts a chicken coop? A poultry geist!'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74469, 'You ain''t foolin'' nobody, ghosty! I can see right through you!'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74466, 'Why don''t I dance at parties? I have no body to dance wit''!'),
(71869, 0, 0, 74489, 'Good deal. Welcome to the spirit world. Kinda. Let''s check out the chests for any goodies, and see if you can find my body somewhere!'),
(71869, 3, 0, 74485, 'Sticks and stones may break my bones...'),
(71869, 3, 0, 74483, 'I''m bonin'' up on my spirit lore.'),
(71869, 3, 0, 74479, 'They didn''t leave me with a leg to stand on!'),
(71869, 3, 0, 74487, 'I''m not sure I have the stomach for this...'),
(71869, 3, 0, 74480, 'Ghosts must get cold. The wind goes straight through ''em!'),
(71869, 3, 0, 74486, 'I thought about askin'' her out but I didn''t have the guts.'),
(71876, 3, 0, 74488, 'Hey, meat sack! If you got five minutes, come talk to me! I got no body!'),
(71889, 0, 0, 75750, 'Hey, we recording?  Yeah?  Okay.  Goblin-Titan control module starting up, please stand back.'),
(71889, 1, 0, 75751, 'Checking out the datas, hold on a second will ya.'),
(71889, 2, 0, 75752, 'Oh, now you did it, that was really really really not the correct input code.'),
(71889, 3, 0, 75754, 'Activating GB-11010 "Armageddon"-class defense systems. Hey, does anybody know if we''re zoned for this?'),
(71889, 4, 0, 75756, 'Initiating system reset. Module 1 at 50%%. Hey, system reset requires two modules to complete.'),
(71889, 5, 0, 75757, 'Module 1''s all prepared for system reset.'),
(71889, 6, 0, 75758, 'Initiating system reset. Module 2 at 50%%. Hey, system reset requires two modules to complete.'),
(71889, 7, 0, 75759, 'Module 2''s all prepared for system reset.'),
(71889, 8, 0, 75760, 'System resetting. Don''t turn the power off, or the whole thing will probably explode.'),
(71914, 0, 0, 75173, 'The Iron Juggernaut focuses a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:144918|h[Cutter Laser]|h|r on you!'),
(71952, 0, 0, 75897, 'When faced with challenges the like you have never seen, what do you hope for? What is the future you seek?'),
(71952, 1, 0, 75898, 'Then let us begin.'),
(71952, 2, 0, 75900, 'Without hope, there is no brightness in the future!'),
(71952, 3, 0, 75903, 'Your hope shines brightly, and even more brightly when you work together to overcome. It will ever light your way in even the darkest of places.'),
(71953, 0, 0, 75916, 'Return twice as powerful!'),
(71953, 1, 0, 75913, 'Believe in your strength!'),
(71953, 2, 0, 75915, 'Do not mistake the power that darkness offers for true strength!'),
(71953, 3, 0, 75914, 'You have the power to change your destiny!'),
(71953, 5, 0, 75917, 'You are strong, stronger even than you realize. Carry this thought with you into the darkness ahead, and let it shield you.'),
(71954, 0, 0, 75890, 'Can you stand on the tallest peak, winds and sleet buffeting your skin, until the trees wither and the mountains fall into the sea?'),
(71954, 1, 0, 112255, 'We shall see.'),
(71954, 2, 0, 75892, 'The winds may be strong, and the sleet may sting.'),
(71954, 3, 0, 75896, 'Though you will be surrounded by foes greater than you can imagine, your fortitude shall allow you to endure. Remember this in the times ahead.'),
(71954, 6, 0, 75893, 'You are the mountain, unmovable by all but time.'),
(71955, 0, 0, 75904, 'The lesson of true wisdom lies within you dear heroes, and in the choices you make. When faced with overwhelming darkness, will you make the right decisions?'),
(71955, 1, 0, 75907, 'Do not let your judgment be clouded in trying times!'),
(71955, 2, 0, 75910, 'Your wisdom has seen you through this trial. May it ever light your way out of dark places.'),
(71965, 0, 0, 74958, 'You have been judged, and proven yourselves worthy. But be warned, what lies beyond will try your souls to their utmost.  When you are fully prepared, you may enter the chamber.'),
(71965, 1, 0, 74962, 'The corruption is amplifying.  The fragments must be purged before it becomes too great.'),
(71965, 2, 0, 74963, 'It did not matter. It comes.  Steel your hearts and prepare your souls.'),
(71965, 3, 0, 74966, 'Free yourself of arrogance.'),
(71965, 3, 1, 74965, 'Be humble.'),
(71965, 4, 0, 74964, 'You... must... contain... it...'),
(71967, 0, 0, 75026, 'Halt!'),
(71967, 1, 0, 75027, 'No further corruption will enter the heart chamber!'),
