(72872, 4, 0, 74991, 'Further corruption?  No, we are here to stop the corruption, and save Pandaria!'),
(72872, 5, 0, 74992, 'Yes! Please let us pass!'),
(72873, 3, 0, 76602, 'You''ve made your final mistake, foreigner. Feel the power of lava as your bones melt!'),
(72873, 4, 0, 76603, 'My body becomes one with the volcanoes.'),
(72873, 4, 0, 76661, 'Aid me, essence of lava!'),
(72874, 3, 0, 76959, 'With the warlock''s magic device, you and I will spy upon the Shadow Council.'),
(72874, 3, 0, 77064, 'Gul''dan is with them!'),
(72874, 3, 0, 94168, 'I''ll see you there.'),
(72874, 3, 0, 76967, 'Let me know when you''re ready.'),
(72875, 0, 0, 76011, 'Ordos guide my way!'),
(72875, 3, 0, 76015, 'For Ordos!'),
(72875, 4, 0, 76012, 'The flames are truth!');
INSERT INTO `tmp_fix_creature_text` VALUES
(72875, 4, 0, 76017, 'For the ever-burning flame!'),
(72875, 4, 0, 113309, 'You will bleed!'),
(72875, 4, 0, 76013, 'My fate is written in flames!'),
(72906, 3, 0, 76894, 'Use the Vial of Moon Water to compel the All-Seeing Eye.$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Potion_20.blp:64|t'),
(72906, 3, 0, 76895, 'When the demon is weakened, read from the Scripture of Elune.$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Scroll_12.blp:64|t'),
(72940, 0, 0, 75326, 'Grom''gar. Built in the corpse of a colossus. Look at the size of that thing...'),
(72940, 1, 0, 81403, 'Can you imagine a live colossus? They say this was the last one, and the Thunderlord clan took it down generations ago.'),
(72940, 2, 0, 75328, 'There he is! Karg!'),
(72940, 3, 0, 75474, 'What''s it look like? Saving your hide!'),
(72940, 4, 0, 75475, 'Where is Nerok?'),
(72940, 6, 0, 75537, 'Being broken? Nerok would die before he obeyed them!'),
(72940, 7, 0, 77268, 'You smell Asha, don''t you? I... am so sorry, Nerok. I failed to protect her.'),
(72947, 0, 0, 76900, 'Warlord Zaela orders a |cFFFF0404|hKor''kron Demolisher|h|r to assault the tower!'),
(72953, 4, 0, 76594, 'Don''t hit me, stupid!'),
(72955, 4, 0, 111955, 'Hey, watch it!'),
(72964, 0, 0, 77114, 'You''re about to take a turn for the worse!'),
(72964, 1, 0, 77113, 'You''re Screwed!'),
(72964, 3, 0, 77115, 'This is going to hurt a bit!'),
(72967, 3, 0, 76534, 'You dare interrupt my dinner?!'),
(72967, 4, 0, 76536, 'So, soo... hungry... Ack!!'),
(72971, 3, 0, 75337, 'Reffus lliw uoy!'),
(72971, 3, 0, 75340, 'Aaaaaghh!'),
(72971, 3, 0, 75341, 'Lovely day for a compulsion!'),
(72971, 3, 0, 75348, 'Blarggggrgggrggrrr!'),
(72971, 3, 0, 75334, 'It burns!'),
(72971, 3, 0, 75350, 'No more! I will turn my gaze upon Gul''var for you...'),
(72971, 3, 0, 75338, 'Your ancestors will languish!'),
(72971, 3, 0, 122695, 'Ahahahahaha!'),
(72971, 3, 0, 75335, 'No more!'),
(72971, 3, 0, 75336, 'I''ll show you nothing!'),
(72987, 3, 0, 75430, 'Keep it down! Stupid dog.'),
(72994, 0, 0, 75383, 'They stand no chance against Xuen.'),
(72994, 3, 0, 75382, 'Xuen will not be defeated. He is grace in battle.'),
(72994, 3, 0, 75386, 'This will be a battle to tell your friends about, Eli.'),
(72994, 3, 0, 75391, 'Be careful. I would not want you to fall into the arena.'),
(73037, 3, 0, 75606, 'Please come down, Fish. It isn''t safe up there.'),
(73037, 3, 0, 75607, 'If you fall off, I''m not going in after you!'),
(73037, 3, 0, 75609, 'Fine, fall off. I don''t care.'),
(73037, 3, 0, 75608, 'Please, come down. How am I ever going to explain this to the rest of the Tillers?'),
(73039, 3, 0, 76145, 'Why does the ground shake? Are we under attack?'),
(73039, 3, 0, 76142, 'The farseer says that Shui Halad has awakened.'),
(73061, 3, 0, 76079, 'What could create such a thing?'),
(73066, 0, 0, 75469, 'A legend is born!'),
(73097, 0, 0, 75476, 'We were separated. Where is Asha?'),
(73097, 1, 0, 75530, 'Face my axe!'),
(73097, 2, 0, 75535, 'You should have killed me when you had the chance. Now where is my wolf?!'),
(73097, 3, 0, 75536, 'I know. We''d better find him before that happens.'),
(73097, 4, 0, 77265, 'Come, brother. You are free now.'),
(73097, 5, 0, 77269, 'So many brothers and sisters lost...'),
(73097, 6, 0, 79479, 'Lokra... with you at my side, I feel invincible! Let us challenge the Iron Wolf right now and end this!'),
(73138, 0, 0, 75725, 'Fools! Imbeciles!'),
(73138, 0, 0, 75585, 'Idiot king!'),
(73138, 0, 0, 75798, 'A complete waste!'),
(73166, 4, 0, 76069, 'The Spineclaw scuttles away in fear!'),
(73195, 0, 0, 75724, 'Deal with the devilsaur first, then we''ll lock the rest up!'),
(73195, 0, 0, 75723, 'Shock it until it can''t move anymore!  It''s causing a riot in here!'),
(73195, 0, 0, 75722, 'It''s busting out of the cage!  Arm the shock collar, get that thing under control!'),
(73222, 3, 0, 77144, 'A soft hum ceases as the corruption creating new Puddles ebbs away with the death of the final Aqueous Defender.'),
(73225, 3, 0, 76145, 'Why does the ground shake? Are we under attack?'),
(73243, 1, 0, 76689, 'You''re just in time, sacrifice!'),
(73250, 3, 0, 76089, 'Your journey ends here cowards! These doors won''t open as long as I live!'),
(73250, 3, 0, 75806, 'Let the intruders come this way! I look forward to crushing their skulls.'),
(73250, 3, 0, 75807, 'Of course, those cowards will likely sneak by rather than face my wrath.'),
(73250, 4, 0, 75809, 'Falling to me would probably be the greatest achievement they could hope to obtain.'),
(73250, 4, 0, 75808, 'What else would you expect from those without valor?'),
(73278, 0, 0, 75799, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_garrosh_siege_engine.blp:20|t The Fleet Captain detected a cluster! Firing |cFFFF0000|Hspell:147047|h[Unstable Iron Star]|h|r!'),
(73303, 0, 0, 75935, 'The Red Crane saw hope in me, and instructed me to look inward. Despite my visage of despair, I found this hope, and the despair was vanquished.'),
(73303, 1, 0, 75939, 'You have walked the trial of hope, and learned of the path of the Red Crane. May it guide your footsteps through time.'),
(73303, 2, 0, 75934, 'When my journey began, I was reckless in my strength. The White Tiger taught me control. My hatred, anger, and violence were vanquished.'),
(73303, 3, 0, 75938, 'You have walked the trial of strength, and learned of the path of the White Tiger. May you remember this lesson, always.'),
(73303, 4, 0, 75933, 'Long ago, the Jade Serpent instructed me to purify my spirit and become one with the land, my doubts were vanquished.'),
(73303, 5, 0, 75937, 'You have walked the trial of wisdom, and learned of the path of the Jade Serpent. May you learn from this lesson, as I did.'),
(73303, 6, 0, 75936, 'In the face of great fear, the Black Ox taught me fortitude. Through terror and darkness it persevered. The fear was vanquished.'),
(73303, 7, 0, 75940, 'You have walked the trial of fortitude, and learned of the path of the Black Ox. May it bless your passage.'),
(73318, 0, 0, 75826, 'Over here, hero!'),
(73318, 3, 0, 75829, 'Come with me, hero. Let us return to the Vale. There is someone I think who would be particularly interested in this turn of events, if we can get his attention.'),
(73318, 3, 0, 75827, 'My my - this is all that remains of the terrible being that haunted Pandaria all these years.'),
(73318, 3, 0, 75828, 'Whatever darkness it once exuded is silent at last.'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75986, '...you ...you''re just a WAITER!'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75985, 'Uhh... wha?'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75988, 'Next time, I will leave nothing to chance.'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75840, 'What? Yes, I was backing the Alliance.'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75839, 'TONG! DRINK! NOW!'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75989, 'NOTHING!'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75953, 'Should''ve taken over the throne room myself. Like Auntie Onyxia. Get things DONE.'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75951, 'But that idiot, IDIOT Wrynn! "High King" indeed!'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75834, 'You were there! Is it true then? What happened in Orgrimmar?'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75838, 'Oh sure, another year of fighting. Enormous casualties trying to take Thunder Bluff. But the rest of the Horde would''ve caved, eventually.'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75952, 'Why did he allow another warchief? He could''ve united the world under the Alliance banner. What a fool I was to trust his ambition!'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75836, 'That fool king!!'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75944, 'Oh, don''t look so surprised! I''m a black dragon. My loyalties are my own.'),
(73319, 3, 0, 75987, 'I promise you this: I will stop at nothing to prepare this world for the battle to come.'),
(73320, 1, 0, 76132, 'Quickly! Kill the intruders!'),
(73320, 1, 0, 76129, 'The Council''s will be done!'),
(73320, 1, 0, 76130, 'Time to die, $pc!'),
(73320, 1, 0, 130980, 'Ahh... The shadow comes!'),
(73320, 1, 0, 76131, 'Your soul will be consumed!'),
(73320, 3, 0, 76133, 'Kill the outsider!'),
(73320, 3, 0, 76135, 'You''re too late!'),
(73330, 0, 0, 74968, 'Ah, we adventure together again, except this time I am afraid that the circumstances are much more dire.'),
(73330, 1, 0, 74970, 'The land is scarred, the ever-blooming trees and plants wither and die as the water from the pools drains away.'),
(73330, 2, 0, 74972, 'Once, the Titans used these life-giving waters to create and shape all life in Pandaria.'),
(73330, 3, 0, 74973, 'It is these waters that kept the Vale in bloom.  Their runoff into the Valley of the Four Winds created the most fertile farmland in the world!'),
(73330, 4, 0, 74974, 'And now, the malignance of the Old God has manifested itself within the waters.'),
(73330, 5, 0, 74975, 'Such a foul, foul thing - destroy it, before it seeps deep into the soil and corrupts all of Pandaria!'),
(73330, 6, 0, 74976, 'Ah, you have done it!  The waters are pure once more.'),
(73330, 7, 0, 74977, 'Can you feel their life-giving energies flow through you?'),
(73330, 8, 0, 74978, 'It will take much time for the Vale to heal, but you have given us hope!'),
(73330, 9, 0, 74979, 'Can it be...? Oh no, no no no no no.'),
(73330, 10, 0, 74980, 'The Golden Lotus... they pledged their lives to defend this place.'),
(73330, 11, 0, 74981, 'Yes!  Rook Stonetoe!  You remember me!  What has happened to you?'),
(73330, 13, 0, 74984, 'This is a fate far worse than death - please, heroes!  Set their souls free!'),
(73330, 14, 0, 88693, 'Rest in peace.'),
(73330, 15, 0, 74986, 'May your souls become one with the land you gave your life to protect.'),
(73342, 0, 0, 76028, 'The waters have not been cleansed!'),
(73342, 1, 0, 76031, 'You must protect me.'),
(73342, 2, 0, 76032, 'It falls to you to defend your master.'),
(73346, 3, 0, 75984, '...He destroyed my inn. He left no tip. He is not nice.'),
(73346, 3, 0, 75979, 'Always you speak. Never do you listen! You ignore the lessons of Pandaria!'),
(73346, 3, 0, 75982, 'So it is with your Alliance and your Horde. They are not strong despite one another; they are strong BECAUSE of one another.'),
(73346, 3, 0, 75983, 'You mistake your greatest strength for weakness. Do you see this?'),
(73346, 3, 0, 125689, 'Stay your blade!'),
(73346, 3, 0, 75981, 'When the last emperor hid our land from the rest of the world, he also preserved the homeland of our ancient enemy, the mantid. Why did he do this?'),
(73346, 3, 0, 75980, 'You see, there is balance in all things. Wisdom etched in our very fur: Black and white. Darkness and light.'),
(73346, 3, 0, 75978, 'Talk! Talk! Talk!'),
(73346, 3, 0, 75990, 'He did so to keep the land whole. Living with the mantid for ten thousand years has made us both STRONG.'),
(73349, 0, 0, 76002, 'We must defend the pools from their corruption!'),
(73360, 3, 0, 77282, 'This metal is not like any you have worked with. It will fight back. Your will must be stronger!'),
(73360, 3, 0, 77283, 'Strike hard, and with purpose. As if you were crushing the skull of a hated foe!'),
(73360, 3, 0, 77293, 'Keep up the momentum!'),
(73360, 3, 0, 77295, 'Good. Those are good strikes.'),
(73360, 3, 0, 77294, 'Every swing brings us closer to crushing our foes!'),
(73371, 3, 0, 76595, 'Back off, dis one is mine!'),
(73371, 4, 0, 76598, 'Urgh, I kill you for that!'),
(73395, 3, 0, 82583, 'Champion, the naaru has come to aid us. We must defend it while it gathers power!'),
(73395, 4, 0, 82584, 'We''ve done it! Now to put an end to this assault...'),
(73395, 5, 0, 82762, 'We need to spread news of our victory. Take the fey dragon and meet me back at Embaari Village.'),
(73395, 6, 0, 82590, 'Hero, you fought fearlessly. For that, please accept my thanks.'),
(73395, 7, 0, 88712, 'The Light prevails, because WE stand against the darkness.'),
(73426, 3, 0, 100540, 'This wouldn''t have happened if your backside weren''t so...<ahem>... GENEROUS.'),
(73426, 3, 0, 95292, 'We''ll tend to the wounded up here. Go quickly. Wake the Archdruid.'),
(73435, 3, 0, 77077, 'The perfect mix of northern and southern styles!'),
(73435, 3, 0, 77080, 'Dare ta drink a Dragon P.I.E.! It''ll put hair on yer chest, and then hair on THAT!'),
(73435, 3, 0, 77078, 'GRUB N'' GROG!'),
(73435, 3, 0, 77079, 'Ye won''t find anythin'' like it elsewhere. Come and try!'),
(73443, 3, 0, 75153, 'We''re certain the Shadow Council is involved, but we''ve yet to pinpoint them.'),
(73443, 3, 0, 75152, 'I''ve been scouting the dunes. A demonic force has infected some of the beasts.'),
(73443, 3, 0, 75151, 'Khadgar will join us on the way. Come, Throm''var lies just over the ridge.'),
(73443, 3, 0, 75730, 'Khadgar. I was just explaining the situation.'),
(73458, 4, 0, 80965, 'Saddle up maggot, you''re going for a ride!'),
(73458, 4, 0, 80964, 'I''m gonna rearrange your nuts and bolts!'),
(73465, 1, 0, 76129, 'The Council''s will be done!'),
(73465, 1, 0, 76135, 'You''re too late!'),
(73465, 1, 0, 130980, 'Ahh... The shadow comes!'),
(73465, 1, 0, 76131, 'Your soul will be consumed!'),
(73465, 3, 0, 76132, 'Quickly! Kill the intruders!'),
(73468, 1, 0, 82413, 'Lok-Narash!'),
(73468, 1, 0, 116696, 'Your death is certain!'),
(73468, 1, 0, 76124, 'Get that $pc!'),
(73468, 1, 0, 139429, 'To arms!'),
(73468, 1, 0, 83377, 'Leave nothing alive!'),
(73468, 3, 0, 76119, 'Stop the intruder!'),
(73468, 4, 0, 76123, 'Destroy the $pc!'),
(73469, 1, 0, 77580, 'This only hurt for a second.'),
(73469, 3, 0, 82493, 'All my stuff in dat tower too...'),
(73469, 3, 0, 82489, 'I didn''t break it!'),
(73469, 3, 0, 82491, 'Not gonna turn around.'),
(73469, 3, 0, 82492, 'Hope it run out of juice soon.'),
(73469, 3, 0, 82487, 'It broke.'),
(73470, 4, 0, 111955, 'Hey, watch it!'),
(73470, 4, 0, 76605, 'Dats what I thought!'),
(73470, 4, 0, 76594, 'Don''t hit me, stupid!'),
(73470, 4, 0, 76596, 'Argh! I kill you first, den I smash little one!'),
(73475, 3, 0, 76717, 'Do you feel the power they''re drawing on? (It''s the naaru in Nagrand!)'),
(73475, 3, 0, 76952, 'We should subjugate these Pale orcs and the... (An intruder! Let''s leave.)'),
(73480, 3, 0, 76041, 'Be careful, my friend. Gul''dan is not to be underestimated no matter how prepared you might be.'),
(73480, 3, 0, 81161, 'Unfortunate, but now we know more. You can take the portal back to Throm''var.'),
(73480, 3, 0, 77123, 'The three crystals are strategically located about the ruins. Destroy them with the Heart of Fernus.'),
(73483, 3, 0, 74699, 'Then you have forced my hand.  I will correct the mistake I made long ago.  Spirits of the wind, the earth, the water, hear my call!  Come to my aid!'),
(73483, 3, 0, 74698, 'It is not too late, Garrosh. Lay down the mantle of Warchief. We can end this here, now, with no more bloodshed.'),
(73490, 1, 0, 77581, 'You no supposed to be here! Smash!'),
(73490, 3, 0, 77580, 'This only hurt for a second.'),
(73490, 3, 0, 94905, 'We''re being attacked!'),
(73490, 4, 0, 111955, 'Hey, watch it!'),
(73490, 4, 0, 76595, 'Back off, dis one is mine!'),
(73493, 3, 0, 76168, 'Blue wire with the green stripe, or black wire with the yellow stripe? I can never remember.'),
(73494, 3, 0, 76171, 'Wait for me!'),
(73495, 3, 0, 76168, 'Blue wire with the green stripe, or black wire with the yellow stripe? I can never remember.'),
(73550, 3, 0, 76167, 'Steady hands..'),
(73551, 3, 0, 76171, 'Wait for me!'),
(73553, 3, 0, 76171, 'Wait for me!'),
(73554, 0, 0, 75219, 'You''re still alive! Good. There''s chaos in the city streets.'),
(73554, 3, 0, 75220, 'The Kor''kron are making a push for this compound. They''re not giving up!'),
(73558, 3, 0, 75239, 'We''ll post up here with some troops. Scout on ahead and see if you can flush Garrosh out of hiding.'),
(73558, 3, 0, 75238, 'Our lines are holding, but Vol''jin''s rebels are taking a beating.'),
(73565, 0, 0, 75327, 'The door barring the South Tower has been breached!'),
(73587, 3, 0, 76532, 'You heard the king, bolster the line! Give our heroes the time they need to reach Garrosh!'),
(73590, 1, 0, 74219, 'We will purge this land!'),
(73598, 3, 0, 77049, 'Come heroes, through the portal! The siege of Orgrimmar begins!'),
(73598, 3, 0, 77045, 'So Hellscream''s arrogance unleashed the last of the sha. I am not surprised.'),
(73598, 3, 0, 77046, 'Gorehowl.'),
(73598, 3, 0, 77048, 'I''m warning you, Lor''themar. The Alliance is besieging the city and we will destroy Hellscream. Your people had best stay out of our way.'),
(73605, 3, 0, 77040, 'Look here! He left his weapon behind.'),
(73605, 3, 0, 77043, 'It is always a pleasure to see you, Lady Proudmoore.'),
(73605, 3, 0, 77041, 'This means he''s completely unhinged.'),
(73605, 3, 0, 77044, 'Champions, come with me. It''s time to settle grievances with our... "Warchief."'),
(73605, 3, 0, 77042, 'Likewise. Sylvanas and I have both sent ships to support Vol''jin''s revolution.'),
(73618, 3, 0, 77102, 'Nothing beats the bold bite of Greenstone Brew!'),
(73618, 3, 0, 77100, 'Greenstone Brew! Straight from the heart of the Jade Forest.'),
(73622, 0, 0, 77025, 'Hungry? Thirsty? Tired? Let Graceful Swan take care of you!'),
(73622, 3, 0, 77024, 'Come rest your weary feet, adventurer!'),
(73622, 3, 0, 77022, 'Come rest for a while in the shade!'),
(73628, 0, 0, 75329, 'The door barring the North Tower has been breached!'),
(73647, 3, 0, 77055, 'Exotic, aromatic, a brew good for both body and spirit!'),
(73648, 3, 0, 77059, 'Sap is where it''s at.'),
(73648, 3, 0, 62600, 'YEAH! BEEEEEER!!!'),
(73651, 3, 0, 77094, 'Stormstout: The emperor of brews!'),
(73651, 3, 0, 77093, 'When you say Stormstout, you''ve said it all.'),
(73651, 3, 0, 77099, 'Stormstout. Probably the best brew in Azeroth.'),
(73656, 0, 0, 77026, 'Arms and armor repaired!'),
(73656, 3, 0, 77028, 'Don''t be caught unprepared! Let Crafter Kwon see to your gear!'),
(73657, 3, 0, 77069, 'Come, sit down, enjoy a meal!'),
(73657, 3, 0, 77073, 'Delicious dishes and fresh-made island delicacies!'),
(73657, 3, 0, 77068, 'For the finest food, look no further!'),
(73666, 3, 0, 76582, 'Your challenge has been answered, outsider. Ordon, claim this area in the name of the Burning God!'),
(73698, 1, 0, 77580, 'This only hurt for a second.'),
(73698, 1, 0, 77581, 'You no supposed to be here! Smash!'),
(73698, 1, 0, 94905, 'We''re being attacked!'),
(73698, 4, 0, 76594, 'Don''t hit me, stupid!'),
(73698, 4, 0, 76596, 'Argh! I kill you first, den I smash little one!'),
(73709, 0, 0, 76615, 'Garrosh be concealin'' a whole hidden base. Where did his lust for power take him?'),
(73709, 3, 0, 76618, 'It''s gonna be fine, Baine. We gonna find Thrall, gonna kill de Warchief, gonna avenge your father.'),
(73709, 3, 0, 76616, 'Baine, you and your warriors hold this junction. These heroes should forge ahead an'' flush the Warchief out of hiding.'),
(73709, 3, 0, 76617, 'People be dyin'' up above. Da city is in chaos. I''m gonna finish it - stop da bloodshed. I''ll come back for ya.'),
(73709, 3, 0, 76619, 'Hah. Darkspear never die.'),
(73710, 3, 0, 76629, 'What about you?'),
(73710, 3, 0, 76627, 'We will soon find out. He is cornered like a rat down one of these corridors.'),
(73710, 3, 0, 112068, 'Earth mother watch over you.'),
(73710, 3, 0, 76628, 'What should we do next?'),
(73710, 3, 0, 76630, '...very well.'),
(73715, 3, 0, 76733, 'I''ve got the brains, you''ve got the muscle. Together, we''ll make beautiful carnage.'),
(73716, 3, 0, 76677, 'Ah, more of Vol''jin''s revolutionaries. You''ve made it.'),
(73716, 3, 0, 76680, 'Ah, Nazgrim. A great leader and a fine warrior. He valued his oath to the Warchief more than his life.'),
(73716, 3, 0, 76679, 'Tell me, how goes the battle up above? What of Nazgrim? Speak to me!'),
(73716, 3, 0, 76678, 'Have you found Thrall? I am badly hurt, he insisted on going ahead alone.'),
(73716, 3, 0, 76682, 'Damn Hellscream.  His ambition tore our Horde apart.'),
(73716, 3, 0, 76683, 'Go on, find Thrall.  Finish this.  I will live.'),
(73729, 0, 0, 76734, 'The harbor defenses have fallen! Kor''kron, fall back and move to higher ground!'),
(73763, 0, 0, 79096, 'Who challenges da hammer of Frostfire?!'),
(73763, 1, 0, 76858, 'Do you like hammers?'),
(73763, 4, 0, 76869, 'Bet you didn''t know I had a fif hammer!'),
(73763, 4, 0, 76860, 'Don''t need deez no more.'),
(73763, 4, 0, 76863, 'Deez hammers is stupid.'),
(73763, 4, 0, 76875, 'Da more hammers da better!'),
