(76265, 7, 0, 79219, 'We did it! This elixir should do the trick.'),
(76265, 8, 0, 79220, 'Here, give this to Gidwin. Hopefully this works.'),
(76266, 2, 0, 81505, '$n activates the Great Spire''s Focusing Iris!'),
(76289, 1, 0, 80953, 'Here''s another come to die.'),
(76289, 1, 0, 80952, 'You cannot save them!'),
(76289, 3, 0, 80951, 'The weak deserve this!'),
(76289, 3, 0, 80954, 'We will crush you just the same!'),
(76289, 3, 0, 99327, 'Crush them!'),
(76328, 0, 0, 79234, 'Korhol, Zhakta, Trokar... move in from all sides. Gargrak, hold for now.'),
(76328, 3, 0, 79235, 'ZHAKTA NO!... you will be avenged!'),
(76328, 3, 0, 79238, 'Call in all reinforcements. I want the She-Wolf taken alive.'),
(76328, 3, 0, 79237, 'Dammit all. Gargrak, go now... kill the blind shaman.'),
(76328, 3, 0, 79239, 'RETREAT! WE''LL BE BACK, FROSTWOLVES!'),
(76413, 1, 0, 79507, 'Disrupt Rune Conduits to weaken Gor''ashan''s defenses.'),
(76434, 3, 0, 79183, 'Damn Thunderlords and their cheap hunting spears. I''ll be picking these things up for a week!'),
(76465, 4, 0, 77943, '%s flees in fear!'),
(76468, 1, 0, 79351, 'Free yourself of weakness, or be swept away by the Iron Tide!'),
(76484, 3, 0, 79684, 'All Frostwolves - charge ahead! Take that thing down!'),
(76484, 3, 0, 79655, 'You go too, $p.  Make sure my brother doesn''t get himself killed.'),
(76484, 3, 0, 79638, 'Hold your position, Frostwolves! Let them come to you!'),
(76484, 3, 0, 79628, 'We will hold the line here.'),
(76484, 3, 0, 79679, 'We are counting on you, shaman!'),
(76484, 3, 0, 79641, 'We can''t fight with this cannon fire coming down. Thrall! $p! Take care of that tank!'),
(76484, 4, 0, 79667, 'I''ll be waiting.'),
(76484, 4, 0, 79661, 'Spears incoming! Hold your ground!'),
(76484, 4, 0, 79683, 'GRONN!'),
(76484, 4, 0, 79653, 'Drek''Thar''s in trouble. Ga''nar, get out there and lend him a hand.'),
(76484, 4, 0, 79677, 'Drek''Thar! How much time do you need?'),
(76485, 3, 0, 79670, 'Yeah. A few.'),
(76485, 3, 0, 79629, 'Drek''Thar, you can speak with the earth. Do you think you can collapse this canyon?'),
(76485, 4, 0, 100874, 'This one''s mine.'),
(76485, 4, 0, 79674, 'A real man treats his mate with respect!'),
(76485, 4, 0, 79672, 'Well... if it''ll make you happy, then LET''S PLAY!'),
(76485, 4, 0, 79668, 'Come back me up, $p.'),
(76486, 3, 0, 79656, 'I can still hear you!'),
(76486, 3, 0, 79632, 'I can. Shaman, if you bring that cliff wall down, I promise that our enemy will be waiting right underneath it.'),
(76486, 3, 0, 79658, 'Save the embraces for later, shaman. I''ve got a kill streak going.'),
(76486, 4, 0, 79651, 'I know! That''s the best part!'),
(76486, 4, 0, 79649, 'Durotan, this isn''t a choke point... it''s a meat grinder!'),
(76486, 4, 0, 79654, 'Thought you''d never ask, brother.'),
(76486, 4, 0, 79639, 'Bring me more! Your Iron Horde can bleed on my axe!'),
(76488, 3, 0, 79634, 'You''d better hurry!  Here they come!'),
(76488, 4, 0, 127481, 'Lok-tar ogar!'),
(76488, 4, 0, 79642, 'Dabu!'),
(76488, 4, 0, 79662, 'Here comes another elekk!'),
(76488, 4, 0, 79644, 'I was taught by the best... Drek''thar.'),
(76488, 4, 0, 79646, 'He would be pleased to hear you say that.'),
(76489, 3, 0, 79631, 'It would be a momentous task... I cannot make any promises.'),
(76489, 3, 0, 79657, 'Thank you. I owe you my life.'),
(76489, 3, 0, 79652, 'Durotan! I need help!'),
(76489, 3, 0, 79678, 'Only a bit longer!'),
(76489, 3, 0, 79643, 'You fight like no shaman I have ever seen.'),
(76494, 3, 0, 78554, 'Maintain... focus...'),
(76496, 1, 0, 80546, 'Whispers... slithering behind my EYES!'),
(76496, 4, 0, 80545, 'Crush, crack, splinter! AHAHAHahahaha...'),
(76508, 3, 0, 85543, 'Brokyo killed the old ogre chieftain and put his head on a stake by his throne. He''s surrounded by guards, but trust me, if you touch that ogre head he''ll come down to greet you.'),
(76528, 0, 0, 77266, '%s sniffs Lokra and whines.'),
(76534, 4, 0, 77943, '%s flees in fear!'),
(76537, 3, 0, 79400, 'Press the attack!'),
(76537, 4, 0, 79402, 'This fortress will fall.'),
(76537, 4, 0, 139102, 'Never yield!'),
(76537, 4, 0, 79401, 'The Frostwolves will triumph.'),
(76543, 0, 0, 82476, 'There are others, we must save them.'),
(76543, 0, 0, 82475, 'Ogre blood will be spilled!'),
(76543, 0, 0, 82477, 'They will see what a cornered wolf is like!'),
(76543, 0, 0, 82480, 'The ogres will pay in blood.'),
(76543, 3, 0, 82478, 'Let us slaughter these ogres!'),
(76543, 3, 0, 82479, 'My wrists are raw from the chains, but I can fight.'),
(76546, 1, 0, 82477, 'They will see what a cornered wolf is like!'),
(76546, 2, 0, 82479, 'My wrists are raw from the chains, but I can fight.'),
(76557, 0, 0, 79458, 'Warriors! Today the tide turns.'),
(76557, 1, 0, 79459, 'We will claim Bladespire Citadel as our own.'),
(76557, 2, 0, 79461, 'Ga''nar is a great fighter, but he is impatient. He has taken some of our best warriors with him.'),
(76557, 3, 0, 79460, 'Fight as one. We win this - together!'),
(76557, 4, 0, 79462, 'He never listens. His ruthlessness may cost us.'),
(76557, 5, 0, 79463, 'Here - Gormaul Tower. This will be our foothold. Leave none alive! LOK''TAR OGAR!'),
(76570, 3, 0, 80442, 'Careful - we have a tough enemy cornered in there.'),
(76572, 4, 0, 88952, 'Auchenai, secure this chamber.'),
(76572, 5, 0, 88953, 'The barrier protecting Auchindoun is asunder.'),
(76572, 6, 0, 88954, 'A foul force has penetrated these sacred chambers.'),
(76572, 7, 0, 88956, 'Scout ahead while we establish a foothold.'),
(76616, 0, 0, 79451, 'Come, friends. If you wish to fight with our clan, we welcome you to receive our blessings.'),
(76616, 1, 0, 79452, 'Reach out to the Shamanstone. Embrace the wisdom of this land and the ancestors that came before us.'),
(76616, 2, 0, 79453, 'I am still scarred by those infernal warlocks. The spirits are quiet.'),
(76616, 3, 0, 79795, 'Discovered Shamanstone: Spirit of the Wolf'),
(76617, 1, 0, 79455, 'The spirits will never abandon you, Drek''Thar. This I can promise.'),
(76628, 3, 0, 79464, 'Durotan, your brother has already rushed ahead.'),
(76630, 3, 0, 79669, 'Look at this cute little puppy you''ve sent me, Durotan! Does she know any tricks?'),
(76630, 4, 0, 79671, 'Come here, puppy. I want to play FETCH.'),
(76630, 4, 0, 79673, 'Draka... come join me in the Iron Horde.  Lose that armor, and settle down with a REAL MAN.'),
(76663, 1, 0, 91183, 'Another soul for Teron''gor!'),
(76663, 1, 0, 91185, 'Teron''gor will not be denied!'),
(76663, 2, 0, 91186, 'Teron''gor... my soul is yours...'),
(76663, 2, 0, 91188, 'You will join me soon.'),
(76663, 2, 0, 125084, 'My death... changes nothing...'),
(76663, 3, 0, 91184, 'Behold Gul''dan''s power!'),
(76663, 4, 0, 91189, 'You have already lost...'),
(76665, 3, 0, 80178, 'Though I cannot bear to see my only child destroyed, I also would not feel right sending you into the spirit world alone.'),
(76665, 3, 0, 80179, 'My spirit will cross over with you. Return to me when the deed is done.'),
(76669, 3, 0, 79536, '...Fenris?'),
(76669, 3, 0, 81448, 'Come! To Thunder Pass. We are outnumbered 50 to 1. They don''t stand a chance!'),
(76669, 3, 0, 79533, 'Stand down, Warlord. It is over.'),
(76669, 3, 0, 79570, 'Brother, wait. Let us talk. We are still family.'),
(76669, 3, 0, 79530, 'Not for long.'),
(76669, 3, 0, 81446, 'No, I will never be okay with this.'),
(76669, 3, 0, 81443, 'He is right. The Iron Horde will move against us. We must be ready.'),
(76669, 4, 0, 79569, '$p, don''t let Fenris escape!'),
(76669, 4, 0, 79567, 'Champion - focus on Fenris.'),
(76669, 4, 0, 79579, 'No slave fights with the will of one who is free.'),
(76670, 3, 0, 79531, '"Iron Wolf" indeed! A coward, hiding behind his minions.'),
(76670, 3, 0, 79538, 'Fenris!'),
(76670, 3, 0, 81444, 'We''ll be ready. They will NEVER take the pass.'),
(76670, 3, 0, 79583, 'Let them come! Traitor!'),
(76670, 3, 0, 81447, 'He made his choice.'),
