(77704, 3, 0, 83942, 'Champions! Nyami''s agents - they went this way!'),
(77704, 3, 0, 83944, 'No... Oh no...'),
(77746, 3, 0, 83561, 'What is this $r doing here?'),
(77748, 3, 0, 80496, 'Will their numbers never cease? Muster your courage, friends. We will not be taken so easily!'),
(77748, 3, 0, 80498, 'Our town is safe thanks to all of you. Today we have given the arakkoa a taste of our steel. Steady hearts, anchorites! We will stay vigilant.'),
(77748, 3, 0, 80497, 'Finally, we have drawn out their leader! Face us, you feathered tyrant!'),
(77776, 1, 0, 80505, 'I have seen your kind before, flying among the mountains to the south. Why have you come here?'),
(77776, 3, 0, 80509, 'The old paladin suddenly gasps. A look of rapture crosses his face and he blinks, seeing you for the first time.'),
(77776, 3, 0, 80520, 'Take my sword, which rests upon the stone. May it guide you when your faith falters, hero.'),
(77784, 4, 0, 86513, 'No! Stop! I can''t control him!'),
(77786, 3, 0, 80522, 'Take one step closer and I''ll gut you like a fish, orc!'),
(77786, 3, 0, 80523, 'Thank the stars you arrived, hero! We are all that is left of Telmor.'),
(77789, 3, 0, 84480, 'My presence is requested for duty.  I must leave immediately.'),
(77791, 3, 0, 147196, 'What can I do for you?'),
