(77857, 0, 0, 85249, 'I sense one who is not of the flock. Come closer, child.'),
(77857, 1, 0, 87181, 'You there, scrollkeeper. You are not of the ravenspeakers. Why do you stand before me?'),
(77857, 2, 0, 87183, 'You flatter me, but darkness weighs upon your thoughts - speak, child.'),
(77857, 3, 0, 87185, 'They also subjugate my children, forcing them to fight and die. What might you have us do?'),
(77857, 4, 0, 87188, 'Anzu always was meddling in the affairs of mortals. One would think I might learn from his mistakes.'),
(77857, 5, 0, 87189, 'Very well, scrollkeeper. My flock is yours.'),
