(81223, 3, 0, 90954, 'Open the portals to the realm of the living! Soon we shall feast upon their souls!'),
(81232, 3, 0, 82560, 'Champion, I need your help to stop the Dark Star''s arrival. Maraad, can you hold Karabor until we are finished?'),
(81236, 0, 0, 83482, 'Prepare for a little goblin ingenuity!'),
