(91695, 1, 0, 93922, 'Soon, you will beg for death!'),
(91710, 0, 0, 135754, 'For Azeroth!'),
(91710, 0, 0, 96187, 'With his final breath, Khadgar unleashes a mana explosion that decimates everyone.'),
(91710, 0, 0, 93605, 'You will not defeat us so easily!'),
(91712, 0, 0, 93878, 'Once more into the breach!'),
(91721, 0, 0, 95102, 'We''re on our way!'),
(91721, 1, 0, 94944, 'Huh? You''re not supposed to be here!'),
(91721, 1, 0, 94943, 'Intruder in the camp!'),
(91721, 1, 0, 94946, 'Don''t interrupt me when I''m working!'),
(91721, 1, 0, 94941, 'Don''t let them near the equipment!'),
(91721, 1, 0, 94942, 'My hammer, your face!'),
(91721, 3, 0, 95101, 'Yes executor!'),
(91727, 1, 0, 93902, 'You will suffer for this disturbance!'),
(91727, 1, 0, 93900, 'Yes! Fight for your pathetic life, mortal! I could use the entertainment.'),
(91727, 4, 0, 95103, 'Engineers! Throw yourselves upon them!'),
(91727, 4, 0, 93904, 'I''ll be back... I''ll... have my revenge...'),
(91727, 4, 0, 93899, 'If this reaver isn''t finished in time, I will devour your souls!'),
(91727, 4, 0, 93903, 'This... isn''t over!'),
(91731, 3, 0, 99095, 'Shaman! I have an urgent message.'),
(91737, 1, 0, 94513, 'Skovald will possess the Aegis. You will not interfere!'),
(91737, 2, 0, 94514, 'Insolent worm... you cannot stop the God-King...'),
(91740, 0, 0, 94702, 'You will have to get through me first if you want Gorefiend!'),
(91740, 1, 0, 94703, 'You can''t stop him... and you can''t stop the Burning Legion...'),
(91755, 3, 0, 93910, 'No, please! No!'),
(91756, 1, 0, 93048, 'This place is not for you.'),
(91756, 1, 0, 93050, 'For Azshara!'),
(91756, 1, 0, 129799, 'You should not be here.'),
(91757, 1, 0, 93048, 'This place is not for you.'),
(91759, 1, 0, 94511, 'The dragons will serve or be slain!'),
(91759, 1, 0, 94512, 'The Thorgnir are broken. You''re next!'),
(91760, 1, 0, 94640, 'Your head will be a gift to Gul''dan!'),
(91764, 1, 0, 93912, 'I saw you at the Iron Docks! This time you''re going down!'),
(91764, 1, 0, 93914, 'Engaging!'),
(91764, 1, 0, 93911, 'Another ear for my necklace!'),
(91764, 1, 0, 93915, 'Drop ''em!'),
(91764, 1, 0, 93917, 'Suppress that target!'),
(91764, 1, 0, 112561, 'Your life is forfeit, outsider!'),
(91764, 1, 0, 146233, 'Open fire!'),
(91784, 0, 0, 101991, 'Guardians of the ritual, prepare yourselves! She will not be disappointed!'),
(91784, 1, 0, 101992, 'Hmph. Intruders. They will not get far.'),
(91784, 2, 0, 99890, 'Ah, we meet again, weakling. Now it''s just you and me... and my guards!'),
(91784, 3, 0, 99892, 'Hatecoil, drown them out!'),
(91784, 4, 0, 99893, 'Fools! Get out of the way!'),
(91784, 4, 1, 99895, 'Useless. All of you!'),
(91784, 5, 0, 99873, '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Spear_07:20|t%s targets you with an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191977|h[Impaling Spear]|h|r! Get behind someone!'),
(91784, 6, 0, 87541, 'You mirin''?'),
(91784, 7, 0, 101804, '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyFrenzy:20|tWarlord Parjesh |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197064|h[Enrages]|h|r!'),
(91784, 8, 0, 99894, 'You can''t stop.... the storm...'),
(91784, 9, 0, 99891, 'Sssssth! Hatecoil, crush their bodies!'),
(91784, 10, 0, 99898, 'Ha, nowhere to hide!'),
(91789, 2, 0, 100243, '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shaman_StaticShock:20|t%s starts to invoke a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:193597|h[Static Nova]|h|r. Get out of the water!'),
(91789, 3, 0, 100238, '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_SummonWaterElemental:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:193682|h[Beckon Storm]|h|r!'),
(91797, 1, 0, 99824, '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_summonwaterelemental:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:193051|h[Call the Seas]|h|r!'),
(91808, 0, 0, 99006, '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_volatilewater:20|t%s begins to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191873|h[Submerge]|h|r!'),
(91808, 1, 0, 98862, '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_venomouswounds:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191855|h[Toxic Wound]|h|r!'),
(91818, 1, 0, 94134, 'You''re not feeding me to the hounds this time!'),
(91818, 1, 0, 94135, 'Helira! You can''t hold me here forever! I will be free!'),
(91818, 3, 0, 94050, 'All is lost...'),
(91818, 3, 0, 95307, 'As soon as I get free I''m going to kill the first kvaldir I see.'),
(91830, 1, 0, 93974, '|TInterface\\Icons\\warlock_summon_doomguard.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000$n|r has been afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181275|h[Curse of the Legion]|h|r!'),
(91832, 1, 0, 92668, 'I''ll take your head for a trophy!'),
(91858, 0, 0, 96908, 'These demons think us easy prey. Today they will learn that the kaldorei stand down to no one.'),
(91858, 0, 0, 96911, 'Stand firm, champions! Our might is tested, but we shall prevail!'),
(91858, 0, 0, 96907, 'Our people look to us for aid. Make these foul creatures regret the day they invaded our world!'),
(91858, 3, 0, 96909, 'Warriors, you pledged your blades to the House of Ravencrest. Today, we take up arms and fight!'),
(91858, 3, 0, 96910, 'Rally to me, soldiers! No matter the foes we face, Black Rook Hold shall not fall!'),
(91860, 1, 0, 96923, 'Stop, interloper. I''ll make you bleed first!'),
(91860, 1, 0, 96925, 'If you won''t return to your world, I''ll send you there in pieces!'),
(91860, 1, 0, 96926, 'Enjoy this moment. It will be your last!'),
(91860, 1, 0, 96924, 'My strike is swift and true!'),
(91860, 2, 0, 96584, 'Lord Ravencrest, I have served you loyally.'),
(91860, 2, 0, 96946, 'Finally, I can rest.'),
(91866, 1, 0, 98559, 'We must stand together against the coming darkness. We must cast aside the shackles of race and kingdom. We must unite as one!'),
(91866, 2, 0, 94428, 'On this day, the Order of the Silver Hand is reborn! Together, Sargeras himself shall shudder at our might!'),
(91866, 3, 0, 98745, 'Place the blade on the altar when you are ready. The Light will be our forge.'),
(91892, 0, 0, 94527, 'Bah! She was nothing to me. Cuyler, avenge your fallen comrades.'),
(91892, 0, 0, 94526, 'A trifle. Asger, deliver this fool to Helheim!'),
(91892, 3, 0, 94524, 'How pitiful. You must prove yourself worthy before you are given the privilege of facing me in battle.'),
(91892, 3, 0, 94528, 'Well, perhaps you can offer me some sport after all.'),
(91894, 0, 0, 122457, 'Will you strike at me first or stare at me like a sniveling coward?'),
(91902, 3, 0, 99304, 'To conquer this puny world.'),
(91904, 3, 0, 94131, 'My guess? She landed somewhere up the coast and continued on foot.'),
(91911, 0, 0, 94001, 'Bleeding Hollow scavengers. We should deal with their leader and send them scurrying back into the jungle!'),
(91911, 1, 0, 94000, 'The Iron Horde have all but abandoned this area. I was expecting a harder fight for the docks.'),
(91911, 2, 0, 94025, 'Warlocks and their foul magic! If Gul''dan has his way, this whole world would burn.'),
(91911, 3, 0, 94029, 'Gul''dan''s fel magic is corrupting even the very machinery of the Iron Horde! We must fight through this gauntlet...'),
(91913, 0, 0, 95744, 'Welcome, commander! Khadgar tells me you''ve accomplished so many great things...'),
(91913, 1, 0, 95745, 'Take your knee, champion. It is a rare and special privilege to be blessed by a Naaru.'),
(91913, 2, 0, 95752, 'Did you hear anything? Did the Naaru speak to you?'),
(91919, 1, 0, 91160, 'Purge these interlopers from our midst!'),
(91919, 1, 0, 91165, 'Pitiful ground dweller!'),
(91919, 1, 0, 91152, 'Thieves!'),
(91919, 1, 0, 91161, 'You will die like the outcasts!'),
(91919, 1, 0, 91164, 'You are a blight on this world.'),
(91919, 1, 0, 91166, 'You will burn with the outcasts!'),
(91919, 1, 0, 91155, 'Filthy lowborn!'),
(91929, 0, 0, 94047, 'Quickly now, you must see this place!'),
(91935, 0, 0, 96627, 'Go now commander. We will continue to put pressure on this front.'),
(91951, 0, 0, 99240, 'The Light... will... ahh!  Aahhhh!!'),
(91982, 1, 0, 95091, '|cFFFF0000|Hspell:182582|h[Fel Incineration]|h|r is following you!'),
(92000, 3, 0, 122373, 'Is that the Scythe of Elune you carry? Does it really turn you into a beast?'),
(92034, 3, 0, 94078, 'Thievery will not be tolerated, slave.'),
(92038, 0, 0, 94300, 'You cannot stop us!'),
(92041, 0, 0, 98255, 'Now you die!'),
(92104, 3, 0, 94215, '$GHe:She; fell for it!'),
(92104, 3, 0, 94216, 'Did you think it would be that easy?'),
(92111, 3, 0, 96056, 'We did it! The pygmy owls of this grove are safe thanks to you.'),
(92111, 3, 0, 96055, 'Ready yourself, hero. The creature descends!'),
(92130, 0, 0, 94253, 'Let''s get this over with. Gul''dan has turned these docks into a recruiting ground.'),
(92130, 1, 0, 94251, '%s loots a rifle from the corpse of a fallen foe.'),
(92130, 2, 0, 94256, 'Blackhand ordered construction of a gigantic cannon. Then I built a monstrous warship to carry it. Bigger isn''t always better - our strategy fell apart in the waters around Shattrath.'),
(92130, 3, 0, 94257, 'We normally use these grapples to tug ships into port...'),
(92130, 4, 0, 94258, 'This is why you should cover your buildings in spikes!'),
(92142, 0, 0, 96274, 'My blade seeks vengeance!'),
(92142, 1, 0, 94867, '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_WindWalkOn:20|t %s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:183480|h[Windwalks]|h|r, leaving behind images!'),
(92142, 2, 0, 96134, '%s emerges from the shadows!'),
(92142, 3, 0, 96278, 'Burn... BURN!'),
(92142, 4, 0, 96625, 'I am everburning!'),
(92142, 5, 0, 96621, 'Your darkness burns within me!'),
(92144, 0, 0, 96251, 'It rips. It tears. It is boundless and eternal...'),
(92144, 1, 0, 95369, '%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:184476|h[Reaps]|h|r all marked foes!'),
(92144, 2, 0, 96253, 'And then the dead shall rise once more.'),
(92144, 3, 0, 95262, '%s summons horrors from the |cFFFF0404|Hspell:184681|h[Darkness]|h|r!'),
(92144, 4, 0, 96252, 'The void, it hungers!'),
(92144, 5, 0, 96250, 'They will carry the darkness with them.'),
(92144, 6, 0, 95261, '%s marks half of her enemies with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:184449|h[Mark of the Necromancer]|h|r!'),
(92144, 7, 0, 96246, 'The sweet mercy... of death.'),
(92145, 3, 0, 94443, 'Did you know that the Highlord once slew five hundred demons in a single blow?'),
(92145, 3, 0, 94445, 'I read that Highlord $p killed Ragnaros the Firelord... twice!'),
(92145, 3, 0, 94448, 'All the world''s paladins united under one roof... the Legion doesn''t stand a chance.'),
(92146, 0, 0, 96272, 'I''ll rip the meat from your bones!'),
(92146, 1, 0, 96273, 'More! I want MORE!'),
(92146, 2, 0, 95260, '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_boilingblood.blp:20|t %s begins to use |cFFFF0404|Hspell:184357|h[Tainted Blood]|h|r!'),
(92146, 3, 0, 96271, 'Drink your blood! Eat your flesh!'),
(92146, 4, 0, 96257, 'ArRRgghhHhh...'),
(92146, 5, 0, 96256, 'Iron Horde will CRUSH you!'),
(92147, 0, 0, 101800, 'Hail, Highlord.'),
(92147, 1, 0, 121418, 'Greetings, $c. The Highlord says you are to be welcomed as a guest, so long as you don''t cause trouble.'),
(92148, 0, 0, 94450, 'Do you think Highlord $p is a demigod?'),
(92149, 0, 0, 94447, 'Do you think I''ll be picked to go on the next mission outing? I heard that the Highlord lets you keep some of the spoils!'),
(92150, 3, 0, 101800, 'Hail, Highlord.'),
(92151, 0, 0, 101800, 'Hail, Highlord.'),
(92151, 3, 0, 121418, 'Greetings, $c. The Highlord says you are to be welcomed as a guest, so long as you don''t cause trouble.'),
(92180, 0, 0, 94262, 'Pah! You''re too ugly for my collection. Better to kill you!'),
(92180, 1, 0, 94263, 'My collection... they were all... I had...'),
(92184, 1, 1, 101088, 'I do have some extra, but I''m not really willing to part with them. Unless...'),
(92184, 1, 2, 101089, 'Would you be willing to run a quick errand for me? Do it and I''ll promise I''ll give you some armor stands.'),
(92184, 2, 0, 101091, 'That Shandy... he sure does know how to get the blood and gore out! Here are those armor stands I promised you.'),
(92191, 0, 0, 94273, 'What is this filth doing on my docks!?'),
(92191, 1, 0, 94274, 'Gul''dan... will finish this...'),
(92194, 0, 0, 98376, 'The Data Extratinator 3000 might be able to decipher this core. Cross your fingers that it doesn''t explode in the process.'),
(92194, 3, 0, 98378, 'This core contains a script written in an ancient Highborne dialect, which I can''t read. Professor Pallin in the Scribes'' Sacellum may be able to translate this.'),
(92201, 3, 0, 94281, 'Darkness, come forth!'),
(92201, 3, 0, 94277, 'Hang in there, Oakleaf. I know it is painful, but please, hold on!'),
(92202, 3, 0, 108347, '%s writhes in agony.'),
(92208, 0, 0, 96743, '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ability_fixated_state_red.blp:20|t A Doomfire Spirit is |cFFF00000|Hspell:182879|h[Fixated]|h|r on you!'),
(92213, 0, 0, 96636, 'Give Cordana my best. She''s been quite distant lately.'),
(92213, 3, 0, 95764, 'With every passing moment, Gul''dan grows in power. But he no longer slinks through the shadows - we know where he is. We know what he''s doing. Now, we strike! May the Light have mercy on all our souls.'),
(92213, 3, 0, 98667, 'We will send Gul''dan''s filth to the bottom of the sea!'),
(92243, 1, 0, 95065, 'Come on, smith! HIT IT!!!'),
(92243, 2, 0, 95063, 'Now, $p, hit the metal as hard as you can.'),
(92245, 3, 0, 94423, 'The metal will not bend so easily, try striking harder.'),
(92245, 3, 0, 94506, 'You''re progressing quite nicely.'),
(92264, 0, 0, 95033, 'Be quick about your work. You''ll only have a small window of time to hammer out those red-hot leystone bars into the components you need.'),
(92274, 0, 0, 94384, 'Ah... another succulent world ready to be beat into submission!'),
(92302, 3, 0, 98438, 'It seems that a messenger awaits. May the gale winds carry you, friend.'),
(92302, 4, 0, 98433, 'The storm will purge Skovald from this land!'),
(92302, 4, 0, 98434, 'The unworthy will be thrashed in the gale winds!'),
(92307, 1, 0, 113052, 'Don''t think you stand a chance simply because you have come this far. You are nothing! NOTHING!'),
(92307, 3, 0, 113012, 'The Aegis will be mine you fools, and there''s nothing you can do to stop me.'),
(92307, 4, 0, 113059, 'Thousands of worlds will be mine to conquer!'),
(92307, 4, 0, 113007, 'Enough! I grow tired of this.'),
(92307, 4, 0, 113055, 'My forces are limitless!'),
(92330, 4, 0, 95132, 'Join me in death!'),
(92330, 4, 0, 95135, 'You cannot control it... it is MINE!'),
(92330, 4, 0, 95134, 'Your life ends here!'),
(92330, 4, 0, 95137, 'The nether! It... consumes me...'),
(92330, 4, 0, 95133, 'Wither away, fools!'),
(92334, 3, 0, 95420, 'Hero! Avenge Swiftflight!');
INSERT INTO `tmp_fix_creature_text` VALUES
(92334, 3, 0, 95433, 'Thank you, hero. I could not have done this alone.'),
(92334, 3, 0, 95353, 'Oh no! What did they do to you!?'),
(92343, 0, 0, 94389, 'Hammer you fools! We have a schedule to keep.'),
(92346, 0, 0, 114985, 'Yes, a council of war is a good idea. The Legion''s forces are spreading across the Broken Isles. We must not lose our foothold there!'),
(92346, 1, 0, 98600, 'The Blood Knights stand by you, Highlord $p. Azeroth will not fall!'),
(92400, 0, 0, 94467, 'Da Horde be countin'' on ya, commander. Find us a shipwright so we can surround Tanaan!'),
(92411, 0, 0, 94433, 'You dare come into MY CAMP? I''m going to take great pleasure in tearing you apart... piece by piece.'),
(92414, 3, 0, 94697, 'GAH! Ah... <gasp> that''s better...'),
(92419, 1, 0, 96913, 'Another prisoner for my cells? Looks like I''ll need to break you first!'),
(92419, 2, 0, 97565, 'Master, I have failed you...'),
(92423, 0, 0, 96282, 'Who are you? Stay back - I will protect the Queen with my last breath!'),
(92445, 0, 0, 96661, 'The fel you wield will not be enough.'),
(92445, 0, 1, 94934, 'Demon hunters? How did you get here?'),
(92447, 0, 0, 96654, 'Another morsel has come to say, hello.'),
(92450, 0, 0, 105114, 'Your world will be purged!'),
(92450, 0, 1, 95072, 'Surrender the Tidestone, mortal.'),
(92450, 0, 2, 129829, 'You dare?!'),
(92450, 0, 3, 105111, 'The Legion''s will be done.'),
(92450, 0, 4, 95073, 'You cannot stop us. We are infinite.'),
(92450, 0, 5, 94473, 'Destruction!'),
(92460, 0, 0, 33548, 'Greetings, $c.'),
(92475, 3, 0, 94572, 'Bat-riders heading your way! Hang in there, the Admiral and I are trying to find a way up!'),
(92539, 4, 0, 123440, 'For aeons, Helya has been building an army. Stealing the souls of fallen vrykul to oppose the Valarjar.'),
(92539, 5, 0, 123494, 'I suspect the sea witch grows impatient, eager to begin her campaign by conquering the Broken Isles.'),
(92539, 6, 0, 123495, 'Helya''s foul magics trap Odyn and hinder the Valarjar. We need champions like you to stop her advances.'),
(92539, 7, 0, 123496, 'Helya must be stopped. The time has come for a reckoning!'),
(92539, 8, 0, 123454, 'How dare she so brashly oppose me!'),
(92539, 9, 0, 123497, 'I have had enough of that foul sorceress'' games!'),
(92539, 10, 0, 123498, 'That sea witch must learn the price of her defiance!'),
(92552, 3, 0, 94564, 'We must keep the tunnel open! Fight on!'),
(92554, 0, 0, 96139, '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_ragnaros_molteninferno.blp:20|t$n |cFFFF0000|Hspell:185828|h[Rekindles]|h|r a Fel Scorcher!'),
(92554, 1, 0, 96140, '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_ragnaros_molteninferno.blp:20|t$n |cFFFF0000|Hspell:185835|h[Enkindles]|h|r all nearby Fel Scorchers!'),
(92556, 0, 0, 94554, 'Of course I can! Wait... woahh! Woah!'),
(92556, 1, 0, 94555, 'Alright, let''s just set her down nice and eas-GAAHH!!'),
(92557, 0, 0, 94552, 'I can''t believe you talked me into this! Can you even control this thing?!'),
(92557, 1, 0, 94553, 'Heads up! Very big dragon incoming!'),
(92567, 3, 0, 98421, 'Hey, over here! I''ve got a plan!'),
(92569, 4, 0, 98748, 'Now''s our chance. Let''s get up that tower!'),
(92573, 3, 0, 98422, 'I feel like that guy having a dragon is a bad thing.'),
(92575, 1, 0, 93943, 'Katra zil shukil! You will die for your insolence!'),
(92591, 1, 0, 94579, 'Victory for Sylvanas!'),
(92591, 3, 0, 94578, 'You were supposed to hook the vrykul, not his pet lizard.'),
(92617, 3, 0, 100721, 'Awww, shucks.'),
(92620, 1, 0, 94794, 'Finish your business here, then meet me in the keep.'),
(92621, 3, 0, 95591, 'Da caught a two-headed fish a few days ago. It was all purple and oozy.'),
(92625, 3, 0, 94604, 'You dare defy the Legion?'),
(92636, 0, 0, 94656, 'GOT YOU $n!'),
(92647, 1, 0, 94625, 'Ah, something to relieve the tedium!'),
(92647, 2, 0, 94629, 'Wrong... mixture....'),
(92680, 3, 0, 96419, 'Help has arrived at last! Elune be praised!'),
(92683, 3, 0, 96135, 'Now, now. They can''t help being lively.'),
(92683, 3, 0, 96223, 'I do hope they are still alive. It would break the Mayor''s heart if we couldn''t find his little girl.'),
(92686, 3, 0, 96117, 'Go on. And this time, stay there.'),
(92686, 3, 0, 96120, 'Rascals. Don''t worry: I''ll keep an eye out for them.'),
(92697, 0, 0, 96427, 'Shaladrassil... it cannot... it must not be true!'),
(92718, 0, 0, 98731, 'Take up your weapons, $n. I trust you can still handle a blade.'),
(92738, 3, 0, 95677, '%s whines piteously.'),
(92748, 0, 0, 94738, 'Rage has blinded Malfurion. He and Xavius have a long history of conflict.'),
(92748, 1, 0, 94917, 'Even he cannot hope to defeat Xavius alone. We must find him at once.'),
(92764, 1, 0, 96509, 'Sisters, to battle!'),
(92764, 1, 0, 96504, 'Eyir take you!'),
(92764, 1, 0, 96503, 'You defile these grounds!'),
(92764, 1, 0, 96507, 'My shield will not falter!'),
(92764, 2, 0, 96510, 'Eyir, be my wings...'),
(92765, 0, 0, 94729, 'Free! Free from that accursed body!'),
(92765, 1, 0, 94730, 'By besting me in battle, by destroying my body, you have undone the vile curse laid upon me by the mystics.'),
(92766, 0, 0, 94740, 'Akrrilo has been challenged at the Arena!'),
(92767, 1, 0, 95354, 'A Sargerei Dominator protects Socrethar with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:184053|h[Fel Barrier]|h|r!'),
(92769, 0, 0, 94798, 'Light protect us from this atrocity! Grant us your strength to banish this evil!'),
(92769, 1, 0, 94800, 'No! I will never give in to darkness. The legion will fall!'),
(92769, 8, 0, 94801, 'The light will not fail!'),
(92776, 0, 0, 101977, 'You shall fall, like the Wardens before you!'),
(92776, 1, 0, 101974, 'You cannot stem the Legion''s tide!'),
(92776, 4, 0, 101976, 'These are the defenders of this world? Pitiful!'),
(92788, 1, 0, 121965, 'Soon, you will welcome death with open arms!'),
