(94015, 4, 0, 134202, 'Your life ends now!'),
(94015, 5, 0, 95740, 'Feel the legion''s power!'),
(94015, 6, 0, 96479, '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_astralrecalgroup:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:187702|h[Twisted Reflection]|h|r!'),
(94015, 12, 0, 95739, 'My power grows!'),
(94015, 16, 0, 95743, 'Oblivion... comes...'),
(94054, 1, 0, 95799, 'Destroy the Tomes of Chaos to break Cordana''s shield'),
(94054, 3, 0, 95725, 'Now, give me your ring. I need it. Give it here!'),
(94054, 3, 0, 95727, 'Then I will TAKE it from you! For the Glory of Gul''dan!'),
(94054, 3, 0, 95724, 'Books of power... books of knowledge... books written in the language of chaos... Don''t you worry, champion, all will be destroyed.'),
(94054, 3, 0, 95723, 'Books. Yes, Gul''dan''s tomes. Are you sure Khadgar didn''t try to use them?'),
(94054, 4, 0, 95728, 'The Orb of Dominion spoke to me. I saw the TRUTH.'),
(94054, 4, 0, 95731, 'Very well, walk away. Nothing will stop Gul''dan, for the Legion stands behind him. Mark my words: Your leaders will betray you. AZEROTH WILL BURN.'),
(94054, 4, 0, 95729, 'Khadgar is just a child, swaggering around, torturing his prisoners, playing with lives, dabbling in magics he pretends to comprehend.'),
(94097, 1, 0, 102745, 'Candle! Mine!'),
(94100, 3, 0, 114815, 'What...? Dareer was a demon all along? How did we not see that coming?'),
(94101, 3, 0, 101098, 'Are we taking bets on how long the gnome lasts?'),
(94110, 3, 0, 96431, 'It''s as if the forest itself has risen against us...'),
(94110, 3, 0, 96434, 'Hope is lost... but I will fight on!'),
(94112, 3, 0, 96669, 'Xavius is the master of this forest now, $c. To enter is to succumb to the Nightmare.'),
(94113, 0, 0, 95787, 'Prove to me that you are worthy of this power! Free my brethren from their ghostly imprisonment, then come to me with their mark upon you.'),
(94117, 0, 0, 96628, 'Rotbeak is just northwest, past the dock. Bring me its head!'),
(94138, 2, 0, 127696, 'You will not regret this choice, Shadowblade. I will take out any Legion demon or conspirator who crosses my path!'),
(94141, 0, 0, 120203, 'Good choice, just don''t call me ''champion''. Ever.'),
(94142, 0, 0, 95708, 'Aid me, champions! This is not our final hour! We must survive!'),
(94142, 1, 0, 95709, 'Never! This world will stand against the legion and prevail!'),
(94147, 0, 0, 102755, 'Brrribitit!'),
(94147, 1, 0, 97450, 'They no take treasure. I watch. I wait. I see them coming.'),
(94153, 1, 0, 107316, 'The fools of Rivermane will never expect the wilds to turn on them so violently.'),
(94175, 0, 0, 114988, 'Finally, Highlord, you will hear my words. We should focus our efforts on hunting down the dreadlord Balnazzar. It''s time for retribution!'),
(94175, 1, 0, 117423, 'Justice is on our side!'),
(94175, 2, 0, 120183, 'Their temple is located deep in Legion territory. We would be putting ourselves at great risk.'),
(94179, 0, 0, 122059, 'Ugggh - that blade - what is that you carry? Disease and rot surround you, Death Knight!'),
(94207, 0, 0, 129922, 'We cannot be stopped!'),
(94207, 0, 1, 121836, 'This land... is.. ours...'),
(94208, 0, 0, 121824, 'The Witchmother commands it!'),
(94208, 0, 1, 121843, 'Craaawwkk!'),
(94223, 4, 0, 99226, 'You''re a welcome sight!'),
(94227, 3, 0, 97226, 'Formidable for you, perhaps. We''ll see how they fare when confronted by the Banshee Queen!'),
(94261, 1, 0, 117302, 'Shadows engulf you!'),
(94261, 4, 0, 96414, 'Gonna enjoy guttin'' you!'),
(94276, 0, 0, 99239, 'Destroy him.'),
(94276, 1, 0, 99247, 'Destroy them!'),
(94276, 2, 0, 99284, 'Run? Ha. You are right, human. There is nowhere to run from my master.  Now, witness the true might of Lord Sargeras!'),
(94276, 3, 0, 121809, 'Do you see now, human? This fate of this world is sealed. The legion cannot be stopped.'),
(94276, 4, 0, 99301, 'And now you will fall.'),
(94337, 1, 0, 98260, 'You will suffer as we have!'),
(94337, 1, 0, 98259, 'Abandon hope!'),
(94337, 2, 0, 101293, 'No... no...'),
(94338, 1, 0, 98258, 'Join us in death!'),
(94338, 1, 0, 98248, 'For Sylvanas!'),
(94338, 2, 0, 98269, 'Dark Lady...'),
(94338, 4, 0, 124540, 'Relief... at last...'),
(94346, 3, 0, 115655, 'Champion! I bear orders from Greymane!'),
(94372, 3, 0, 100720, 'Show''s over, everyone.'),
(94409, 0, 0, 121032, 'You''re a fine addition to my huntin'' party!'),
(94409, 1, 0, 127453, 'The balloon will leave once we have three riders ready to go.'),
(94414, 0, 0, 95768, 'Accept your death. It is bitter, but preferable to what is coming.'),
(94414, 0, 1, 95769, 'The last hero to oppose me lies dead at my feet. Join her.'),
(94414, 0, 2, 96364, 'Did you think to reclaim this land? What we take, we shall keep.'),
(94414, 1, 0, 95771, 'Mother Moon, have mercy. Let me rest now.'),
(94420, 4, 0, 97000, 'You call us monsters? How rich.'),
(94429, 3, 0, 98816, 'Just a few more minutes here...  She will be seaworthy shortly!'),
(94429, 3, 0, 96050, 'Interested in building some ships?'),
(94433, 3, 0, 95972, 'Faster! Faster!'),
(94434, 0, 0, 120514, 'I don''t think Hemet himself could have taught me better. I''m happy to hunt with you anytime!'),
(94456, 3, 0, 111276, 'Looking for something specific?'),
(94456, 3, 0, 108828, 'That there be $p. I heard $Ghe:she; took down Deathwing with nothin'' but the blades in $Ghis:her; hands!'),
(94480, 3, 0, 96603, 'White Lady, grant me your light so that I may purge these waters of the vile corruption of Xavius.'),
(94485, 3, 0, 96605, 'Foolish druid. The power of your goddess is pitiful. Behold the might of Xavius!'),
(94546, 3, 0, 96297, 'Lord Ravencrest appointed me as Queen Azshara''s personal guard.'),
(94546, 3, 0, 96868, 'Azshara kept her secrets well. By the time I saw the demons first-hand, it was already too late.'),
(94550, 3, 0, 96468, 'A 7th Legion Battlemage freezes the catapult solid!'),
(94580, 1, 0, 98761, 'You will not gain the keystone.'),
(94610, 0, 0, 99681, 'I want this shan ronir to tell the others. Tell them their doom will come once I master this hammer.'),
