(97033, 3, 0, 98835, 'I was... nearly broken... You have my thanks.'),
(97034, 0, 0, 98765, 'This is where you die.'),
(97043, 0, 0, 100494, 'Silence. Your soul belongs to Helya.'),
(97043, 1, 0, 104366, 'Want to live? Kill these fools.'),
(97043, 2, 0, 100515, 'Fool. Our curse will be your undoing...'),
(97043, 3, 0, 104438, 'Fight them. Earn your freedom!'),
(97044, 0, 0, 37177, 'There is no escape!'),
(97052, 3, 0, 107174, 'The trees whisper his name, but their words are madness to my ears!'),
(97052, 3, 0, 107176, 'You may not, but perhaps... your mother moon can.'),
(97056, 1, 0, 98359, 'I will not be undone by some mortal filth! I am the Earth Warder!'),
(97059, 5, 0, 103110, '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_monsterspidercarapace_01:20|tNearby |cFFFF0000|Hspell:198235|h[Spider Eggs]|h|r will hatch soon if not destroyed!.'),
(97061, 0, 0, 98429, 'Even as someone not of this land, you chose to save us from a wretched fate.'),
(97061, 3, 0, 98430, 'You have passed the Trial of Will, and you have also gained an ally.'),
(97061, 3, 0, 98431, 'Hold aloft your weapon, outsider. Accept the power of storm and thunder as a gift for your selfless acts.'),
(97064, 1, 0, 102755, 'Brrribitit!'),
(97064, 1, 0, 102756, 'I bite! You die!'),
(97064, 1, 0, 102752, 'My mountain!'),
(97064, 3, 0, 102753, 'You no take mountain!'),
(97069, 0, 0, 102954, 'Lord Gul''dan will lead us to victory. You cannot stop us.'),
(97069, 2, 0, 102952, 'All goes according to HIS plan.'),
(97070, 0, 0, 98783, 'Kayn and Altruis have already gone ahead. Take this felbat and join them.'),
(97074, 3, 0, 121403, 'The raven caws at you in disapproval.'),
(97081, 1, 0, 102592, 'You have... bested me.'),
(97081, 5, 0, 104681, 'Who threw that?'),
(97081, 5, 1, 104682, 'I was looking for a chance to brawl!'),
(97083, 5, 0, 104681, 'Who threw that?'),
(97083, 5, 1, 104682, 'I was looking for a chance to brawl!'),
(97084, 0, 0, 102581, 'I deem you... unworthy.'),
(97084, 5, 0, 104681, 'Who threw that?'),
(97084, 5, 1, 104682, 'I was looking for a chance to brawl!'),
(97093, 1, 0, 98909, 'The Legion empowers me!'),
(97093, 4, 0, 98910, 'The Feltotem... will be... your end.'),
(97095, 0, 0, 98841, 'Rosalyn! Where is Rosalyn?!'),
(97095, 1, 0, 99611, 'Soulkeeper Uriah takes a slow, pained breath.'),
(97095, 2, 0, 99610, 'I am beyond saving, Rosalyn. You need to focus on finding the demons that have been released from the soul chambers and trap them once again, before it''s too late.'),
(97095, 3, 0, 99625, 'You can, Rosalyn, and you will. You''re more gifted than you let yourself believe.'),
(97095, 4, 0, 99626, 'Soulkeeper Uriah exhales tiredly as the last bit of breath leaves his lifeless body.'),
(97097, 0, 0, 105467, 'Harbaron won''t have your kind around here, mortal.'),
(97103, 1, 0, 102751, 'For Candle King!'),
(97103, 1, 0, 135514, 'No!'),
(97103, 3, 0, 102747, 'Rakinishu!'),
(97111, 0, 0, 120019, 'This research has been quite fascinating! I''ve begun inscribing the translated history in the tome over here.'),
(97111, 3, 0, 120260, 'I''ll keep adding to it as our research continues. It''s worth taking a look if you have some time.'),
(97140, 0, 0, 99793, 'Ugh. I shall never grow accustomed to that.'),
(97140, 1, 0, 100883, 'Oculeth!'),
(97140, 2, 0, 104371, 'He is withering...'),
(97140, 4, 0, 104886, 'Remember, you can use the new teleporter to reach the surface quickly. Anora Hollow is somewhere north of here.'),
(97140, 5, 0, 107469, 'I shall prepare a holding area for the subjects while you are away.'),
(97140, 6, 0, 105901, 'And Valtrois?'),
(97140, 7, 0, 105902, 'You would be wise not to turn your nose up at the outsiders. None of us would be here without their help.'),
(97140, 8, 0, 111647, 'Let us begin. Come along, Theryn.'),
(97140, 9, 0, 111655, 'Nar''thala vas manari...'),
(97140, 10, 0, 112383, 'I feel them. His memories.'),
(97140, 11, 0, 111663, 'The day he was exiled...'),
(97140, 12, 0, 111664, 'This hunger... this fear...'),
(97140, 14, 0, 111812, 'Let us move on.'),
(97140, 15, 0, 112341, 'Thala nar''valas.'),
(97140, 16, 0, 111667, 'Such confusion... such rage...'),
(97140, 18, 0, 111608, 'Agh!! Make them stop! Please make them stop!'),
(97140, 20, 0, 112350, 'Nnngh- ENOUGH!!'),
(97140, 21, 0, 118575, 'There... you found something, didn''t you?'),
(97140, 22, 0, 118576, 'Something which gave you peace...'),
(97140, 23, 0, 118583, 'A peace we so desperately need for ourselves.'),
(97140, 24, 0, 112398, 'I... I am fine.'),
(97140, 25, 0, 113328, 'A gift, for me?'),
(97140, 26, 0, 115439, 'Thalyssra smiles warmly.'),
(97140, 27, 0, 115440, 'I will see that it is not wasted. Well done, my friend.'),
(97141, 3, 0, 121224, 'Looking smooth, $n! Real smooth!'),
(97171, 0, 0, 104567, 'The shielding weakens!'),
(97171, 1, 0, 104568, 'Lady Hatecoil is vulnerable! She must not fall!'),
(97181, 1, 0, 101761, 'You don''t have the power to stop me!'),
(97183, 1, 0, 116784, 'Elisande, I have failed you...'),
(97184, 1, 0, 96654, 'Another morsel has come to say, hello.'),
(97193, 0, 0, 98887, 'Together we will imprison these demons once again.'),
(97193, 3, 0, 101590, 'Safe travels, $n.'),
(97193, 4, 0, 98915, 'The demon is weak enough for me to begin the containment spell. This should only take a moment.'),
(97193, 4, 0, 100955, 'The demon has been secured.'),
(97197, 0, 0, 104680, 'That''s it! My fist, your face!'),
(97202, 0, 0, 102975, 'You will not deny Hyrja''s ascendance!'),
(97202, 1, 0, 102976, 'The Light shines eternal in you, Hyrja!'),
(97203, 1, 0, 98913, 'Let me show you how my fire can not only destroy homes, but lives!'),
(97203, 4, 0, 98914, 'In death I return to ash.'),
(97215, 1, 0, 98944, 'Alright, $p. He''s right up here. Follow me!'),
(97215, 3, 0, 99034, 'Thank you, $p. Arru will terrorize Thunder Totem no more. Instead, he will be a great aid. Help yourself to what he took from town.'),
(97215, 4, 0, 98951, 'You will be mine, Arru!'),
(97219, 0, 0, 102977, 'You sully this ritual with your presence, mortals!'),
(97219, 1, 0, 102978, 'Hyrja... the fury of the storm is yours to command!'),
(97225, 0, 0, 99861, 'We are but the beginning of the tide.'),
(97225, 1, 0, 99865, 'Resistance only delays the inevitable!'),
(97225, 2, 0, 99863, 'Prepare for your own demise!'),
(97225, 3, 0, 83279, 'Your demise awaits.'),
(97225, 5, 0, 99866, 'Your world will crumble into ashes.'),
(97225, 7, 0, 101972, 'Your death will be swift and brutal.'),
(97241, 1, 0, 96414, 'Gonna enjoy guttin'' you!'),
(97244, 3, 0, 102063, 'Grab the keystone! Let''s get to the portal down below and back to the Black Temple!'),
(97250, 3, 0, 99010, 'Hold on tight!'),
(97265, 0, 0, 101641, 'You will trust the traitor? I can do no more here.'),
(97265, 3, 0, 99647, 'Then we stand at an impasse. $n, you must resolve this conflict.'),
(97267, 3, 0, 101640, 'There is no convincing you, I see. Very well, I will take my leave. $n, beware that you do not share Illidan''s fate.'),
(97273, 3, 0, 99653, 'We''ve done it, Illidari! FREEDOM IS OURS!'),
(97274, 4, 0, 99653, 'We''ve done it, Illidari! FREEDOM IS OURS!'),
(97303, 3, 0, 99013, 'Hurry, $n. Use the keystone to activate the portal. We must rejoin the fight at the Black Temple.'),
(97305, 0, 0, 99048, 'Caww! $p! $p!'),
(97306, 3, 0, 99048, 'Caww! $p! $p!'),
(97326, 1, 0, 99047, 'The Skyhorn are nothing without their eagles!'),
(97342, 0, 0, 43341, 'Greetings! Please have a look around.'),
(97342, 3, 0, 33548, 'Greetings, $c.'),
(97346, 3, 0, 101083, 'This way, sisters!');
INSERT INTO `tmp_fix_creature_text` VALUES
(97352, 3, 0, 112814, 'Coward! There is no hole you can hide in that we cannot follow.'),
(97359, 0, 0, 99082, 'Sewer guards, time to take a break!'),
(97359, 1, 0, 99083, 'Sewer guards! Return to your posts!'),
(97380, 0, 0, 118974, '%s has used the Wild Mana Wand on $n!'),
(97384, 0, 0, 118974, '%s has used the Wild Mana Wand on $n!'),
(97386, 0, 0, 99118, 'Here is where you insects crawled!'),
(97386, 1, 0, 99119, 'Take to your knees, and my Master may yet be merciful.'),
(97387, 1, 0, 118974, '%s has used the Wild Mana Wand on $n!'),
(97388, 0, 0, 118974, '%s has used the Wild Mana Wand on $n!'),
(97390, 0, 0, 118974, '%s has used the Wild Mana Wand on $n!'),
(97418, 0, 0, 99494, 'More souls! Come and accept your fate!'),
(97418, 1, 0, 82906, 'Me rip, you die!'),
(97421, 0, 0, 99440, 'That wasn''t in my crates. I always do a thorough investigation of everything I buy, and I woulda'' noticed some glowy green stuff.'),
(97429, 3, 0, 99697, 'I''ve already lost two sisters to the demons. You want to investigate that cart? It''s all yours.'),
(97442, 3, 0, 99475, 'You want my hammer? COME DIG FOR IT!'),
(97454, 0, 0, 102269, 'Turn away to avoid |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197737|h[Predator''s Gaze]|h|r'),
(97459, 3, 0, 99172, '$n, this is embarassing...'),
(97459, 3, 0, 99260, 'I swear to give my life if that is what it takes.'),
(97469, 0, 0, 99583, 'You have saved me from an unimaginable fate. Thank you.'),
(97469, 0, 1, 99581, 'I return to battle!'),
(97469, 0, 2, 99582, 'These wretches will know the wrath of the Valkyra!'),
(97469, 0, 3, 24833, 'You have my thanks, stranger.'),
(97486, 2, 0, 94587, 'Everything is... going dark...'),
(97502, 4, 0, 144752, 'Thank you, champion.'),
(97506, 3, 0, 121351, 'Have you come to aid us with Talonclaw?'),
(97525, 2, 0, 99381, 'I return... to the earth...'),
(97526, 2, 0, 99379, 'Darkness... calls...'),
(97527, 1, 0, 99384, 'I am singed, but I can still fight.'),
(97527, 3, 0, 99383, 'We must find Tirion.'),
(97528, 3, 0, 99388, 'Where is Tirion?'),
(97544, 1, 0, 99485, 'A challenger? Let''s see what this one is capable of!'),
(97546, 4, 0, 102112, 'Siege Worms! Fire on my mark!'),
(97558, 3, 0, 98494, 'The time for planning is over, champion. Now, we take action!'),
(97579, 0, 0, 99608, 'Please, defeat them! I''ll protect my son!'),
(97587, 0, 0, 118974, '%s has used the Wild Mana Wand on $n!'),
(97593, 0, 0, 99495, 'Your young will be a tasty snack!'),
(97595, 0, 0, 99548, 'The gargoyles lift off from their pressure plates and the portcullis slams shut!'),
(97614, 3, 0, 98708, 'The Wardens seek our help? Things must be desperate.'),
(97616, 3, 0, 98712, 'Years and years with only the voices in my head. I thought I would go insane.'),
(97617, 3, 0, 98709, 'Ahhhh, it feels good to MOVE again. Thank you, $n.'),
(97618, 3, 0, 98711, 'We will need weapons and supplies if we are to break out of here. I am on it, $n.'),
(97619, 3, 0, 99505, 'I sense demons nearby. After all that time in stasis, I am ready to hunt.'),
(97620, 3, 0, 99506, 'My blades are ready, $n. I will check on the situation ahead.'),
(97622, 3, 0, 98710, '$n, it has been a long time since Mardum. I am ready for another fight.'),
(97643, 0, 0, 99531, 'This is sheer madness! The Wardens have lost control of their prison.'),
(97644, 0, 0, 99645, 'Let''s keep moving. The others are in the chamber just ahead.'),
(97647, 3, 0, 97138, 'Xandris has seen his last moonrise!'),
(97653, 0, 0, 99557, 'Your experience doesn''t match mine!'),
(97653, 1, 0, 99556, 'I''m gonna charge right over you!'),
(97653, 2, 0, 99558, 'You think you can match the strength of my fists?'),
(97653, 3, 0, 99559, 'You should wear a helmet when you fight me!'),
(97653, 4, 0, 99560, 'Okay stop! STOP! Watch the jaw! You win! I''ve never seen such speed before. You''re a good kid, mac. Keep it up. I''ll be back for my belt some day.'),
(97664, 3, 0, 98497, 'It is done, Helya! We have fulfilled your bargain, and we will collect our payment!'),
(97666, 0, 0, 99459, 'Come champion. Journey with me and I shall show you the might of Highmountain.'),
(97671, 1, 0, 102689, 'You will all serve the Legion.'),
(97671, 2, 0, 103516, 'You merely... prolong...'),
(97671, 4, 0, 102690, 'Nowhere is safe.'),
(97675, 0, 0, 99494, 'More souls! Come and accept your fate!'),
(97675, 1, 0, 82906, 'Me rip, you die!'),
(97676, 0, 0, 99574, 'Beware, $n. There is a dreadlord inside that Soul Engine.'),
(97683, 0, 0, 99585, 'Uriah! I''m here! Where are you?'),
(97683, 3, 0, 99586, 'Oh Uriah, you''re injured!'),
(97683, 3, 0, 99642, 'I can''t believe he''s gone...'),
(97706, 3, 0, 103526, 'Warn King Voras!'),
(97717, 3, 0, 99628, 'Mix ''em up, mix ''em up! C''mon now!'),
(97729, 1, 0, 116428, 'Thandae-alah...'),
(97729, 1, 0, 116425, 'You will be cold... like us.'),
(97729, 2, 0, 116419, 'Finally, we rest.'),
(97729, 2, 0, 116421, 'Our people... shu dalees-na.'),
(97729, 2, 0, 102397, 'Peace...'),
(97729, 2, 0, 102390, 'Elisande... stop her...'),
(97729, 3, 0, 116427, 'Trespasser...'),
(97729, 4, 0, 116426, 'Desecrator...'),
(97729, 4, 0, 116424, 'Feel the chill of the grave!'),
(97750, 1, 0, 102864, 'What has happened? What have you done to me?!'),
(97750, 2, 0, 102867, 'My mind is... cleared. I will sleep now. Give Thaedris my love.'),
(97759, 3, 0, 97489, 'Find me when Kagraxxis has been slain! I sense an even darker presence here...'),
(97768, 3, 0, 140099, 'Take cover!'),
(97774, 0, 0, 99833, 'Give up! You only strike at the wind!'),
(97774, 1, 0, 100131, 'Begone, foul creature! You will not harm any more of our sacred texts!'),
(97774, 3, 0, 99838, 'Thank you, friend! My students died to protect these scrolls. Centuries of history could have been lost!'),
(97774, 4, 0, 99847, 'Chen Stormstout was teaching a class of youngsters when the attack began. He''s one of the strongest monks I know, but even he won''t be able to hold out forever. Come, we must rescue them!'),
(97774, 5, 0, 99901, 'No good! We don''t have time to fight our way through that horde!'),
(97774, 6, 0, 100145, 'If I focus my Chi, I believe I can get us behind their forces. Quickly, $n. Take my hand.'),
(97774, 7, 0, 100149, 'This is worse then I feared. $n! We must part ways. They need my help here at the temple. Chen''s class should be just to the north across the bridges.'),
(97774, 8, 0, 100185, 'Jade Serpent watch over you, $n.'),
(97778, 0, 0, 99767, 'Ah, $n, it''s good to see you again. Now that we are all gathered, let''s begin.'),
(97778, 1, 0, 100182, 'As you all know, the defeat at the Broken Shore was decisive. The loss of so many valiant heroes was a terrible blow.'),
(97778, 2, 0, 100183, 'The Burning Legion is a grave threat. We must find a way to stop their assault before all that we hold dear can be...'),
(97778, 3, 0, 99776, 'By the Jade Serpent! What was that?!'),
(97778, 4, 0, 107053, 'Chuang!'),
(97778, 5, 0, 100055, 'Chuang, are you alright? Speak to me!'),
(97778, 6, 0, 100098, 'Brace the west door! I don''t want anymore surprises. Now, let''s see what''s going on out there.'),
(97778, 7, 0, 100099, 'No... this cannot be!'),
(97778, 8, 0, 100100, 'There are too many of them! We have to evacuate!'),
(97778, 9, 0, 100101, '$p, I need you to send any survivors you find back to the temple. Chaung mentioned the Cave of the Crane, so start there. Hurry, we must escape before we are overrun!'),
(97778, 10, 0, 100194, 'Chen, I''m glad to see you and the children are safe!'),
(97778, 11, 0, 100196, 'Well fought, $n, but we''re not done yet.'),
(97778, 12, 0, 100197, 'Chen, take the cubs as far away from this place as you can. $n, and I will stay and seal the portal. White Tiger walk with you, my friend.'),
(97778, 13, 0, 100199, 'We can not allow the Legion to establish a foothold here. We need to close that portal down!'),
(97778, 14, 0, 104052, 'That demon will just open another portal if we don''t take care of it first. Prepare yourself, $p!'),
(97778, 15, 0, 100449, 'Well done, $n! That Fel Stone must be powering the portal. Destroy it!'),
(97812, 1, 0, 102747, 'Rakinishu!'),
(97813, 1, 0, 102751, 'For Candle King!'),
(97817, 4, 0, 100443, 'This demon will fall to the Eagle Spear, Shadowsong. Play with your imps while I do the real work. Next one is on you.'),
(97827, 3, 0, 99721, 'My underking, this one still lives.'),
(97863, 0, 0, 104787, 'Yea, I got what you''re looking for. But I ain''t just gonna hand it over. I need something in return.'),
(97863, 1, 0, 104788, 'There''s this lovely, red jewel upstairs that caught my eye. Get it for me and I''ll trade you the core for it.'),
(97863, 2, 0, 104789, 'Nice doing business with you, friend.'),
(97903, 3, 0, 100442, 'Huln! It is good to see you on this field of battle. You look... taller?'),
(97956, 0, 0, 101048, 'You will not stop me! I will not fail!'),
(97956, 1, 0, 101046, 'You will never defeat us! We are Legion!'),
(97956, 2, 0, 101045, 'Kneel before your new masters!'),
(97968, 0, 0, 100130, 'Haha! More things to burn!'),
(97973, 0, 0, 99874, 'Look what the ravens have dropped off.'),
(97978, 0, 0, 99656, 'I am Archmage Khadgar, leader of the Kirin Tor.'),
(97978, 1, 0, 99658, 'Demon hunters, Azeroth needs your help.'),
(97979, 0, 0, 98515, 'At last! It seems I owe you another life, friend.'),
(97988, 3, 0, 121029, 'The shield bearer arrives at an hour of great need. You will need its strength.'),
(97989, 0, 0, 106820, 'G''Hanir is in danger? Then there is no time to waste.'),
(97999, 1, 0, 107087, 'Shan ronir! Go kiss a tauren!'),
(97999, 1, 0, 107086, 'Puny karkun! Shouldn''t be here!'),
(97999, 4, 0, 101572, 'Feeding Time!'),
(98001, 3, 0, 135125, 'Arrrrraaaaagghhhh!'),
(98001, 3, 0, 100064, 'Oh... my head...'),
(98003, 1, 0, 117302, 'Shadows engulf you!'),
(98003, 4, 0, 96414, 'Gonna enjoy guttin'' you!'),
(98003, 4, 0, 107087, 'Shan ronir! Go kiss a tauren!'),
(98027, 3, 0, 106801, 'Good day to you, $ct.'),
(98027, 3, 0, 106799, 'Hi, $ct!'),
(98046, 0, 2, 100346, 'Mrr mrrgl? Mrglglgl.'),
(98046, 0, 5, 101321, 'Grmrglrgml? Mrgrl. RGL!'),
(98046, 0, 6, 100344, 'Mrrglrrgl?'),
(98046, 0, 7, 101322, 'Mglrrglrgl! Grml. Mrgrmlgr.'),
(98046, 0, 8, 100345, 'Mrlrlrlrlrgl! Grglrgl!'),
(98066, 3, 0, 100392, 'That crazy guy... calls himself Mrgl-Mrgl. Says he was a king in Northrend. I don''t believe him for a second.'),
(98066, 3, 0, 100391, 'Yeah I stayed back while Nesingwary moved on. Why don''t you go check on that murloc guy?'),
(98066, 3, 0, 100393, 'He keeps talking to his baby murloc. Calls him Murky.'),
(98067, 0, 0, 101141, 'This cave belongs to the Murkloc tribe!'),
(98067, 3, 0, 100343, 'This is a job for Murky in order to prove himself. Use his egg to mindmeld with Murky.'),
(98067, 3, 0, 100184, 'Murky, we need you to get stronger! The fate of this coast depends on it!'),
(98067, 3, 0, 100956, 'How''s my little buddy doing?'),
(98074, 3, 0, 99970, 'Sorry.'),
(98074, 3, 0, 99968, 'Sorry, mister Stormstout.'),
(98099, 1, 0, 127067, 'But look what happens when I slice right here...'),
(98099, 2, 0, 127696, 'You will not regret this choice, Shadowblade. I will take out any Legion demon or conspirator who crosses my path!'),
(98099, 3, 0, 127069, 'He spoke in coherent thoughts, and his skin... so well-preserved. But a few telltale signs gave him away.'),
(98099, 4, 0, 127070, 'It seems Legion dreadlords have found a way to craft undead operatives so lifelike that even I have difficulty detecting them!'),
(98099, 5, 0, 127071, 'The demons knew the Illidari would find them if they tried to infiltrate our cities again, so they sent in these... homunculi.'),
(98099, 6, 0, 127072, 'Our agents have identified suspected homunculi in Silvermoon and the Exodar.'),
(98099, 7, 0, 127083, 'We can''t risk you carrying out an assassination in an ally''s city, but no one will question you taking down a target in the Exodar. While you handle that mark, we''ll see to the matter in Silvermoon.'),
(98099, 8, 0, 127084, 'Remember... even though you''re trying to help them, the Alliance will assume you''re attacking one of their own.'),
(98099, 9, 0, 127074, 'Remember... even though you''re trying to help them, the Horde will assume you''re attacking one of their own.'),
(98099, 10, 0, 127073, 'We can''t risk you carrying out an assassination in an ally''s city, but no one will question you taking down a target in Silvermoon. While you handle that mark, I''ll head to the Exodar.'),
(98100, 1, 0, 119779, 'This is likely a one-way trip. Detheroc is most certainly expecting us. Let me know when you are ready.'),
(98109, 3, 0, 112310, '$n, is it true you wield the Kingslayers? The very blades that murdered Wrynn during the first war? I would never say this aloud in Stormwind but... he had it coming.'),
(98161, 3, 0, 120820, 'So the legend is true, the Scale is real...'),
(98161, 3, 0, 123351, 'Look here, Brulf. This one has the fury of twin storms in $ghis:her; hands. Ha-hah, fight on little $r!'),
(98161, 3, 0, 120819, 'It is good to see those blades out of kvaldir hands.'),
(98173, 0, 0, 100041, 'The bindings weaken...'),
(98188, 1, 0, 99991, 'You will not spoil the king''s return!'),
(98189, 1, 0, 99996, 'I will see you dead before you reach the Enduring!'),
(98189, 2, 0, 99999, 'I can see you now...'),
(98189, 2, 0, 99998, 'Do not disturb... the Enduring.'),
