(106228, 0, 0, 120509, 'Our will is yours to command.'),
(106239, 0, 0, 116440, 'I will hear no more of your scheming! You endanger everything our father worked for!'),
(106250, 0, 0, 117112, 'Malorne''s warning cannot be ignored. The great father of the forest is in dire peril, and we must help him... or the very wilds may be lost.'),
