(106435, 3, 0, 122280, 'These ghouls are ready to do your bidding, Deathlord.'),
(106447, 3, 0, 122289, 'Squires aren''t normally so quick to train, but I put a rush on this order for ya.'),
(106457, 0, 0, 122293, 'May the elements serve you well.'),
(106459, 3, 0, 122345, 'These Valarjar Aspirants will aid us in our battle against the Burning Legion!'),
(106482, 1, 0, 112988, 'From each of these pathways, a palpable evil emanates. Choose a course, and know that I will stand with you.'),
(106482, 2, 0, 109528, 'Sacred vines, entangle the corrupted!'),
(106482, 3, 0, 109563, 'It is done! Cenarius is beaten, but my great teacher lives. Now I must focus all of my strength to cleanse him.'),
(106482, 4, 0, 109564, 'Xavius waits ahead in the Rift of Aln, the true heart of the Nightmare. Would that I could fight at your side, heroes, but... to this place, I cannot go.'),
(106482, 5, 0, 109565, 'My bond with the Emerald Dream gives me great power... but it also makes me vulnerable to the rift''s darkness. I have peered inside it and know this to be true. Should I step within, I would be lost... just as Cenarius was.'),
(106482, 6, 0, 109566, 'Go. Destroy the Nightmare Lord. Only this way can the Dream be restored... and Azeroth be saved.'),
(106482, 7, 0, 112985, 'We must put an end to the Nightmare. Say the word and I will take us into the heart of that twisted place.'),
(106495, 0, 0, 109660, 'Dusk lily pods? I see...'),
(106495, 1, 0, 109662, 'Please excuse me. I must address this immediately.'),
