(106654, 2, 0, 116429, 'Im... impossible.'),
(106654, 3, 0, 124224, 'We know where your family is. Speak, or they die too!'),
(106655, 3, 0, 110124, 'Ah, Felo''melorn. The Flamestrike! Such craftsmanship, such elegance...'),
(106655, 3, 0, 110130, 'Thank you, $n. I have labored a hundred lifetimes and have not seen its like.'),
(106656, 0, 0, 117139, 'The Burning Legion killed my family. Die!'),
(106656, 1, 0, 117133, 'There''s nothing "exotic" about fel magic!'),
(106656, 4, 0, 117137, 'Death by sword or death by spells, it''s all the same to me!'),
(106656, 9, 0, 111443, 'Ravandwyr, you should not have gone off alone!'),
(106680, 0, 0, 112409, 'You''ll find time can be quite volatile.'),
(106680, 1, 0, 124211, '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_ARCANE_INVOCATION:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:210022|h[Epocheric Orbs]|h|r fall from the sky!'),
(106696, 0, 0, 110907, 'It is done. I will dispose of the ashes and find Mayruna back at camp. Thank you, friend.'),
(106720, 1, 0, 113580, 'It is done! You rotten Bonespeaker dogs cannot deny my place in the Halls of Valor any longer!'),
(106752, 1, 0, 107085, 'Don''t mess with the mountain!'),
(106756, 0, 0, 113504, 'My essence will not be controlled again!'),
(106756, 0, 2, 113503, 'I will not be contained!'),
(106756, 0, 3, 113505, 'I will not succumb to your paltry magics!'),
(106756, 0, 4, 113509, '[Scream of frustration]'),
(106756, 0, 5, 113510, 'You fancy yourself as worthy to wield me as the previous "Guardian?" You are but a child to me.'),
(106756, 0, 6, 113511, 'You foolishly think you can control this power. So be it.'),
(106756, 1, 0, 113512, 'Come, child. Let us wreak havoc upon your foes, and I shall see what you are made of.'),
(106770, 1, 0, 117243, 'I''ve got just what you need!'),
(106770, 1, 0, 117241, 'Don''t worry, I''ve got your back!'),
(106795, 0, 0, 111126, 'Marlan must evaluate your gift before I can speak with you further. Farewell.'),
(106798, 1, 0, 111007, 'Archmage Vargoth will hear of this intrusion!'),
(106812, 4, 0, 124289, 'Let''s go!'),
(106812, 4, 0, 117232, 'A worthy opponent!'),
(106843, 3, 0, 110987, 'It has been ages since I have seen the Tidestone whole, but there it stands.'),
(106881, 3, 0, 111113, 'By all means, keep splashing around and attract attention.'),
(106881, 3, 0, 111096, 'Try not to leave a breadcrumb back to us, hero.'),
(106881, 3, 0, 111095, 'Right then, I''m gone.'),
(106885, 1, 0, 117246, 'Is this wikket bammin''? ''Cause heads I be slammin''!'),
(106885, 4, 0, 117244, 'This nasty wikket gonna get it!'),
(106897, 0, 0, 122610, 'I believe our wounds have healed enough. I will continue my scouting. Be well, Lilryia.'),
(106901, 3, 0, 122089, 'What have you done to yourself, $n? You''re more demon than $r.'),
(106904, 3, 0, 122275, 'Odyn''s glory be with you, Valarjar.'),
(106905, 0, 0, 121690, 'The veil is lifted from my eyes, heroes. The shadows retreat, and the Dream beckons.'),
(106905, 1, 0, 121707, 'Thank you, heroes.'),
(106906, 0, 1, 94757, 'You cannot escape my power!'),
(106906, 0, 2, 94759, 'Manach sheek-thrish!'),
(106906, 0, 3, 114569, 'The Legion cannot be stopped!'),
(106906, 0, 4, 94749, 'This world will burn!'),
(106906, 1, 0, 94779, 'Destructions comes! Lok thorje sorankar!'),
(106942, 3, 0, 120260, 'I''ll keep adding to it as our research continues. It''s worth taking a look if you have some time.'),
(106951, 3, 0, 111151, 'Keep all of this between you and me, $c. As they say, loose lips sink ships.'),
(106990, 1, 0, 111164, 'What?! It''s mine. You can''t have it!'),
(106990, 2, 0, 111165, 'Lord of the tides curse you, $r!'),
(107022, 0, 0, 117253, 'They never saw it coming.'),
(107022, 1, 0, 117255, 'Strike hard, strike fast!'),
(107022, 1, 0, 117254, 'The element of surprise is on our side!'),
(107023, 0, 0, 111614, '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\warrior_talent_icon_thunderstruck:20|t Nithogg unleashes a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:212841|h[Crackling Jolt]|h|r!'),
(107105, 1, 0, 123258, 'Struggle hard... I like my prey exhausted.'),
(107106, 2, 0, 112516, 'We are... unending.'),
