(107137, 2, 0, 116779, 'Forgive me... Elisande.'),
(107137, 3, 0, 116701, 'None may challenge us!'),
(107166, 0, 0, 111365, 'If you have need, call us on the field of battle. Together, we will protect this world!'),
(107195, 0, 0, 111311, 'Our enemies shall burn.'),
(107208, 0, 0, 111328, 'Faster, Zoom!'),
(107208, 0, 0, 111330, 'Oh, come on!'),
(107208, 0, 0, 111329, 'They''re cheating!'),
(107208, 3, 0, 111327, 'Get ''em Zoom!'),
(107208, 3, 0, 111326, 'Zoom is best!'),
(107214, 0, 0, 113631, 'Very impressive, druid.'),
(107217, 0, 0, 124550, 'More souls to fuel the portal!'),
(107217, 0, 1, 124551, 'Behold the infinite Legion!'),
(107217, 2, 0, 124552, 'No! The portal...'),
(107225, 0, 0, 111356, 'Ah! This cask contains a large amount of arcwine. Go ahead and put it into the gondola.'),
(107244, 3, 0, 111573, 'What is this mumbling trash? They call THIS a ritual? I could rain fire down on all of these eredar and I don''t think it could make this ritual any worse than it already is.'),
(107244, 3, 0, 111569, 'Well now, Arkethrax is leading this band? This is an opportunity I did not expect.'),
(107245, 3, 0, 122438, 'We should continue our patrol. There is no telling how many more of these incursions pocket the landscape.'),
(107253, 0, 0, 117194, 'You''ll find Lorin in the square. Sylessa frequents the canals. Just search the bazaar for Cyrille. They''ll catch your eye.'),
(107253, 1, 0, 119243, 'Is that what she''s up to? Brave girl. I''d be delighted to help, but...'),
(107253, 2, 0, 116295, 'Always a pleasure. Do things my way and she''ll be advisor before dinner.'),
(107253, 3, 0, 121788, 'Arluin beckons you over.'),
(107253, 5, 0, 116512, 'I accept your gratitude, by the way!'),
(107253, 6, 0, 115306, 'Cute. Do you want to get us both killed? No? Didn''t think so.'),
(107253, 7, 0, 115305, 'Vengeance? You can do better than that. Much better. In fact...'),
(107269, 1, 0, 123255, 'Let us see what resides in your soul, mortal.'),
(107280, 3, 0, 111741, 'So be it. Turn this great power against the foes of Tirisfal!'),
(107301, 4, 0, 116370, 'Give me! Give me!'),
