(116441, 3, 0, 125828, 'Should the need arise, these apprentices can supply you with essentials. I suggest you take note of their offerings.'),
(116441, 4, 0, 125235, 'I wish you luck, $p. A word of warning... If you leave this place, you will lose all progress and be forced to begin the task anew.'),
