(117694, 2, 0, 126462, 'We''re not done yet!'),
(117694, 3, 0, 126467, 'Least there''s no giant eye lasers this time, eh?'),
(117695, 0, 0, 126293, 'A lost titan vault... kept in immaculate condition? This be one fer the record books! What d''ye suppose be in these bubbles, eh?'),
(117695, 1, 0, 126261, 'Spawns o'' Light, barely of this world. A good dispel should dissipate ''em.'),
(117695, 2, 0, 126463, 'By my troth, this''ll be the last time I go adventurin'' with a Bronzebeard!'),
(117709, 0, 0, 129203, 'I suppose I should ensure the Fel Hammer is being properly repaired. See you there, Sslayer.'),
(117714, 0, 0, 126893, 'Welcome, Highlord $p. I''ve been making preparations for the ritual to cleanse the barding. But so far, we''ve been unable to secure the holy water.'),
(117714, 2, 0, 126895, 'Perhaps someone of your skills would be better suited to recover the water. Please, take a pair of my paladins with you. Who knows what''s still lurking in this place.'),
(117714, 3, 0, 126906, 'Excellent job recovering the water, Highlord. And you have my deepest thanks for saving my paladins.'),
(117714, 5, 0, 126908, 'It is done! The barding is ready. Now we go to Rivendare''s crypt to confront his specter.'),
(117714, 6, 0, 126909, 'MOUNT UP, PALADINS! WE RIDE!'),
(117714, 7, 0, 126910, 'They''ll bring up the rear while we''re inside dealing with Rivendare.'),
(117714, 8, 0, 126911, 'Where is his body?! It should be here!'),
(117714, 9, 0, 126912, 'Someone''s taken it! This does not bode well...'),
(117714, 10, 0, 126918, 'The beast is bound, Highlord! The Light has favored us this day!'),
(117714, 11, 0, 126919, 'Let us reconvene at the Sanctum of Light. There you can bard the beast safely.'),
(117714, 12, 0, 126920, 'When you''re ready to leave, speak with me and I''ll see to our safe return.'),
(117759, 1, 0, 126325, 'I hope yer reeaaaddy to get crushed, $rt! I''ve starved this bear fer a week, and he''s gonna eat ye alive!'),
