(118294, 0, 1, 125297, 'Your kindness will not be forgotten.'),
(118294, 0, 2, 125294, 'Thank you, $c.'),
(118297, 0, 0, 127460, 'Your group has elected to kick Schnottz from the balloon!'),
(118322, 0, 0, 116793, 'It''s no use!'),
(118322, 1, 0, 116429, 'Im... impossible.'),
(118327, 0, 0, 126903, 'They swarmed us. I... I tried to fight, but... Thank you Highlord for saving me.'),
(118328, 1, 0, 135850, 'For the Legion!'),
(118328, 1, 0, 102131, 'You are easily dealt with.'),
(118331, 1, 0, 137507, 'Curse your soul!'),
(118332, 0, 0, 126904, 'It felt like my soul was being slowly ripped from my body. The necromancer, he... I must get to Grayson.'),
(118333, 0, 0, 126905, 'It''s over?! Is this real? Highlord, it''s you... I... I think I can make my way back. Thank you.'),
(118335, 2, 0, 129822, 'Let this torment end!'),
(118336, 1, 0, 129819, 'Death is only the beginning.'),
(118336, 2, 0, 129823, 'This... cannot be...'),
(118340, 0, 0, 126630, 'Please be turnink your attenzhion to me.'),
(118340, 1, 0, 126631, 'Ve run a tight balloon here!'),
(118340, 2, 0, 126632, 'Zhere vill be no talkink, no jumpink, no basket-jostlink.'),
(118340, 3, 0, 126633, 'NO HORSEPLAYINK!'),
(118340, 4, 0, 126634, 'Zhese are zhe rules. Obey zhem, or be dealt vizh.'),
(118340, 5, 0, 126635, 'Ve vill all have a very nice balloon ride, and ve are goink to enjoy it. Is zhat clear?'),
(118340, 6, 0, 126636, 'Very goot. Now ve sit in silence for zhe next hour.'),
(118340, 7, 0, 126638, 'I DESERVED ZHIIISSS!'),
(118346, 3, 0, 126898, 'You''re too late to save your allies, paladin. Their souls fuel my army...'),
(118351, 0, 0, 126655, 'Hop aboard, junior ballooners! Anybody want a balloon sticker? Here ya go.'),
(118351, 1, 0, 126656, 'We run the swankiest balloon in all of Azeroth! Ask anybody, they''ll tell ya it''s true!'),
(118351, 2, 0, 126658, 'Today, we''re flying over Azsuna, the jewel of the Broken Isles.'),
(118351, 3, 0, 126660, 'That''s the Nar''thalas Academy down there. A school for mages back in ancient times, I hear.'),
(118351, 4, 0, 126662, 'Rungle, why don''t ya heat up the barbecue, then get the fireworks ready.'),
(118351, 5, 0, 126664, 'Ya might be wondering how I can run such a classy balloon outfit and still turn a profit. Well, lemme tell ya.'),
(118351, 6, 0, 126665, 'The trick is, ya don''t reveal the price to the customer ''til they''re up in the balloon with ya!'),
(118351, 7, 0, 126666, 'That''ll be 28,542 gold each--gratuity NOT included. Unless, of course, you''d like Rungle here to break your legs.'),
(118351, 8, 0, 126668, 'You did WHAT? Rungle, you bungled it again!!!!!!!!'),
(118352, 0, 0, 126657, 'How''s about some free drinks? Here ya go!'),
(118352, 1, 0, 126659, 'Anybody for caviar? We got only the best!'),
(118352, 2, 0, 126661, 'Hot towel? Only the best for our customers!'),
(118352, 3, 0, 126663, 'Sure thing, boss.'),
(118352, 4, 0, 126667, 'Okay, boss. I put the fireworks on the barbecue, like you said.'),
(118353, 0, 0, 126669, 'Welcome, friends, to the Nesingwary balloon tour o'' Highmountain!'),
(118353, 1, 0, 126670, 'Bought this balloon from a wee goblin. Claimed it''d make a good perch fer shootin'' moose!'),
(118353, 2, 0, 126671, 'Lately, though... eh, I dunno. Been feelin'' a bit down. Huntin'' don''t bring the same joy it once did.'),
(118353, 3, 0, 126672, 'Not even shootin'' critters from a hot air balloon can cheer me up.'),
(118353, 4, 0, 127343, 'Now I''m all melancholy.'),
(118353, 5, 0, 127344, 'Anybody know any good jokes? Here, I''ll start...'),
(118353, 6, 0, 127345, 'Why do dwarf hunters use guns?'),
(118353, 7, 0, 127346, 'Because ye can''t drink ale from the barrel of a bow!'),
(118353, 8, 0, 127347, 'Heh. It''s okay for me to tell that one because I''m a dwarf. And a hunter!'),
(118353, 9, 0, 126673, '$n, you got any?'),
(118353, 10, 0, 126674, 'How ''bout you, $n?'),
(118353, 11, 0, 126675, 'Or even you, $n. Someone cheer me up!'),
(118353, 12, 0, 126676, 'Ach... looks like we''re gonna come in pretty close. Everybody wave hello to Thunder Totem!'),
(118353, 13, 0, 127348, 'Heh, that brightened me spirit. Thanks fer keepin'' an ol'' hunter company!'),
(118354, 0, 0, 126677, 'Welcome aboard. Please sit back and enjoy the ride.'),
(118354, 1, 0, 126678, 'Below, you will see Crystalsong Forest.'),
(118354, 2, 0, 126679, 'I''m sad to say that despite all my travels, I never spent much time here. I couldn''t tell you why.'),
(118354, 3, 0, 126680, 'Ahh... but I do have fond memories of my time here in Northrend.'),
(118354, 4, 0, 126681, 'Just over that ridge lies Sholazar Basin. There I met tribes of wolvar and murloc oracles. Such strange creatures!'),
(118354, 5, 0, 126682, 'After all the journeys I''ve been on, I still remember that day the most clearly.'),
(118354, 6, 0, 126683, 'Please, pardon me for blathering on. No doubt the the tales of your own adventures are much more exciting!'),
