(118355, 1, 0, 126691, 'This is the balloon ride to Halfhill. Please keep your hands and off-hands inside the basket at all times.'),
(118355, 2, 0, 126692, '<Sigh>...'),
(118355, 3, 0, 126694, 'Below us, to the right, you will see Pang''s Stead. Be sure to keep an eye out for...'),
(118355, 4, 0, 126695, 'You know what? That''s it. I''ve HAD it!'),
(118355, 5, 0, 126696, 'I have a confession I''d like to make to the three of you.'),
(118355, 6, 0, 126697, 'I HATE balloons. Hated them all my life. All I ever wanted to do was be a shaman, but no! Apparently "ballooning is in our blood".'),
