(119185, 0, 5, 105124, 'Your death will be swift and unmerciful.'),
(119185, 0, 6, 109464, 'By the might of Sargeras!'),
(119199, 0, 0, 127693, 'You dare interrupt a servant of the Legion!'),
(119199, 0, 1, 127692, 'Your end is near.'),
(119199, 0, 2, 127695, 'Now you meet your end!'),
(119214, 0, 0, 129810, 'These spirits belong to the Burning Legion!'),
(119214, 1, 0, 129811, 'My death will not break the pact!'),
(119269, 1, 0, 98766, 'We will cleanse the universe in fire.'),
(119270, 1, 0, 102130, 'You will die by my blade.'),
(119338, 0, 0, 128740, 'I understand the need to mourn, but the king''s place is on his throne. The Broken Shore must be our focus. Convince Anduin to end his vigil!'),
(119338, 1, 0, 128802, 'Visions don''t win wars, Prophet. The boy has a good heart, but he''s untested.'),
(119338, 2, 0, 128807, 'We need more than that, and so does he. Anduin wasn''t there on the Broken Shore. He hasn''t seen the sacrifice his soldiers made... that they continue to make.'),
(119338, 3, 0, 128809, 'A king must know the weight of the orders he gives--the price of them. If a compass breaks his spirit, how will he respond when the war arrives on our doorstep?'),
(119340, 0, 0, 128738, 'Our guest arrives. Perhaps now there is hope of reaching the king.'),
(119340, 1, 0, 128739, 'Anduin refuses to eat or sleep. He ignores every plea to return to the palace. Nothing I say seems to offer comfort.'),
(119340, 2, 0, 128801, 'The young king will become a great leader. I have foreseen it.'),
(119340, 3, 0, 128803, 'The Light is strong with Anduin. He will grow into his crown. We must have faith.'),
(119357, 0, 0, 128747, 'I''ll need a disguise to move through the city without attracting attention.'),
(119357, 1, 0, 128748, 'I think I know just the spell. Follow me.'),
(119357, 2, 0, 129139, 'Stormwind has always been my home. I know its shops and streets as I do the back of my hand.'),
(119357, 3, 0, 129140, 'Yet even as I walk these familiar steps, I have never felt more lost.'),
(119357, 6, 0, 129163, 'I have not returned to Lion''s Rest since my father''s memorial was moved here from the keep.'),
(119357, 7, 0, 129164, 'The war has consumed all of my energy and attention. I have not had a moment to grieve.'),
(119357, 8, 0, 128797, 'Since you brought my father''s compass back to me, I''ve prayed to the Light for guidance, and to know his spirit is at rest. The Light doesn''t answer.'),
(119357, 9, 0, 128799, 'My people like me, respect me... but they don''t believe in me. Not like they believed in him.'),
(119357, 10, 0, 128800, 'I''ve heard the voice of the people, but how do my father''s advisors feel? I fear they do not trust me as they did my father.'),
(119357, 11, 0, 128927, 'I must know. Follow me to the keep.'),
(119388, 0, 0, 129672, 'Velen. At long last, you return to the home you abandoned.');
