(119773, 0, 0, 128328, 'Blessings on you, Grandmaster!'),
(119781, 0, 0, 128219, 'Illidari! Bring out the beast!'),
(119781, 1, 0, 128220, 'A few days ago, this fel bat attacked our camp. It''s a rare treat to capture a mature specimen, so I insisted it be restrained rather than destroyed.'),
(119781, 2, 0, 128221, 'Taming such a willful beast requires a show of dominance. That is, of course, my specialty... but in this case, I suggest simply pummeling it into submission.'),
(119781, 3, 0, 128222, 'Quickly, bind the creature!'),
(119781, 4, 0, 128223, 'My apologies, Slayer, it seems to have escaped. Ah, but see here? A trail of blood. How convenient!'),
(119781, 5, 0, 128224, 'Tracking it should be simple, thanks to your demon sight. But if it''s run off to the breeding grounds, I fear you may have some trouble bringing it back. Bats can be such... spirited creatures.'),
(119781, 6, 0, 128233, 'I see you''ve tamed the beast, Slayer $p. Congratulations are in order, my dear!'),
(119781, 7, 0, 128234, 'Allow us to make the creature presentable so that it may be conferred to you at the Fel Hammer. Speak with Yrdris and he''ll see you back to the ship.'),
(119790, 3, 0, 128212, 'Do you see the Horsemen? Incredible that they''re holding their own against that throng.'),
(119790, 3, 0, 128211, 'The Legion will tremble beneath Daumyr''s shadow. They''ll plead for mercy as we rain down death and destruction!'),
(119808, 0, 0, 128617, 'You''re ordered to report to the battlefield at once. Take out those demons shredding our front lines!'),
(119823, 0, 0, 128225, 'I will activate the portal. Once it''s open, I''ll need you to place the Calling Stone to draw Arax''ath and the Wrathsteed through.'),
(119823, 1, 0, 128227, 'No doubt he will send his minions to stop us. Maintaining the portal will require all of my strength, so I will rely on you to hold them off.'),
(119823, 2, 0, 127652, 'Now, let us pierce through the Twisting Nether and take what is ours!'),
(119823, 3, 0, 127653, 'Rak-ath varus mir''enon!'),
(119823, 4, 0, 127654, 'Vae Xoroth!'),
(119823, 5, 0, 127657, 'The way is open, warlock! Activate the calling stone!'),
(119823, 6, 0, 127670, 'Excellent work! We must convene the council. Only with their combined strength can we bind a beast of such power.'),
(119823, 7, 0, 128842, 'Restrain the beast, and I will summon them to us...'),
(119830, 0, 0, 128245, 'I see the Farseer has edified your allegiances in my direction. Good. Let me clear away any doubts still polluting your minds.'),
(119830, 1, 0, 128246, 'I am the Windlord now, and all of you bluster about within my domain. But let us not leave this council with a whiff of foul air.'),
(119830, 2, 0, 128247, 'Divided, we are scattered to the winds. But united, we are a cyclone of power. Let this council never dissipate again.'),
(119830, 3, 0, 128248, 'Farseer $p, I will return you to the Heart of Azeroth. Depart with my thanks.'),
(119830, 4, 0, 128249, 'Once there, I shall present you with a gift to show my appreciation. May it serve you well.'),
(119834, 3, 0, 109685, 'Anyone? Help!'),
(119840, 1, 0, 127667, 'The Wrathsteed will never be yours, mortal!'),
(119840, 2, 0, 135820, 'Impossible...'),
(119844, 0, 0, 128442, 'Welcome to Felwing Ledge, Slayer $p. The Matron Mother is waiting for you down in the training area, just west of here.'),
