(119872, 3, 0, 128321, 'I do hope this one is more entertaining than the last.'),
(119892, 3, 0, 128653, '''Tis good ta see ye, $n. Now that the nightmares are gone, we can find out what she wants ta tell us. Give the word and we''ll begin.'),
