(120157, 0, 0, 125200, 'We are under attack and taking heavy losses. Legion portals are opening up everywhere! We need reinforcements!'),
(120161, 0, 0, 128943, 'The Helm of Domination shows me many things, Deathlord.'),
(120161, 1, 0, 128944, 'I have seen a vision... thousands of undead marching to the far reaches of Northrend in search of a great power.'),
