(130030, 0, 0, 146637, 'I can''t wait to see the looks on their greedy faces when all of their shredders are blown to bits!'),
(130532, 0, 0, 143496, 'You all look like a sturdy lot. Hmm... could use another rogue or two, I''d say... but you''ll do!'),
(130532, 1, 0, 143483, 'Champions, azerite deposits have been located on an island off the coast of Feralas. We must secure them before the Horde does.'),
(130532, 2, 0, 143484, 'We''ve brought our ship around to the center of the island. Collect as much azerite as you can. It is the key to victory!'),
(130532, 3, 0, 143486, 'There''s a rich azerite deposit below us, heroes. Get down there and collect all you can. And if those Horde marauders gets in your way... put them down!'),
(130532, 4, 0, 143491, 'You''re doing good work. Just a bit more azerite and the day is ours!'),
(130532, 4, 1, 143489, 'You''re doing well so far, heroes. But we need more azerite!'),
(130532, 5, 0, 143493, 'Supplies incoming! Grab them, champions!'),
(130532, 5, 1, 143488, 'Heroes! We''re dropping supplies down to you. Don''t let the Horde get their hands on them!'),
(130532, 6, 0, 143492, 'More azerite eruptions! Locate them on your map and secure those sites!'),
(130532, 7, 0, 143494, 'Nicely done, champions! King Wrynn will be pleased to learn of your victory. For the Alliance!'),
(130532, 7, 1, 143490, 'You kept that azerite out of the Horde''s hands. Well done!'),
(130532, 8, 0, 143495, 'Damn! The Horde got the upper hand this time. But I swear upon Lion''s Rest that we will yet claim victory!'),
(130532, 9, 0, 143498, 'These Horde think they''re clever. Teach them a lesson!'),
(130532, 9, 1, 143499, 'Fight for the king! Fight for the Alliance!'),
(130532, 9, 2, 143500, 'Drive them out! This island is ours!'),
(130773, 1, 0, 141900, 'Hahahaha! It feels good to swing my mace again!'),
(131328, 3, 0, 143284, 'Stars guide you, $p. I have heard intriguing talk of the Hillsbrad Foothills. I will likely journey there.'),
(131773, 0, 0, 143504, 'Let me have a look at you. Ugh... pathetic! Why aren''t there any dark rangers in your ranks? Well, you''ll have to do.'),
(131773, 1, 0, 143501, 'Champions of the Horde! We have found Azerite deposits on some wretched island off the Feralas coast. It is your duty to secure it in the name of the Dark Lady!'),
(131773, 2, 0, 143502, 'Your mission here is simple. Collect every bit of azerite and leave nothing for the Alliance to find. I trust that isn''t too hard to grasp.'),
(131773, 3, 0, 143505, 'Down there... azerite! Take it for our warchief. And should those Alliance get in your way, litter the beach with their corpses. Move!'),
(131773, 4, 0, 143508, 'An acceptable first effort, but we need more azerite!'),
(131773, 4, 1, 143510, 'Almost there. Do not relent. More azerite!'),
(131773, 5, 0, 143507, 'Grab these supplies, if you need them. But don''t lose sight of the Banshee Queen''s prize!'),
(131773, 5, 1, 143506, 'Supplies are on the way. I better not see the Alliance getting them before you do!'),
(131773, 6, 0, 143511, 'There are more azerite eruptions around this blasted island! Check your map to find them.'),
(131773, 6, 1, 143512, 'Zounds! There''s even more azerite to be had. Follow your map and lock down those sites!'),
(131773, 7, 0, 143509, 'Ha! Snatched it out of the Alliance''s hands! Well struck!'),
(131773, 7, 1, 143517, 'That was far from what I''d call an elegant victory, but at least you put those Alliance dogs in their place. For the Horde!'),
(131773, 8, 0, 143518, 'You... lost? To them? Pathetic! Report to the Undercity for remedial training. Apparently I have to start at square one with you...'),
(131773, 9, 0, 143515, 'Take them down! You do NOT want to disappoint your warchief!'),
(131907, 1, 0, 147252, 'We are the harbingers of destruction!'),
(131908, 1, 0, 147257, 'You will kneel before our master!'),
(131957, 0, 0, 146379, 'Now you see me, but soon you won''t!'),
(131957, 0, 1, 146380, 'Horde scum! Die!'),
(131957, 0, 2, 146375, 'Filthy $r, I''ll make you bleed!'),
(131957, 0, 3, 146376, 'You''re going to pay for your crimes against the Alliance!'),
(131963, 0, 0, 146636, 'Our orders are to obtain this mysterious ore by any means necessary.'),
(131963, 1, 0, 146641, 'We cannot afford a resurgence of the Twilight''s Hammer. Voidstrider must die!'),
(131963, 2, 0, 147310, 'I think we''ve got the situation in Silithus under control. SI:7 can take the operation from here. Thanks again, $n.'),
(132040, 0, 0, 146851, 'Don''t be afraid to get your hands dirty crackin'' those silithid skulls!'),
(132040, 1, 0, 146854, 'This research is gonna help us understand the power of that giant blade!'),
(132045, 0, 0, 146857, 'You gotta take out those dirty SI:7 spies before they ruin the whole operation!'),
(132055, 1, 0, 146370, 'You''re gonna regret pickin'' a fight with me!'),
(132055, 1, 0, 146369, 'Don''t mess with the cartel!'),
(132055, 1, 0, 146371, 'No trespassing!'),
(132062, 1, 0, 146370, 'You''re gonna regret pickin'' a fight with me!'),
(132062, 1, 0, 146371, 'No trespassing!'),
(132090, 2, 0, 107820, 'He will return.'),
(132147, 0, 0, 146861, 'Get out there and put those lazy prospectors in their place!'),
(132147, 1, 0, 146863, 'We cannot let this fanatic rally the remaining survivors to action! Bring me his head!'),
(132147, 2, 0, 147304, 'The situation in Silithus is now under our control. I will see to the rest of the operation. Go with honor, $n.'),
(132192, 0, 0, 147309, 'I''ve never seen anythin'' like this in all my years! What can it be?'),
(132199, 1, 0, 111131, 'I gonna seperate your HEAD from your BODY! BWAHAHA!'),
(132199, 3, 0, 111124, 'It the end of the world... and I feel fine! HAHA!'),
(132203, 1, 0, 146373, 'The reckoning has come early for you!'),
(132212, 0, 0, 144756, 'Earthmother bless you!'),
(132216, 0, 0, 144753, 'The whispers... they were driving me mad!'),
(132216, 3, 0, 144754, 'I must... My mind... Must get away from this place!'),
(132591, 1, 0, 146374, 'Ogmot gonna eat your soul! HAHAHA!'),
(132606, 0, 0, 146638, 'We must find out how the silithid survived the blade of Sargeras!'),
(132606, 1, 0, 147308, 'Thanks to you, we are now one step closer to understanding the effect that the blade is having on Silithus!'),
(132969, 0, 0, 146070, 'You rang?'),
(132999, 0, 0, 146117, 'My, my, what do we have here?'),
(132999, 1, 0, 146118, 'How did you know we were here, I wonder?'),
(132999, 2, 0, 146119, 'You mortals are all the same. Fighting, but not knowing what for.'),
(132999, 3, 0, 146120, 'Pity. You would have made an excellent servant.'),
(133019, 0, 0, 146352, 'I was just taking a break!'),
(133019, 0, 1, 146351, 'Alright! Alright! I''ll get back to work!'),
(133019, 0, 2, 146355, 'I was just resting my eyes!'),
(133019, 0, 3, 146353, 'Back to work! I get it!'),
(133019, 0, 4, 146354, 'You don''t have to get physical! I''ll get back to work!'),
(133019, 0, 5, 146355, 'I was just resting my eyes!'),
(133059, 3, 0, 146233, 'Open fire!'),
(168137, 0, 0, 69488, 'Wait... you''re not one of the warlocks that snuck in here before. Why then are you here?'),
(168137, 1, 0, 69498, 'It has been many months since those two warlocks broke into the temple... but I''m still not sure what they were after.'),
(168137, 2, 0, 69499, 'Follow me. They visited both the Shrine of Lost Souls and the Temple Summit.'),
(168137, 4, 0, 69501, 'It will take many years for us to undo the damage that Magtheridon, Illidan and the fel orcs did to this holy place.'),
(168137, 5, 0, 69502, 'Within lies the Shrine of Lost Souls. The souls of thousands of my fallen brethren remain within this area.'),
(168137, 6, 0, 69503, 'Use caution, there are many traps still active within. Perhaps one of your demon spells will grant you the ability to scout ahead before advancing forward.'),
(168137, 7, 0, 69538, '$n! Some of my men are trapped in the basement - there is little time, help me save them!!'),
(168137, 8, 0, 69487, 'Foolish warlocks. I knew you would try again to ransack our temple...!'),
(170166, 0, 0, 135514, 'No!'),
(170166, 1, 0, 72496, 'This is only what you once asked me to do if it came to this, Kanrethad. You brought this on yourself.'),
(170166, 2, 0, 72498, 'Kanrethad enveloped himself with so much fel energy that it corrupted him totally. But a small taste of his power should not be harmful. Go ahead.'),
(170166, 3, 0, 72499, 'Now go, and use what you''ve learned. If you ever wish to have the fel energy purged from you, or reabsorb some of Kanrethad''s, talk to me. I''ll be at the Altar of Damnation in Shadowmoon Valley, keeping him banished.'),
(220027, 5, 0, 126927, 'Alright, let''s get this barding upgraded!'),
(220027, 6, 0, 126928, 'First I gotta just smelt all this ore...'),
(220027, 7, 0, 126929, 'Now if I just hammer the leystone in here... aaand here...'),
(220027, 8, 0, 126930, 'And last but not least, the jewel!'),
(220027, 9, 0, 126931, 'And there she is! Some of my finest work, if I do say so myself! You may take it now.'),
(220027, 10, 0, 126932, 'I''m sure Grayson will be pleased to see what we accomplished. Send him my best.'),
(220032, 0, 0, 103936, 'OH! That feels SO much better.'),
(220032, 1, 0, 103938, 'So this is Dalaran? Jabrul is impressed. This way to the jewelcrafting masters?'),
(220032, 2, 0, 128541, 'What ho!'),
(220045, 0, 0, 128995, 'Welcome, $ct. Let''s get this assault under way, shall we?'),
(220045, 1, 0, 128997, 'We will divide our forces to hit them from all sides at once.'),
(220046, 0, 0, 124787, 'Do be careful. Wrong answers are bad for your health. And I do mean that quite literally!'),
(220046, 1, 0, 124783, 'Will you stop that?! You''re making a mess!'),
(220046, 2, 0, 124788, 'Hold a moment... you''re not a real apprentice! Have at thee, imposter!'),
(220046, 3, 0, 124789, 'Apprentici... attack!'),
(220046, 4, 0, 124798, 'The Focusing Iris will make me the most powerful mage of all time! Just try to stop me!'),
(220046, 5, 0, 124799, 'Say, you''re pretty strong, aren''t you? On second thought, don''t try to stop me!'),
(220046, 6, 0, 124800, 'You are too late! Take care of my pursuer, Apprentice Sanath!'),
(220047, 0, 0, 128469, 'I will meet you at Valdisdall in Stormheim. We should be able to reach Skold-Ashil from there.'),
(220050, 0, 0, 125835, 'Halt! Who approaches the Vault of Eyir?'),
(220050, 1, 0, 125672, 'The God-King''s heir!? What is this nonsense?'),
(220050, 2, 0, 125673, 'Wait... that face... Come with me, child!'),
(220051, 0, 0, 125683, 'I will ride ahead to Haustvald. I would be honored if you would join me there, $n.'),
(220052, 0, 0, 125691, 'I will continue to Hrydshal. See you there, $c.'),
(220055, 0, 0, 125720, 'Very well. Ask it, child.'),
(220055, 1, 0, 125722, 'Oh, child... no good can come of such truths. Do you truly wish to know?'),
(220055, 2, 0, 125724, 'So be it. It was Odyn himself who ordered the deaths of Skovald''s family.'),
(220055, 3, 0, 125726, 'Odyn feared that the God-King''s heirs would offer the Tideskorn into the hands of the Legion.'),
(220055, 4, 0, 125727, 'He decreed that the lineage of Skovald be ended... in blood.'),
(220055, 5, 0, 125729, 'Sigryn! No! You must not let the darkness take hold!'),
(220055, 6, 0, 125732, 'Sigryn... what have you done?'),
(220055, 7, 0, 125675, 'So the blood of Skovald has returned to the Valkyra? Do you know what this means, child?'),
(220055, 8, 0, 125677, 'The outsider speaks true. Long ago, I foresaw the Valkyra uniting the Tideskorn against a terrible foe. At its head would stand a descendant of God-King and Shieldmaiden.'),
(220055, 9, 0, 125678, 'As a child of Skovald, you hold a claim to his throne. Any who dispute your right to rule must be made to bend the knee.'),
(220055, 10, 0, 125679, 'Fail, and the Tideskorn will splinter, leaving nothing to stop the Legion from overtaking Stormheim.'),
(220055, 11, 0, 125680, 'I know this is a great burden on you, child, but you may be our only hope.'),
(220065, 0, 0, 126802, 'Fhambar picks up Levia''s trail!'),
(220065, 1, 0, 128370, 'Fhambar senses something...'),
(220065, 2, 0, 128371, 'Fhambar doesn''t find anything useful...'),
(220070, 0, 0, 100280, 'Rath-anu''tanos!'),
(220070, 1, 0, 114540, 'We must take care. The withered ones prowl this area, ravenous in their hunger for magic and flesh alike.'),
(220070, 2, 0, 100338, 'Such is the fate of nightborne who cannot drink of the Nightwell.'),
(220070, 3, 0, 101935, 'This is my fate as well... unless...'),
(220070, 4, 0, 143886, 'Look out!'),
(220070, 5, 0, 100340, 'E''rath omnas!'),
(220070, 6, 0, 100543, 'The barrier is being drained!'),
(220070, 8, 0, 100588, '<cough> I... need a moment...'),
(220070, 10, 0, 100589, 'There are so many...'),
(220070, 11, 0, 100590, 'Strange. Why do they not follow?'),
(220070, 12, 0, 100591, '<cough> I need to rest...'),
(220071, 0, 0, 112920, 'Come! The fal''dorei make their home in the ruins below.'),
(220071, 1, 0, 112921, 'Down. Follow the water.'),
(220071, 2, 0, 113688, 'Quickly, you must plant the seed!'),
(220071, 3, 0, 113689, 'Place it here, where it can drink of the leyline.'),
(220072, 0, 0, 108574, 'We shall use the garden entrance.'),
(220072, 1, 0, 108575, 'Enchanted masks. Simply don the mask, and a magical costume will envelop your body.'),
(220072, 2, 0, 108577, 'It should be enough to fool the other guests, but stay clear of the guards.'),
(220072, 3, 0, 108576, 'I will find Ly''leth. You stay out of trouble.'),
(220072, 4, 0, 108943, 'Just enjoy the party for a bit. You know... mingle.'),
(220075, 1, 0, 105903, 'Of course, First Arcanist.'),
(220075, 2, 0, 105904, 'Come, we can examine the feed from down here.'),
(220075, 3, 0, 105906, 'Do you have much experience with leyline energy? I should think not.'),
(220075, 4, 0, 105907, 'Allow me to educate you on the fundamentals.'),
(220075, 5, 0, 105909, 'Far below us, rivers of raw arcane power course throughout the land. The leylines are eternal, primal, and impossible to control.'),
(220075, 6, 0, 105911, 'However, just as one pulls thread from cotton, so too can we draw power from the leylines.'),
(220075, 7, 0, 105930, 'See here. This is the feed from Anora. And there are many others still lying dormant.'),
(220075, 8, 0, 105931, 'Restore them, and help us create a new locus of power here in Shal''Aran!'),
(220078, 2, 0, 114978, 'The courtyard you just left is open to visitors. From here forward, one of my staff must accompany you.'),
(220078, 3, 0, 114979, 'You can purchase souvenirs and gifts from Sylverin, my assistant. Perhaps you could do that on your way out?'),
(220078, 4, 0, 114980, 'This is our tasting pavilion. We serve only the finest varietals here - many of them enjoyed in the palace!'),
(220078, 5, 0, 114982, 'Feel free to try the samples we have available today. We will continue the tour when you are finished.'),
(220388, 0, 0, 133762, 'My scouts found the remains of Aggonar. We are in your debt, High Exarch. And yours, outlander.'),
(220388, 1, 0, 131498, 'There is a way. We will use what power we have to help you.'),
(220388, 2, 0, 131501, 'We have hidden. We have adapted. In our hour of need, this land still listens to our pleas.'),
(220389, 0, 0, 131495, 'The Legion will only fall if we stand together, chieftain. And right now, we have friends facing grave peril.'),
(220389, 1, 0, 131499, 'A tunnel! So this is how you have survived...'),
(220390, 0, 0, 129681, 'Enough!'),
(220390, 1, 0, 129683, 'Stay your weapons! The Prophet and his ally are not our foes.'),
(220390, 2, 0, 129692, 'We must stand together, all of us, if we are to have any chance of defeating the Legion.'),
(230018, 0, 0, 40630, 'For Stormwind!'),
(230018, 0, 1, 99993, 'For the king!'),
(230019, 0, 1, 113532, 'For the Warchief!'),
(231018, 1, 0, 85630, 'Hngh! Im...possible...'),
(231018, 2, 0, 85632, 'My power... has... failed you... $p.'),
(542159, 1, 0, 135104, 'Time to put an end to this!'),
(542160, 1, 0, 135104, 'Time to put an end to this!'),
(950116, 0, 0, 84590, 'Hold that front! Our work is nearly done!'),
(950116, 0, 1, 109609, 'Fight for Azeroth! For all you hold dear!'),
(950116, 0, 2, 113358, 'Quickly, we must slaughter these beasts before they do more harm!'),
(950116, 0, 3, 93605, 'You will not defeat us so easily!'),
(950116, 0, 4, 135754, 'For Azeroth!'),
(950116, 1, 0, 124010, 'This goes without saying, but be on your guard. I sense something... a presence I''ve not felt since...'),
(950116, 2, 0, 83385, 'We don''t have much more time! Everyone, get to high ground!'),
(950116, 3, 0, 92788, 'You''re safe. I''ve got you.'),
(950116, 4, 0, 109611, 'This is our world, not the Legion''s!');
